(385981, 32344, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really feel the emotion of desolation on this shot. I can''t take my eyes of her face. The color has a bit of a green feel to it that I don''t care for but thats my only nit pick.</td>', 'I really feel the emotion of desolation on this shot. I can''t take my eyes of her face. The color has a bit of a green feel to it that I don''t care for but thats my only nit pick.', '2003-08-13 02:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(385983, 32797, 9550, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. Would have been good for negative space also.</td>', 'Nice subject. Would have been good for negative space also.', '2003-08-13 03:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(385984, 33017, 3554, '<td valign="top">Cemetary  is a bit cliche for this challenge. Even so this does have a forlorn feeling to it. I think it would be better without the the red in the sky. That adds a bit of cheer to the shot which causes confusion of intent. You could have entered this in a contest for "Hope" just as easily. I''m also not too sure about the monument to the far right. It seems tilted at an odd angle, sort of out of place. If you really wanted to go with cemetary as your subject I think you were on the right track but could have had a better shot.</td>', 'Cemetary  is a bit cliche for this challenge. Even so this does have a forlorn feeling to it. I think it would be better without the the red in the sky. That adds a bit of cheer to the shot which causes confusion of intent. You could have entered this in a contest for "Hope" just as easily. I''m also not too sure about the monument to the far right. It seems tilted at an odd angle, sort of out of place. If you really wanted to go with cemetary as your subject I think you were on the right track but could have had a better shot.', '2003-08-13 03:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(385985, 33062, 3554, '<td valign="top">Interesting twist.</td>', 'Interesting twist.', '2003-08-13 03:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(385986, 33165, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would be a lot stronger without the person in it.</td>', 'I think this shot would be a lot stronger without the person in it.', '2003-08-13 03:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(385989, 32990, 3554, '<td valign="top">I feel hope in this shot more than desolation. I like how the sun''s rays are captured, but not for this challenge. Makes it too cheerful.</td>', 'I feel hope in this shot more than desolation. I like how the sun''s rays are captured, but not for this challenge. Makes it too cheerful.', '2003-08-13 03:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(385990, 32800, 3554, '<td valign="top">A dead rodent isn''t that compelling of a subject for me. I don''t really connect with this shot. The ant is a nice touch and the DOF works here, the softness adds to feeling of despair.</td>', 'A dead rodent isn''t that compelling of a subject for me. I don''t really connect with this shot. The ant is a nice touch and the DOF works here, the softness adds to feeling of despair.', '2003-08-13 03:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(385991, 33109, 3554, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I particularly like the shadow.  I think the shot is a bit too light to really communicate lonesomeness.</td>', 'Good idea, I particularly like the shadow.  I think the shot is a bit too light to really communicate lonesomeness.', '2003-08-13 03:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(385992, 33079, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful color sky...the tree looks like the same shape as a Praying Mantis.  i love the negative space, too!  well done!</td>', 'beautiful color sky...the tree looks like the same shape as a Praying Mantis.  i love the negative space, too!  well done!', '2003-08-13 03:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(385993, 32477, 3554, '<td valign="top">A lot of pixilation in this shot hurts it.</td>', 'A lot of pixilation in this shot hurts it.', '2003-08-13 03:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(385994, 33186, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured the clouds. They add drama and impending doom.</td>', 'I like how you captured the clouds. They add drama and impending doom.', '2003-08-13 03:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(385998, 33237, 10414, '<td valign="top">Absolutely brilliant!!!    9</td>', 'Absolutely brilliant!!!    9', '2003-08-13 03:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(386000, 33142, 3554, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get a sense of desolation from this shot. I mostly get "a day on the farm"</td>', 'I don''t really get a sense of desolation from this shot. I mostly get "a day on the farm"', '2003-08-13 03:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(386003, 33118, 3554, '<td valign="top">Anyone growing up sailing or on boats can relate to the pit in the stomach feeling of being grounded. The mist in the background is quite appropriate.</td>', 'Anyone growing up sailing or on boats can relate to the pit in the stomach feeling of being grounded. The mist in the background is quite appropriate.', '2003-08-13 03:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(386004, 33232, 3554, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, good use of light and contrast. I like the angle it was taken at with the focus being on the plants nearest the camera.</td>', 'Interesting subject, good use of light and contrast. I like the angle it was taken at with the focus being on the plants nearest the camera.', '2003-08-13 03:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(386006, 32658, 3554, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t like the effect on this photo, it comes across as bad resolution rather than artiistic interpretation. A dark pathway is a good idea for the challenge I just didn''t care for the execution.</td>', 'I personally don''t like the effect on this photo, it comes across as bad resolution rather than artiistic interpretation. A dark pathway is a good idea for the challenge I just didn''t care for the execution.', '2003-08-13 03:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(386008, 32895, 7151, '<td valign="top">I suspect you''ll have a tough time with this title.  I wouldn''t have recognized the reference if I hadn''t done a google on desolation this afternoon and turned up several hits on the song.  And, to be honest, even having read the lyrics, I''m not sure I get the link with this shot, but I don''t really know the song that well, so maybe it''s just me.  The picture is OK, but I don''t get a strong sense of desolation from it.  Composition is decent, focus is good, B&amp;W is OK but predictable.</td>', 'I suspect you''ll have a tough time with this title.  I wouldn''t have recognized the reference if I hadn''t done a google on desolation this afternoon and turned up several hits on the song.  And, to be honest, even having read the lyrics, I''m not sure I get the link with this shot, but I don''t really know the song that well, so maybe it''s just me.  The picture is OK, but I don''t get a strong sense of desolation from it.  Composition is decent, focus is good, B&W is OK but predictable.', '2003-08-13 03:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(386010, 32407, 10848, '<td valign="top">stirs the emotions</td>', 'stirs the emotions', '2003-08-13 03:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(386011, 32814, 3554, '<td valign="top">A better title for this might have been "unemployed" Money desolation seems like an odd title. I can relate better to being unemployed or recently graduated or something.</td>', 'A better title for this might have been "unemployed" Money desolation seems like an odd title. I can relate better to being unemployed or recently graduated or something.', '2003-08-13 03:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
