(386016, 32699, 9168, '<td valign="top">Its a good shot, but the skull looks a to staged.  If it were on its side and half buried in the dirt, I think it would looked more natural.</td>', 'Its a good shot, but the skull looks a to staged.  If it were on its side and half buried in the dirt, I think it would looked more natural.', '2003-08-13 03:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
