(386036, 32897, 10594, '<td valign="top">I like the subject (poker), and the idea that having no more outs is a condition of desolation, but the composition is not great - the background is distracting. The lighting and focus are off, too, and the reflection from the flash on the watch and in the eye doesn''t help.</td>', 'I like the subject (poker), and the idea that having no more outs is a condition of desolation, but the composition is not great - the background is distracting. The lighting and focus are off, too, and the reflection from the flash on the watch and in the eye doesn''t help.', '2003-08-13 03:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(386038, 33035, 10594, '<td valign="top">Great title, and a nice shot.</td>', 'Great title, and a nice shot.', '2003-08-13 03:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
