(386113, 33109, 6388, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few shots that actually comes close to feeling desolate to me.  Very nice job with your camera and your dictionary :)  I''d like to see this in DPCPrints later...I''m a bit fan of it.  AZ?UT?NV?</td>', 'This is one of the few shots that actually comes close to feeling desolate to me.  Very nice job with your camera and your dictionary :)  I''d like to see this in DPCPrints later...I''m a bit fan of it.  AZ?UT?NV?', '2003-08-13 05:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
