(386146, 33109, 4258, '<td valign="top">Good composition as per rule of thirds, the harsh shadow of the stump enhances  the picture as does the generally high contrast.</td>', 'Good composition as per rule of thirds, the harsh shadow of the stump enhances  the picture as does the generally high contrast.', '2003-08-13 06:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
