(386155, 33193, 10848, '<td valign="top">The title just adds to the meaning of this picture...love the old car and the color is excellent...great vision! Good job!</td>', 'The title just adds to the meaning of this picture...love the old car and the color is excellent...great vision! Good job!', '2003-08-13 06:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(386157, 33051, 8522, '<td valign="top">This border is so HUGE it''s ridiculous. And it doesn''t hide the unflattering shadow. 4</td>', 'This border is so HUGE it''s ridiculous. And it doesn''t hide the unflattering shadow. 4', '2003-08-13 06:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(386159, 33176, 10694, '<td valign="top">A little too dark. Cant make it out well.</td>', 'A little too dark. Cant make it out well.', '2003-08-13 06:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(386162, 33017, 10848, '<td valign="top">gorgeous</td>', 'gorgeous', '2003-08-13 07:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(386164, 33182, 8522, '<td valign="top">My favourite shot this challenge... although not the highest scoring. The composition doesn''t quite work for me... I don''t like the way the picture has been split in half vertically. Maybe the pictures should take up more of the frame? There''s also a strange shadow on the left at the base of the wall.<br/>However, this is a really clever concept... I love this take on desolation where you are alone in the present because you can''t drag yourself out of the past. Definitely the most creative shot this challenge. I had toyed with the idea of taking a shot of someone in a corner, but without your concept it would have been very poor. I think it could have benefited from some sharpening. Effective lighting. Well done... 9</td>', 'My favourite shot this challenge... although not the highest scoring. The composition doesn''t quite work for me... I don''t like the way the picture has been split in half vertically. Maybe the pictures should take up more of the frame? There''s also a strange shadow on the left at the base of the wall.However, this is a really clever concept... I love this take on desolation where you are alone in the present because you can''t drag yourself out of the past. Definitely the most creative shot this challenge. I had toyed with the idea of taking a shot of someone in a corner, but without your concept it would have been very poor. I think it could have benefited from some sharpening. Effective lighting. Well done... 9', '2003-08-13 07:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(386165, 33004, 10883, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy and also overexposed to the sides.  Other than that this is a nice picture which captures the mood quite well.</td>', 'A bit grainy and also overexposed to the sides.  Other than that this is a nice picture which captures the mood quite well.', '2003-08-13 07:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(386166, 32582, 10848, '<td valign="top">this is hilarious...seen quite a few of these regions in my day...</td>', 'this is hilarious...seen quite a few of these regions in my day...', '2003-08-13 07:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(386169, 33119, 8522, '<td valign="top">Incredible picture, very hard-hitting. The babies really add to the power of the shot, you''ve not held back here! Superb composition, great textures, very sharp... technically this is spot-on. It''s very odd to see a dead mammal with it''s legs straight up in the air... there''s a black humour about it like a cartoon. I think that''s what makes the shot so powerful, the juxtaposition of humour with the angst of the dead, abandoned babies. However, although I think this captures an emotion near to desolation, it''s not 100% there for me. 9</td>', 'Incredible picture, very hard-hitting. The babies really add to the power of the shot, you''ve not held back here! Superb composition, great textures, very sharp... technically this is spot-on. It''s very odd to see a dead mammal with it''s legs straight up in the air... there''s a black humour about it like a cartoon. I think that''s what makes the shot so powerful, the juxtaposition of humour with the angst of the dead, abandoned babies. However, although I think this captures an emotion near to desolation, it''s not 100% there for me. 9', '2003-08-13 07:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(386173, 33042, 8522, '<td valign="top">Ver simple, effective composition. The sepia toning works well here. Rule of thirds has definitely been your friend here. Very nice, flat sky. 9</td>', 'Ver simple, effective composition. The sepia toning works well here. Rule of thirds has definitely been your friend here. Very nice, flat sky. 9', '2003-08-13 07:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(386175, 32680, 4258, '<td valign="top">Why in your perception is this a desolate picture - just because it is not tourist season?</td>', 'Why in your perception is this a desolate picture - just because it is not tourist season?', '2003-08-13 07:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(386178, 33213, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good picture!  This picture works well in b&amp;w</td>', 'Good picture!  This picture works well in b&w', '2003-08-13 07:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(386179, 32944, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good picture, maybe a tad to much cropped at the left.</td>', 'Good picture, maybe a tad to much cropped at the left.', '2003-08-13 07:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(386182, 33045, 8522, '<td valign="top">An absolutely gorgeous photo, beautiful lighting (presumably the tree is lit by a very nice sunset), great range of colours in the sky with very effective saturation. Nice horizon. Unfortunately, it doesn''t really communicate desolation to me, as all the colours are so rich (especially the gold light on the tree). However, score = 8 (10 for a suitable challenge).</td>', 'An absolutely gorgeous photo, beautiful lighting (presumably the tree is lit by a very nice sunset), great range of colours in the sky with very effective saturation. Nice horizon. Unfortunately, it doesn''t really communicate desolation to me, as all the colours are so rich (especially the gold light on the tree). However, score = 8 (10 for a suitable challenge).', '2003-08-13 07:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(386184, 33190, 7689, '<td valign="top">what''s "desolation" here?</td>', 'what''s "desolation" here?', '2003-08-13 07:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(386186, 32760, 7689, '<td valign="top">looks like too grainy</td>', 'looks like too grainy', '2003-08-13 07:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(386190, 32855, 9109, '<td valign="top">Usually I turn aside centered subjects but this one works well for me.</td>', 'Usually I turn aside centered subjects but this one works well for me.', '2003-08-13 07:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(386195, 32693, 9109, '<td valign="top">Nice view but it looks more "serene" than "desolate" to me.</td>', 'Nice view but it looks more "serene" than "desolate" to me.', '2003-08-13 07:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(386197, 33068, 9109, '<td valign="top">Too dark or not enough contrast, I think. I can''t see much detail about the house.</td>', 'Too dark or not enough contrast, I think. I can''t see much detail about the house.', '2003-08-13 07:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(386200, 33027, 9109, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot, but the ground is a little dark for me.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot, but the ground is a little dark for me.', '2003-08-13 07:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(386202, 33228, 9854, '<td valign="top">What a sad state of disrepair, in sharp contrast to the flowers.</td>', 'What a sad state of disrepair, in sharp contrast to the flowers.', '2003-08-13 08:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(386203, 33202, 9854, '<td valign="top">Definitely not for the faint hearted. Must have been scary to take this one. Would have had more of the wow impact if the image were sharper.</td>', 'Definitely not for the faint hearted. Must have been scary to take this one. Would have had more of the wow impact if the image were sharper.', '2003-08-13 08:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(386205, 32396, 9854, '<td valign="top">What sadness.</td>', 'What sadness.', '2003-08-13 08:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(386206, 33042, 9854, '<td valign="top">Neat. But somehow, the blurred details beyond the house is a bit frustrating. Artisticlly, I''d rather see it as land or sea, not something in between.</td>', 'Neat. But somehow, the blurred details beyond the house is a bit frustrating. Artisticlly, I''d rather see it as land or sea, not something in between.', '2003-08-13 08:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(386208, 32769, 8522, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of those shots that only has an emotional impact for the person who took it. Technically not the best of shots, out of focus, unflattering colour cast, uninspired composition, bad lighting. Better luck next time! 2</td>', 'I think this is one of those shots that only has an emotional impact for the person who took it. Technically not the best of shots, out of focus, unflattering colour cast, uninspired composition, bad lighting. Better luck next time! 2', '2003-08-13 08:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(386209, 33210, 9854, '<td valign="top">This pic really evokes a sad feeling. There''s deinitely an interesting story here.</td>', 'This pic really evokes a sad feeling. There''s deinitely an interesting story here.', '2003-08-13 08:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(386210, 32496, 8522, '<td valign="top">Hopelessness but not desolation. This picture is full of life!<br/>It''s a pretty good picture but just doesn''t meet the challenge I''m afraid! 4</td>', 'Hopelessness but not desolation. This picture is full of life!It''s a pretty good picture but just doesn''t meet the challenge I''m afraid! 4', '2003-08-13 08:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(386211, 33184, 9854, '<td valign="top">Even the car''s front looks like a sad face.</td>', 'Even the car''s front looks like a sad face.', '2003-08-13 08:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(386213, 32718, 9854, '<td valign="top">Reminds me so much of the abandoned warehouses of the Northeast, especially the little towns that seem to have been sapped of young blood. What sadness.</td>', 'Reminds me so much of the abandoned warehouses of the Northeast, especially the little towns that seem to have been sapped of young blood. What sadness.', '2003-08-13 08:17:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(386221, 33101, 10694, '<td valign="top">Cool. Looks scary. I like this a lot. Maybe needs too stand out more somehow. Dont mind thats its central.</td>', 'Cool. Looks scary. I like this a lot. Maybe needs too stand out more somehow. Dont mind thats its central.', '2003-08-13 08:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(386222, 33201, 9854, '<td valign="top">Wow. The peeling paint, the empty building, the brown weeds, the faded grafitti create a powerful emotional vacuum that trivializes the ricketty love note on the dilapidated sign board.</td>', 'Wow. The peeling paint, the empty building, the brown weeds, the faded grafitti create a powerful emotional vacuum that trivializes the ricketty love note on the dilapidated sign board.', '2003-08-13 08:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(386223, 33213, 10739, '<td valign="top">It''s too bright. I think incresing the contrast will produce a more dramatic effect</td>', 'It''s too bright. I think incresing the contrast will produce a more dramatic effect', '2003-08-13 08:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(386224, 33005, 10739, '<td valign="top">Be very carefull with this kind of pictures. In this case, the face of the man tell me much more about desolation that the fact he has no legs</td>', 'Be very carefull with this kind of pictures. In this case, the face of the man tell me much more about desolation that the fact he has no legs', '2003-08-13 08:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(386226, 33221, 10739, '<td valign="top">very nice picture. A bit more depth of field. Though not too much desolation</td>', 'very nice picture. A bit more depth of field. Though not too much desolation', '2003-08-13 08:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(386227, 32939, 7689, '<td valign="top">Although a good composition, but the image is little out of focus. The brightness is on the higher side and contrast does''nt seem right. Maybe a fill-in-flash would have removed the dark shadows from the image and have made it much better. <br/> <br/>DOF ... what happened to it.... considering that you wanted to highlight the background. Overall the picture is little weak in clarity and focus but I guess a B/W / sephia tone of the same image would have looked better.</td>', 'Although a good composition, but the image is little out of focus. The brightness is on the higher side and contrast does''nt seem right. Maybe a fill-in-flash would have removed the dark shadows from the image and have made it much better.  DOF ... what happened to it.... considering that you wanted to highlight the background. Overall the picture is little weak in clarity and focus but I guess a B/W / sephia tone of the same image would have looked better.', '2003-08-13 08:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(386228, 32752, 10739, '<td valign="top">Is very noisy (too much zoom or compresion). Really hard to distinguish the details</td>', 'Is very noisy (too much zoom or compresion). Really hard to distinguish the details', '2003-08-13 08:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(386229, 33016, 10739, '<td valign="top">To really show solitude, make the boat look very little in the huge lake</td>', 'To really show solitude, make the boat look very little in the huge lake', '2003-08-13 08:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(386230, 32824, 7689, '<td valign="top">I am sure it does go somewhere.</td>', 'I am sure it does go somewhere.', '2003-08-13 08:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(386231, 32496, 10739, '<td valign="top">This shows more fear than desolation</td>', 'This shows more fear than desolation', '2003-08-13 08:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(386232, 32699, 10739, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Good interpretation of the challenge</td>', 'Nice picture. Good interpretation of the challenge', '2003-08-13 08:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(386234, 32936, 10739, '<td valign="top">The landscape is good to show desolation, but I would have shown the picnic table as a secondary subject in the picture</td>', 'The landscape is good to show desolation, but I would have shown the picnic table as a secondary subject in the picture', '2003-08-13 08:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(386235, 33072, 10832, '<td valign="top">To me you have conveyed what my definition of desolation is.</td>', 'To me you have conveyed what my definition of desolation is.', '2003-08-13 08:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(386238, 33086, 10739, '<td valign="top">This is a very difficult picture. It is a snap of two drug addicts, but it does not transmit emotions</td>', 'This is a very difficult picture. It is a snap of two drug addicts, but it does not transmit emotions', '2003-08-13 08:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(386245, 33073, 9972, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. It is certainly desolate. Strange the way the sky fades to black towards the top of the pic.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. It is certainly desolate. Strange the way the sky fades to black towards the top of the pic.', '2003-08-13 09:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(386246, 32344, 8522, '<td valign="top">This shot makes me uncomfortable for two reasons:<br/>1: Street beggars make me feel guilty if I walk past and don''t give anything!<br/>2: I feel like the photographer has exploited the woman''s condition... or people who are in that condition. There''s something about the shot that brings out a feeling of pity rather than a feeling of empathy. It''s hard to put my finger on why... maybe it''s the chemistry between the subject and the photographer. There is certainly a look of desperation on her face but (and maybe it''s got something to do with the fact that we are being asked to empathise with the owner of the bag who is exiting to our left) there is in my mind a seperation between ourselves and that feeling.  Interesting shot though, and I like the sharpness in her face contrasted with the motion blur of her cup. 8</td>', 'This shot makes me uncomfortable for two reasons:1: Street beggars make me feel guilty if I walk past and don''t give anything!2: I feel like the photographer has exploited the woman''s condition... or people who are in that condition. There''s something about the shot that brings out a feeling of pity rather than a feeling of empathy. It''s hard to put my finger on why... maybe it''s the chemistry between the subject and the photographer. There is certainly a look of desperation on her face but (and maybe it''s got something to do with the fact that we are being asked to empathise with the owner of the bag who is exiting to our left) there is in my mind a seperation between ourselves and that feeling.  Interesting shot though, and I like the sharpness in her face contrasted with the motion blur of her cup. 8', '2003-08-13 09:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(386247, 32783, 8522, '<td valign="top">Poignant shot, the girl''s expression is very effective. Could perhaps do with some more sharpness. Shame the highlights are blown out. Great composition. 8</td>', 'Poignant shot, the girl''s expression is very effective. Could perhaps do with some more sharpness. Shame the highlights are blown out. Great composition. 8', '2003-08-13 09:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(386249, 33186, 8522, '<td valign="top">Superb sky, intereresting silhouettes on the horizon. I''d have prefered a more wide-angle perspective for desolation though. The touches of blue are ver effective. 8</td>', 'Superb sky, intereresting silhouettes on the horizon. I''d have prefered a more wide-angle perspective for desolation though. The touches of blue are ver effective. 8', '2003-08-13 09:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(386250, 33179, 9643, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of the overgrown weeds and the dried branches in the tree in your composition.</td>', 'I like the inclusion of the overgrown weeds and the dried branches in the tree in your composition.', '2003-08-13 09:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(386251, 32582, 9854, '<td valign="top">ahm, interesting take. I don''t like the white glare, though. Better start donning a wig or just go bald all the way.</td>', 'ahm, interesting take. I don''t like the white glare, though. Better start donning a wig or just go bald all the way.', '2003-08-13 09:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(386253, 33151, 8229, '<td valign="top">like this shot a lot!</td>', 'like this shot a lot!', '2003-08-13 09:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(386254, 32817, 9643, '<td valign="top">The angle of this shot is ideal and the subject absolutely appropriate.  I, personally, would love to see it in color</td>', 'The angle of this shot is ideal and the subject absolutely appropriate.  I, personally, would love to see it in color', '2003-08-13 09:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(386256, 33165, 9854, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really evoke desolation. The guy looks more like a happy tourist here.</td>', 'Doesn''t really evoke desolation. The guy looks more like a happy tourist here.', '2003-08-13 09:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(386257, 32496, 8229, '<td valign="top">neat!</td>', 'neat!', '2003-08-13 09:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(386258, 32671, 8229, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo!</td>', 'beautiful photo!', '2003-08-13 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(386259, 32814, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oh, I know that feeling at the moment!<br/>Nicely taken shot, well composed, effective background. The choice of smart clothes + tie is great... to me it says that this person is stuck in the loop of a 9-5 existence because they think they never have enough money. It speaks to me of family, mortgage, travel, etc. Great picture! 8</td>', 'Oh, I know that feeling at the moment!Nicely taken shot, well composed, effective background. The choice of smart clothes + tie is great... to me it says that this person is stuck in the loop of a 9-5 existence because they think they never have enough money. It speaks to me of family, mortgage, travel, etc. Great picture! 8', '2003-08-13 09:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(386260, 33216, 9854, '<td valign="top">Wow. When and where was this? This should have been in the news ... it''s destruction and desolation in biblical proportions.</td>', 'Wow. When and where was this? This should have been in the news ... it''s destruction and desolation in biblical proportions.', '2003-08-13 09:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(386263, 33048, 8229, '<td valign="top">great, great depthnof field in this shot. i love the emphasis on the chain. this one pic can tell many stories.  great job!!</td>', 'great, great depthnof field in this shot. i love the emphasis on the chain. this one pic can tell many stories.  great job!!', '2003-08-13 09:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(386264, 32932, 8229, '<td valign="top">quite creative!</td>', 'quite creative!', '2003-08-13 09:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(386265, 32321, 9643, '<td valign="top">You really did achieve an emotion here.  I can almost feel and smell the dankness of this place.  It makes me very curious about the procurement of those dead bats.</td>', 'You really did achieve an emotion here.  I can almost feel and smell the dankness of this place.  It makes me very curious about the procurement of those dead bats.', '2003-08-13 09:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(386266, 33197, 8229, '<td valign="top">there is something so serene about this photo.  great shot!</td>', 'there is something so serene about this photo.  great shot!', '2003-08-13 09:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(386267, 32989, 8229, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2003-08-13 09:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(386268, 33194, 9972, '<td valign="top">I think this is a top shot. Definately desolation here. Maybe try a different angle. I would like to see what this looks like not in B&amp;W. I think it still wouldve worked.</td>', 'I think this is a top shot. Definately desolation here. Maybe try a different angle. I would like to see what this looks like not in B&W. I think it still wouldve worked.', '2003-08-13 09:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(386269, 32760, 8522, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this photo won''t get the placing it deserves, but I hope I''m wrong. The highlights are blown out, the picture is noisy, the skin tone is unflattering, there''s an orange colour cast, it''s blurry... but I LOVE all these things! They look intentional to me, and it creates a very effective mood. Your model is great, very photogenic and just right for this shot. I think the red hair and freckles give a waif-like vulnerable feel to her. 8</td>', 'I have a feeling this photo won''t get the placing it deserves, but I hope I''m wrong. The highlights are blown out, the picture is noisy, the skin tone is unflattering, there''s an orange colour cast, it''s blurry... but I LOVE all these things! They look intentional to me, and it creates a very effective mood. Your model is great, very photogenic and just right for this shot. I think the red hair and freckles give a waif-like vulnerable feel to her. 8', '2003-08-13 09:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(386270, 33086, 8229, '<td valign="top">how very sad.  this pic really depicts the theme.  was this a real shot or staged?</td>', 'how very sad.  this pic really depicts the theme.  was this a real shot or staged?', '2003-08-13 09:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(386271, 32769, 9854, '<td valign="top">I''m giving the same note as the one I left for the other guy. Wear a wig or just go bald. Please.</td>', 'I''m giving the same note as the one I left for the other guy. Wear a wig or just go bald. Please.', '2003-08-13 09:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(386273, 32993, 9643, '<td valign="top">As a retired teacher of Literature I especially appreciate the allusion.  In terms of the photograph I really like the compositon.</td>', 'As a retired teacher of Literature I especially appreciate the allusion.  In terms of the photograph I really like the compositon.', '2003-08-13 09:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(386275, 33216, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, very effective. Just a couple of things bother me... the composition seems a little off to me...  the house is too near the corner for my taste.<br/>The light tones are very effective, but they''re just a tad too blown out in the top left. These are fairly small things that bother me though. 8</td>', 'Interesting shot, very effective. Just a couple of things bother me... the composition seems a little off to me...  the house is too near the corner for my taste.The light tones are very effective, but they''re just a tad too blown out in the top left. These are fairly small things that bother me though. 8', '2003-08-13 09:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(386276, 33027, 9643, '<td valign="top">What a nice picture.  The clean lines and the sepia makes it very appealing.</td>', 'What a nice picture.  The clean lines and the sepia makes it very appealing.', '2003-08-13 09:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(386277, 33086, 9854, '<td valign="top">What a sorry state we have here. It''s quite distubingly an 8.</td>', 'What a sorry state we have here. It''s quite distubingly an 8.', '2003-08-13 09:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(386278, 33200, 7263, '<td valign="top">interesting building, good eye. shame it''s slightly out of focus</td>', 'interesting building, good eye. shame it''s slightly out of focus', '2003-08-13 09:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(386279, 33035, 9854, '<td valign="top">Abandoned houses really touch a nerve in me. This one''s exceptionally sad, obvously in stark contrast wth its past.</td>', 'Abandoned houses really touch a nerve in me. This one''s exceptionally sad, obvously in stark contrast wth its past.', '2003-08-13 09:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(386280, 32797, 8229, '<td valign="top">very unique piece.  i like it a lot; it says so much!!</td>', 'very unique piece.  i like it a lot; it says so much!!', '2003-08-13 09:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(386281, 32606, 9643, '<td valign="top">Your model sure has the right expression and demeanor.  The white background detracts from the crumbled asphalt and cracked foundation of the building.  I might have had him sit down so you could eliminate the siding on the building.</td>', 'Your model sure has the right expression and demeanor.  The white background detracts from the crumbled asphalt and cracked foundation of the building.  I might have had him sit down so you could eliminate the siding on the building.', '2003-08-13 09:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(386282, 32815, 8229, '<td valign="top">this is too funny!! quite creative</td>', 'this is too funny!! quite creative', '2003-08-13 09:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(386283, 33082, 9854, '<td valign="top">haha. reminds me of my dorm days. The only thing missing now is the plate of an unfinished pizza slice.</td>', 'haha. reminds me of my dorm days. The only thing missing now is the plate of an unfinished pizza slice.', '2003-08-13 09:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(386284, 32947, 8229, '<td valign="top">yes, there are many untold stories in this face.  beautiful shot!</td>', 'yes, there are many untold stories in this face.  beautiful shot!', '2003-08-13 09:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(386285, 32949, 10768, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  The lines and shading of the  tunnel draws the eyes to your focal point.</td>', 'I like the composition.  The lines and shading of the  tunnel draws the eyes to your focal point.', '2003-08-13 09:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(386287, 33045, 6740, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  I love landscape photos but even if I didn''t, I could not stop myself from giving this a 9, maybe even a 10.</td>', 'Excellent!  I love landscape photos but even if I didn''t, I could not stop myself from giving this a 9, maybe even a 10.', '2003-08-13 09:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(386288, 32832, 9643, '<td valign="top">I like the light in the foreground because it makes me almost feel the approaching storm.  The light has an eerie yellow cast that I remember from a tornado many years ago.</td>', 'I like the light in the foreground because it makes me almost feel the approaching storm.  The light has an eerie yellow cast that I remember from a tornado many years ago.', '2003-08-13 09:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(386289, 32797, 9854, '<td valign="top">Now that''s disturbing.</td>', 'Now that''s disturbing.', '2003-08-13 09:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(386291, 33225, 9643, '<td valign="top">Too bad it wasn''t pouring down rain on this fellow.</td>', 'Too bad it wasn''t pouring down rain on this fellow.', '2003-08-13 09:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(386292, 33176, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well this pic belongs to one of three people I know :-) Whoever it is, good one! I was wondering if I''d get to see this pier again - 9.</td>', 'Well this pic belongs to one of three people I know :-) Whoever it is, good one! I was wondering if I''d get to see this pier again - 9.', '2003-08-13 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(386293, 32943, 9643, '<td valign="top">This speaks to my spirit too much to be desolate</td>', 'This speaks to my spirit too much to be desolate', '2003-08-13 09:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(386294, 33062, 6740, '<td valign="top">If you played within the rules, well done. How did you get this done?<br/>I''d like to know how myself.</td>', 'If you played within the rules, well done. How did you get this done?I''d like to know how myself.', '2003-08-13 09:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(386295, 33230, 6624, '<td valign="top">this certainly meets the challenge, although I admit to loving this landscape and finding it full of life (I think I am totally a macro person)  nice image</td>', 'this certainly meets the challenge, although I admit to loving this landscape and finding it full of life (I think I am totally a macro person)  nice image', '2003-08-13 09:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(386296, 32344, 9643, '<td valign="top">Thank goodness for photos of the homeless to keep reminding us to care.  Good choice of subject (woman).</td>', 'Thank goodness for photos of the homeless to keep reminding us to care.  Good choice of subject (woman).', '2003-08-13 09:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(386301, 33155, 6624, '<td valign="top">personal opinion is that there is too much out of focus and I am not clear about the overall concept</td>', 'personal opinion is that there is too much out of focus and I am not clear about the overall concept', '2003-08-13 09:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(386302, 33172, 6624, '<td valign="top">this year has been so lush with all the rain that it is hard to find desolate and empty space</td>', 'this year has been so lush with all the rain that it is hard to find desolate and empty space', '2003-08-13 09:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(386305, 32725, 6624, '<td valign="top">too much black to work for me personally</td>', 'too much black to work for me personally', '2003-08-13 09:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(386309, 32671, 9643, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t care for framing very much but in this case it really gives great contrast to the tone of this picture.  The compositon is great!  and I like the title too.</td>', 'Normally I don''t care for framing very much but in this case it really gives great contrast to the tone of this picture.  The compositon is great!  and I like the title too.', '2003-08-13 09:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(386310, 33139, 6624, '<td valign="top">certainly it was devastating</td>', 'certainly it was devastating', '2003-08-13 09:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(386312, 32944, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice interplay between desolation and peace..a wonderful spot</td>', 'nice interplay between desolation and peace..a wonderful spot', '2003-08-13 09:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(386313, 33130, 6624, '<td valign="top">desolate from the flower''s point of view for sure</td>', 'desolate from the flower''s point of view for sure', '2003-08-13 09:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(386314, 32990, 6624, '<td valign="top">for me this is not desolation but the light is nice and the balance is nice</td>', 'for me this is not desolation but the light is nice and the balance is nice', '2003-08-13 09:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(386315, 32682, 9643, '<td valign="top">Boy does this bring back memories.  I was raised in a tarpaper house.  You really caught the feeling of abandonment with this photo.</td>', 'Boy does this bring back memories.  I was raised in a tarpaper house.  You really caught the feeling of abandonment with this photo.', '2003-08-13 09:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
