(386509, 33139, 9690, '<td valign="top">good shot.  Like the effect it gives when shooting at an angle.  seems a litte dark though in a couple of areas</td>', 'good shot.  Like the effect it gives when shooting at an angle.  seems a litte dark though in a couple of areas', '2003-08-13 12:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(386510, 32407, 9690, '<td valign="top">great shot.  The art on the wall tells me that once life was abundant here, but now it is gone.  Great idea and shot for this contest!</td>', 'great shot.  The art on the wall tells me that once life was abundant here, but now it is gone.  Great idea and shot for this contest!', '2003-08-13 12:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(386511, 33246, 9690, '<td valign="top">great color!  Good sillouhette</td>', 'great color!  Good sillouhette', '2003-08-13 12:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(386512, 33162, 772, '<td valign="top">I can''t really judge this as a photo... it may have been a photo at one point though :)</td>', 'I can''t really judge this as a photo... it may have been a photo at one point though :)', '2003-08-13 12:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(386514, 33101, 9690, '<td valign="top">seems kinda fuzzy</td>', 'seems kinda fuzzy', '2003-08-13 12:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(386515, 33026, 9643, '<td valign="top">BW good choice for this.  I like the angle of the shot and I especially like the double track because I think it really adds to the theme of the photo.</td>', 'BW good choice for this.  I like the angle of the shot and I especially like the double track because I think it really adds to the theme of the photo.', '2003-08-13 12:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(386517, 33101, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a really neat subject... the tonal range is fairly weak though... i think the a different exposure method could strengthen this shot quite a bit :)</td>', 'this is a really neat subject... the tonal range is fairly weak though... i think the a different exposure method could strengthen this shot quite a bit :)', '2003-08-13 12:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(386518, 33045, 10151, '<td valign="top">WoW!!  This is a great shot!  The colors are amazing and letting the tree go off the left works very well with the rest of the comp.  Great work!</td>', 'WoW!!  This is a great shot!  The colors are amazing and letting the tree go off the left works very well with the rest of the comp.  Great work!', '2003-08-13 12:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(386520, 32937, 9643, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot and a rare catch with the moon and night mist.  I really like it but I can''t feel desolation - too inspiring for that for me.  Tough decision about leaving in the speed sign  because I agree with the greater need for part of that tree on the edge.  Points for a good picture.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot and a rare catch with the moon and night mist.  I really like it but I can''t feel desolation - too inspiring for that for me.  Tough decision about leaving in the speed sign  because I agree with the greater need for part of that tree on the edge.  Points for a good picture.', '2003-08-13 12:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(386521, 33216, 8268, '<td valign="top">interesting idea..  it looks a little bit artificial yet.. but nice idea.. =)</td>', 'interesting idea..  it looks a little bit artificial yet.. but nice idea.. =)', '2003-08-13 12:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(386522, 32818, 10151, '<td valign="top">Good use of B&amp;W, the tonal range is good.  I also like the top frame of branches. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Good use of B&W, the tonal range is good.  I also like the top frame of branches. Very nice shot.', '2003-08-13 12:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(386523, 33065, 9690, '<td valign="top">good shot</td>', 'good shot', '2003-08-13 12:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(386524, 32668, 9690, '<td valign="top">good shot... seems a little one dimensional.  Did you try black and white to see how it would look??</td>', 'good shot... seems a little one dimensional.  Did you try black and white to see how it would look??', '2003-08-13 12:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(386525, 33199, 9643, '<td valign="top">What a great tree!</td>', 'What a great tree!', '2003-08-13 12:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(386526, 33073, 9690, '<td valign="top">good subject for this challenge</td>', 'good subject for this challenge', '2003-08-13 12:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(386527, 32937, 9690, '<td valign="top">its very harsh.  this looks more like it was at 2 pm</td>', 'its very harsh.  this looks more like it was at 2 pm', '2003-08-13 12:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(386528, 33130, 9690, '<td valign="top">good shot.  nice study in contrast</td>', 'good shot.  nice study in contrast', '2003-08-13 12:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
