(386555, 33086, 2937, '<td valign="top">This is a very tough, but strong picture. I think our world is desolate, indeed. Thank you for showing this. Baldur</td>', 'This is a very tough, but strong picture. I think our world is desolate, indeed. Thank you for showing this. Baldur', '2003-08-13 12:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(386556, 33202, 8268, '<td valign="top">wow.. nice photo.. its the 2nd photo that gives me the "desolation" message..  technically i love the sepia tone, nice contrast..  if i could recommend something.. may be it would be to add a indirect subject on the floor.. an used object..something that reflects the youth and society perdition, etc..</td>', 'wow.. nice photo.. its the 2nd photo that gives me the "desolation" message..  technically i love the sepia tone, nice contrast..  if i could recommend something.. may be it would be to add a indirect subject on the floor.. an used object..something that reflects the youth and society perdition, etc..', '2003-08-13 12:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(386557, 32644, 10151, '<td valign="top">Seems a little washed out to me...otherwise a good shot.</td>', 'Seems a little washed out to me...otherwise a good shot.', '2003-08-13 12:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(386558, 32797, 8268, '<td valign="top">wow..  nice concept.. i can feel the desolation of our actual society..  the "modern" emptiness..   congratutlations..</td>', 'wow..  nice concept.. i can feel the desolation of our actual society..  the "modern" emptiness..   congratutlations..', '2003-08-13 12:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(386559, 33119, 2978, '<td valign="top">I have a mixed feeling about this. Sad but true, I suppose. I thought it was just another ''eeewww'' shot but you''ve made the point. Strong subject for me.</td>', 'I have a mixed feeling about this. Sad but true, I suppose. I thought it was just another ''eeewww'' shot but you''ve made the point. Strong subject for me.', '2003-08-13 12:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(386560, 33045, 2937, '<td valign="top">Wow, super great colours!! Doesn''t look very much desolated to me, but I like it! Well done.</td>', 'Wow, super great colours!! Doesn''t look very much desolated to me, but I like it! Well done.', '2003-08-13 12:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(386562, 32496, 9690, '<td valign="top">great pic!  How was it done???</td>', 'great pic!  How was it done???', '2003-08-13 12:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(386564, 32994, 10643, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I think she''s too close to the corner. the real desolation is in her face and in the dry brush on the left. lowering the frame a little would help.</td>', 'I like this, but I think she''s too close to the corner. the real desolation is in her face and in the dry brush on the left. lowering the frame a little would help.', '2003-08-13 12:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(386566, 32644, 10643, '<td valign="top">The blue color and the shafts of sunlight show hope to me, not desolation. I get more a feeling of renewal here than destruction. It''s an attractive shot, though.</td>', 'The blue color and the shafts of sunlight show hope to me, not desolation. I get more a feeling of renewal here than destruction. It''s an attractive shot, though.', '2003-08-13 12:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(386567, 32802, 2978, '<td valign="top">Good job. The composition works well. It tell the desolation without having to take the whole building. And I like the colour too.</td>', 'Good job. The composition works well. It tell the desolation without having to take the whole building. And I like the colour too.', '2003-08-13 12:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(386568, 33017, 7543, '<td valign="top">There seems to be some distorion due to over sharpening it (see around the cross). The colors are amazing, and the perspective is great.</td>', 'There seems to be some distorion due to over sharpening it (see around the cross). The colors are amazing, and the perspective is great.', '2003-08-13 12:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(386569, 33109, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great shot, fits the challenge like a glove. NeatImage might do something for the sky, but on the other hand, it looks good a bit grainy on this beautiful B/W. My favorite yet in this challenge</td>', 'Great shot, fits the challenge like a glove. NeatImage might do something for the sky, but on the other hand, it looks good a bit grainy on this beautiful B/W. My favorite yet in this challenge', '2003-08-13 12:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(386570, 32516, 2978, '<td valign="top">I like it. Fantastic job. The composition of the skull is just right for the frame and using B&amp;W is a good choice.</td>', 'I like it. Fantastic job. The composition of the skull is just right for the frame and using B&W is a good choice.', '2003-08-13 12:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(386571, 33151, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice shade of blue, nice shades</td>', 'Nice shade of blue, nice shades', '2003-08-13 12:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(386573, 33202, 8327, '<td valign="top">good, there is something missing that I can''t put into words (so I''m not much help here), but the tone (both colour and emotion) is good, composition is good, lighting is good, etc. Nothing bad to say, just something is missing.</td>', 'good, there is something missing that I can''t put into words (so I''m not much help here), but the tone (both colour and emotion) is good, composition is good, lighting is good, etc. Nothing bad to say, just something is missing.', '2003-08-13 12:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(386574, 33151, 10643, '<td valign="top">beautiful blues!</td>', 'beautiful blues!', '2003-08-13 12:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(386575, 33043, 7543, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit blurry, the building might be in better focus</td>', 'Looks a bit blurry, the building might be in better focus', '2003-08-13 12:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(386576, 33082, 9690, '<td valign="top">great idea, good shot!</td>', 'great idea, good shot!', '2003-08-13 12:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(386577, 32980, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the kite and the expression on the girls face.</td>', 'Great shot, love the kite and the expression on the girls face.', '2003-08-13 12:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(386579, 32312, 9690, '<td valign="top">shot is kind of flat.  No focal point or subject.</td>', 'shot is kind of flat.  No focal point or subject.', '2003-08-13 12:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(386581, 33048, 2937, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but still it''s the child which is left alone, isn''t it? I would have focused the kid (maybe swinging, so one could see it behind the chain link) and not the chain. Hope that helps a bit.</td>', 'I like the idea, but still it''s the child which is left alone, isn''t it? I would have focused the kid (maybe swinging, so one could see it behind the chain link) and not the chain. Hope that helps a bit.', '2003-08-13 12:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(386582, 32990, 2978, '<td valign="top">Very fine photo for a nature shot. IMO this is too sublime to be described as desolation.</td>', 'Very fine photo for a nature shot. IMO this is too sublime to be described as desolation.', '2003-08-13 12:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(386583, 33164, 8327, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge, not enough detail in the coulds,  this may have worked better in color, with the contrasting grey/blue of the water with the angry grey of the clouds. The wave breaking in the foreground is  a distraction to me.</td>', 'meets the challenge, not enough detail in the coulds,  this may have worked better in color, with the contrasting grey/blue of the water with the angry grey of the clouds. The wave breaking in the foreground is  a distraction to me.', '2003-08-13 12:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(386584, 33226, 7543, '<td valign="top">There is a weird slope on the horizon, and the lake/sea it seems. Colors are great, and the seagull is great. Also seems like there are some lines in the sky, where the colors change.</td>', 'There is a weird slope on the horizon, and the lake/sea it seems. Colors are great, and the seagull is great. Also seems like there are some lines in the sky, where the colors change.', '2003-08-13 12:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(386587, 33081, 8327, '<td valign="top">The grass in the foreground distracts me from the main subject, don''t know if the grayscale was necessary, it makes it look a little forced.</td>', 'The grass in the foreground distracts me from the main subject, don''t know if the grayscale was necessary, it makes it look a little forced.', '2003-08-13 13:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(386589, 33216, 10151, '<td valign="top">Is this a real building in the middle of nowhere or is that a prop in the sand?? Either way, very good shot!</td>', 'Is this a real building in the middle of nowhere or is that a prop in the sand?? Either way, very good shot!', '2003-08-13 13:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(386590, 33202, 2937, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a strong picture! That''s what I mean by desolation.  It''s my favourite, although it is hard to see the real world. Congrats.</td>', 'Wow, what a strong picture! That''s what I mean by desolation.  It''s my favourite, although it is hard to see the real world. Congrats.', '2003-08-13 13:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(386593, 33119, 10151, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh, now that is just tragic. Um..some of the fur seems over-exposed, it does fit the challenge though.  Good work!</td>', 'Ohhhh, now that is just tragic. Um..some of the fur seems over-exposed, it does fit the challenge though.  Good work!', '2003-08-13 13:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(386594, 33051, 7543, '<td valign="top">seems a tiny bit out of focus</td>', 'seems a tiny bit out of focus', '2003-08-13 13:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(386596, 32800, 10151, '<td valign="top">What''s with the dead rodents?? Anyway...challenge met, good DOF...</td>', 'What''s with the dead rodents?? Anyway...challenge met, good DOF...', '2003-08-13 13:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(386598, 33228, 8327, '<td valign="top">Brightened then slightly desaturated would be an improvement.</td>', 'Brightened then slightly desaturated would be an improvement.', '2003-08-13 13:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(386600, 33245, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great subject, great expression on his face, great for this challenge. The only thing that I don''t like is the backlighting which is always hard to get rid of. Maybe you couln''t choose the angle and time, and it is quite nicely done if you consider the circumstances. Good luck</td>', 'Great subject, great expression on his face, great for this challenge. The only thing that I don''t like is the backlighting which is always hard to get rid of. Maybe you couln''t choose the angle and time, and it is quite nicely done if you consider the circumstances. Good luck', '2003-08-13 13:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(386601, 32407, 2978, '<td valign="top">The kid drawing fills the emptiness to the photo. The dirty white walls create the feeling too. But I would try to avoid the floor in the near end room. It''s distracting. Setting the camera lower and tilting up may help.</td>', 'The kid drawing fills the emptiness to the photo. The dirty white walls create the feeling too. But I would try to avoid the floor in the near end room. It''s distracting. Setting the camera lower and tilting up may help.', '2003-08-13 13:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
