(386781, 33194, 9436, '<td valign="top">Great title!</td>', 'Great title!', '2003-08-13 14:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(386782, 33116, 10414, '<td valign="top">Kind of looks like my back garden after I forgot to water everything last year! :) Wonderful depiction of desolation!  :)</td>', 'Kind of looks like my back garden after I forgot to water everything last year! :) Wonderful depiction of desolation!  :)', '2003-08-13 14:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(386784, 33214, 9436, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot!</td>', 'I really like this shot!', '2003-08-13 14:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(386787, 33106, 9436, '<td valign="top">What is that on her  neck?</td>', 'What is that on her  neck?', '2003-08-13 14:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(386788, 33240, 10414, '<td valign="top">Ohhh....it makes me want to put my arms around them and give them a big hug! :)  Were they really sad about something?? :(  It sure is a great shot!</td>', 'Ohhh....it makes me want to put my arms around them and give them a big hug! :)  Were they really sad about something?? :(  It sure is a great shot!', '2003-08-13 14:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(386790, 33026, 9436, '<td valign="top">Is this implying suicide?</td>', 'Is this implying suicide?', '2003-08-13 14:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(386791, 32725, 9436, '<td valign="top">This is cool. I like the way that the car lights are not perfectly horizontal.</td>', 'This is cool. I like the way that the car lights are not perfectly horizontal.', '2003-08-13 14:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(386792, 33140, 10414, '<td valign="top">Great picture!  The brightness of the window, and the dark room, give the picture a feeling of dispair...which was the intended purpose. Nice shot!!  :)</td>', 'Great picture!  The brightness of the window, and the dark room, give the picture a feeling of dispair...which was the intended purpose. Nice shot!!  :)', '2003-08-13 14:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(386793, 32516, 9436, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot! Title is a tad cheesy though.</td>', 'Wonderful shot! Title is a tad cheesy though.', '2003-08-13 14:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(386794, 33073, 675, '<td valign="top">for me, i wish the road would have been included in the bottom right hand corner, not cut off by the framing</td>', 'for me, i wish the road would have been included in the bottom right hand corner, not cut off by the framing', '2003-08-13 14:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(386799, 33082, 675, '<td valign="top">nice tones</td>', 'nice tones', '2003-08-13 14:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(386800, 32947, 10414, '<td valign="top">You couldn''t have found a more downtrodden looking gentleman! The lighting on his face is a wonderful compliment to the overall composition of the picture...great job!!   :)</td>', 'You couldn''t have found a more downtrodden looking gentleman! The lighting on his face is a wonderful compliment to the overall composition of the picture...great job!!   :)', '2003-08-13 14:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(386801, 32607, 9436, '<td valign="top">Good job! I wonder if it would have looked better if the horizon was leveled?</td>', 'Good job! I wonder if it would have looked better if the horizon was leveled?', '2003-08-13 14:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(386802, 33109, 675, '<td valign="top">lower perspective would have had much greater impact</td>', 'lower perspective would have had much greater impact', '2003-08-13 14:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(386803, 32990, 9436, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - yes! Desolate - ?</td>', 'Beautiful - yes! Desolate - ?', '2003-08-13 14:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(386804, 32814, 9436, '<td valign="top">This is a stretch.</td>', 'This is a stretch.', '2003-08-13 14:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(386805, 32606, 10414, '<td valign="top">Ohhh...poor little guy!  Great picture.  I believe a closer up shot would have been better...then the viewer could see more of his adorable face!!  :)</td>', 'Ohhh...poor little guy!  Great picture.  I believe a closer up shot would have been better...then the viewer could see more of his adorable face!!  :)', '2003-08-13 14:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(386807, 32725, 675, '<td valign="top">tighter crop on all sides creating an even more off center feel would be great i think</td>', 'tighter crop on all sides creating an even more off center feel would be great i think', '2003-08-13 14:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(386808, 33111, 675, '<td valign="top">bad border</td>', 'bad border', '2003-08-13 14:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(386810, 33225, 675, '<td valign="top">looks oversharpened</td>', 'looks oversharpened', '2003-08-13 14:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(386811, 33246, 9895, '<td valign="top">excellent shot and nice composure. colour of the sky is lovely. as there are no leaves it gives the real feeling of desolated. nice shot ... :)</td>', 'excellent shot and nice composure. colour of the sky is lovely. as there are no leaves it gives the real feeling of desolated. nice shot ... :)', '2003-08-13 14:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(386813, 33062, 9436, '<td valign="top">Cool ghost!</td>', 'Cool ghost!', '2003-08-13 14:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(386814, 32496, 3554, '<td valign="top">This one definitely got a response out of me. I hate bees.</td>', 'This one definitely got a response out of me. I hate bees.', '2003-08-13 14:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(386819, 32854, 675, '<td valign="top">abandoned? what about the semi inteligent primate?</td>', 'abandoned? what about the semi inteligent primate?', '2003-08-13 14:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(386820, 32718, 675, '<td valign="top">too much saturation of the sepia tone</td>', 'too much saturation of the sepia tone', '2003-08-13 14:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(386821, 32922, 9295, '<td valign="top">The blue of the sky is wonderful.  Such a contrast to the earth tones on the ground.</td>', 'The blue of the sky is wonderful.  Such a contrast to the earth tones on the ground.', '2003-08-13 14:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(386825, 32660, 9295, '<td valign="top">Although I understand what you are going for in this photo, it doesn''t give me the feeling of desolution. It is a nice photo though with sharp colors and interesting shadows.</td>', 'Although I understand what you are going for in this photo, it doesn''t give me the feeling of desolution. It is a nice photo though with sharp colors and interesting shadows.', '2003-08-13 14:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(386827, 32357, 11127, '<td valign="top">Strong on theme, good subject, good shot, but a little on the dark side.</td>', 'Strong on theme, good subject, good shot, but a little on the dark side.', '2003-08-13 14:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(386829, 33063, 11127, '<td valign="top">good on theme, subject, good shot.</td>', 'good on theme, subject, good shot.', '2003-08-13 14:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(386831, 33118, 9295, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far.  I love the mist in the background adding to the desolute feel of the tide abandoning the boat here.</td>', 'One of my favorites so far.  I love the mist in the background adding to the desolute feel of the tide abandoning the boat here.', '2003-08-13 14:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(386832, 33118, 11127, '<td valign="top">good on theme, great subject, excellent shot</td>', 'good on theme, great subject, excellent shot', '2003-08-13 14:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(386835, 33213, 9295, '<td valign="top">The building is just too dark to be your focal point.  It gets lost in the shadows, which may or may not be your intention, but in this case I think it would be better if we could see more of the character of the building.</td>', 'The building is just too dark to be your focal point.  It gets lost in the shadows, which may or may not be your intention, but in this case I think it would be better if we could see more of the character of the building.', '2003-08-13 14:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(386838, 33155, 9295, '<td valign="top">You really have to study this photo to see your focal point but once you do, it is quite an interesting perspective on the challenge.</td>', 'You really have to study this photo to see your focal point but once you do, it is quite an interesting perspective on the challenge.', '2003-08-13 14:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(386840, 33226, 675, '<td valign="top">not desolate, but a good photo</td>', 'not desolate, but a good photo', '2003-08-13 14:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(386841, 33239, 675, '<td valign="top">really bad border</td>', 'really bad border', '2003-08-13 14:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(386843, 33240, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like the sad expressions on these little faces, but I would have liked to see something done to the photo to capture the mood. Off-centering the girls or perhaps using black and white, with your lighthing focused more on their faces than their pants would have added a more artistic touch.</td>', 'I like the sad expressions on these little faces, but I would have liked to see something done to the photo to capture the mood. Off-centering the girls or perhaps using black and white, with your lighthing focused more on their faces than their pants would have added a more artistic touch.', '2003-08-13 14:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(386844, 32671, 10918, '<td valign="top">Where is that?</td>', 'Where is that?', '2003-08-13 14:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(386846, 33233, 10918, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of the empty bench in a large empty room. Well done!</td>', 'I like the feel of the empty bench in a large empty room. Well done!', '2003-08-13 14:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(386848, 32407, 10918, '<td valign="top">That''s cool.</td>', 'That''s cool.', '2003-08-13 14:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(386850, 32819, 10918, '<td valign="top">Neat! Where in the U.K. is that?</td>', 'Neat! Where in the U.K. is that?', '2003-08-13 15:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(386852, 32396, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a good interpretation of the theme but perhaps just a little too dark on your subject.  I think that seeing the folds of the coat (and maybe the tatters if they are there) would create even more empathy for this pour soul.  Your title evokes quite a bit of emotion.</td>', 'This is a good interpretation of the theme but perhaps just a little too dark on your subject.  I think that seeing the folds of the coat (and maybe the tatters if they are there) would create even more empathy for this pour soul.  Your title evokes quite a bit of emotion.', '2003-08-13 15:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(386854, 33167, 675, '<td valign="top">the tones are a bit too much</td>', 'the tones are a bit too much', '2003-08-13 15:04:45.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(386856, 33048, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos that causes me to stop and think. I like that.  At first, I thought the focus should be on the boy but the longer I look at it, the more I realize that you were right in keeping him soft in the background.  It reiterates the feel of his loneliness, of not being the focus in anyone''s life at that given moment. Whether he was asked to sit that way or it was a candid shot, his body language is perfect.</td>', 'This is one of those photos that causes me to stop and think. I like that.  At first, I thought the focus should be on the boy but the longer I look at it, the more I realize that you were right in keeping him soft in the background.  It reiterates the feel of his loneliness, of not being the focus in anyone''s life at that given moment. Whether he was asked to sit that way or it was a candid shot, his body language is perfect.', '2003-08-13 15:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(386858, 33177, 9295, '<td valign="top">Although you have captured the mood of the theme, there is something that is not working for me in this shot.  I think it might be the fact that the hand is so much the focal point. I would much rather see more of the face and perhaps some expression.</td>', 'Although you have captured the mood of the theme, there is something that is not working for me in this shot.  I think it might be the fact that the hand is so much the focal point. I would much rather see more of the face and perhaps some expression.', '2003-08-13 15:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(386859, 32814, 9295, '<td valign="top">An interesting interpretation of the challenge.  I like the lighting and the placement on the page.  It seems a little soft in the focus and I think in a shot like this, the sharper the better.  I like the humor.</td>', 'An interesting interpretation of the challenge.  I like the lighting and the placement on the page.  It seems a little soft in the focus and I think in a shot like this, the sharper the better.  I like the humor.', '2003-08-13 15:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(386862, 33016, 9295, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the boat being so high in the frame works here.  I''d like to see it cropped so that there is a greater expanse of water beyond.</td>', 'I''m not sure the boat being so high in the frame works here.  I''d like to see it cropped so that there is a greater expanse of water beyond.', '2003-08-13 15:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(386863, 33155, 11052, '<td valign="top">Veri disolating mood</td>', 'Veri disolating mood', '2003-08-13 15:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(386864, 33048, 9976, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I would have chosen a different perspective though. In my opinion the main subject (the child) should have been given more attention.</td>', 'Good idea. I would have chosen a different perspective though. In my opinion the main subject (the child) should have been given more attention.', '2003-08-13 15:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(386866, 33216, 675, '<td valign="top">nice sandbox or beach setup. would be more believable with a few other props</td>', 'nice sandbox or beach setup. would be more believable with a few other props', '2003-08-13 15:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(386867, 33026, 9295, '<td valign="top">The implications of this shot are truly difficult to think about.  Had your subject given slightly different body language to convey his intent, I think it would have been even more powerful.  Nicely shot though.</td>', 'The implications of this shot are truly difficult to think about.  Had your subject given slightly different body language to convey his intent, I think it would have been even more powerful.  Nicely shot though.', '2003-08-13 15:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(386869, 32768, 9295, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry the poor thing is ill, but the photo doesn''t really have any impact. It feels too much like a snapshop that anyone might take of a pet instead of being something to be artistically interpreted.</td>', 'I''m sorry the poor thing is ill, but the photo doesn''t really have any impact. It feels too much like a snapshop that anyone might take of a pet instead of being something to be artistically interpreted.', '2003-08-13 15:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(386870, 32900, 3554, '<td valign="top">The color on this one is a bit red for my tastes. I think it might have worked a little better closer to a true black and white. Subject conveys the challenge well. 7</td>', 'The color on this one is a bit red for my tastes. I think it might have worked a little better closer to a true black and white. Subject conveys the challenge well. 7', '2003-08-13 15:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(386872, 32947, 9976, '<td valign="top">Very nice especially the eyes and brows. Focus and sharpness are spot on.</td>', 'Very nice especially the eyes and brows. Focus and sharpness are spot on.', '2003-08-13 15:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(386873, 33141, 9295, '<td valign="top">Rather than enhancing the mood of the murky waters, the darkness of the "walls" to the left and right of the river (are those trees?) become overpowering.  Another time of day perhaps when the shadows are not so deep and this might have been more effective.</td>', 'Rather than enhancing the mood of the murky waters, the darkness of the "walls" to the left and right of the river (are those trees?) become overpowering.  Another time of day perhaps when the shadows are not so deep and this might have been more effective.', '2003-08-13 15:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(386875, 33119, 9295, '<td valign="top">Disturbing but well photographed.  Is that a baby on her back?  Goodness.</td>', 'Disturbing but well photographed.  Is that a baby on her back?  Goodness.', '2003-08-13 15:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(386878, 33051, 9976, '<td valign="top">Seems abit out of focus to me. Like the expression on the subjects face.</td>', 'Seems abit out of focus to me. Like the expression on the subjects face.', '2003-08-13 15:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(386879, 32451, 9295, '<td valign="top">Was this taken through a glass or something?  There is a distortion to it that I thought at first might be intentional but in fact, to me, is quite distracting.</td>', 'Was this taken through a glass or something?  There is a distortion to it that I thought at first might be intentional but in fact, to me, is quite distracting.', '2003-08-13 15:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(386883, 32582, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good sense of humor! More of a snapshot than anything!</td>', 'Good sense of humor! More of a snapshot than anything!', '2003-08-13 15:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(386892, 32947, 10739, '<td valign="top">very nice portrait</td>', 'very nice portrait', '2003-08-13 15:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(386893, 32783, 9913, '<td valign="top">now thats the prettiest drunk I ever seen ;)<br/> <br/>Very good pic a bit more contrast would have been better (I think)</td>', 'now thats the prettiest drunk I ever seen ;) Very good pic a bit more contrast would have been better (I think)', '2003-08-13 15:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(386894, 32990, 11135, '<td valign="top">I understand the idea of alone, but in my humble opinion, a forest by a lake with the sun peeking through the clouds displays anything but desolation. It is a nice picture, but it seems full of life to me.</td>', 'I understand the idea of alone, but in my humble opinion, a forest by a lake with the sun peeking through the clouds displays anything but desolation. It is a nice picture, but it seems full of life to me.', '2003-08-13 15:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(386895, 33109, 10739, '<td valign="top">nice picture. It gets my feeling of desolation</td>', 'nice picture. It gets my feeling of desolation', '2003-08-13 15:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(386896, 32994, 9913, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more of the model ..</td>', 'I would have liked to see more of the model ..', '2003-08-13 15:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(386898, 33101, 10739, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but it is asking for more contrast IMHO</td>', 'Good composition, but it is asking for more contrast IMHO', '2003-08-13 15:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(386901, 32897, 10739, '<td valign="top">Left part too dark. May be a closer look would help too.</td>', 'Left part too dark. May be a closer look would help too.', '2003-08-13 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(386902, 32477, 11135, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why, but the quality of the image seems to be low. Did you crop it at all, or are you taking pictures at a low resolution or compressing them alot? Also, the horizon is not even (which, in my opinion, it should be in a picture such as this) Also, There is nothing that really grabs and holds the attention. It is for these reasons that it will get a lower score from me. I would suggest looking into what you can do to improve the overall quality of the file as well as putting a little bit more time into framing an image.</td>', 'I''m not sure why, but the quality of the image seems to be low. Did you crop it at all, or are you taking pictures at a low resolution or compressing them alot? Also, the horizon is not even (which, in my opinion, it should be in a picture such as this) Also, There is nothing that really grabs and holds the attention. It is for these reasons that it will get a lower score from me. I would suggest looking into what you can do to improve the overall quality of the file as well as putting a little bit more time into framing an image.', '2003-08-13 15:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(386903, 33004, 9462, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, not sure about this one. I don''t see kids really having desolate feelings unless of course they''re hungry homeless orphans. This kid is just too healthy and cute. Sorry, not buying it. He''s got some great eyes tho...<br/>Aloha!</td>', 'Hmmm, not sure about this one. I don''t see kids really having desolate feelings unless of course they''re hungry homeless orphans. This kid is just too healthy and cute. Sorry, not buying it. He''s got some great eyes tho...Aloha!', '2003-08-13 15:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(386904, 33006, 10739, '<td valign="top">the extreme contrasts distracts a bit more than transmit desolation</td>', 'the extreme contrasts distracts a bit more than transmit desolation', '2003-08-13 15:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(386905, 32989, 10739, '<td valign="top">very nice colors</td>', 'very nice colors', '2003-08-13 15:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(386906, 33048, 11135, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what you were trying to display with this image. It''s interesting... the chain is the only thing that is in focus, which is fine considering that it is obvious that that is what you wanted, but I''m not sure what you were tying to say. The colorful image of the playground in the background detract from the idea of anything here being desolate. Perhaps it might have been more moving had it been taken or converted to black and white.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what you were trying to display with this image. It''s interesting... the chain is the only thing that is in focus, which is fine considering that it is obvious that that is what you wanted, but I''m not sure what you were tying to say. The colorful image of the playground in the background detract from the idea of anything here being desolate. Perhaps it might have been more moving had it been taken or converted to black and white.', '2003-08-13 15:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(386908, 32779, 9976, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and composition. One of the best in the contest.</td>', 'Beautiful colours and composition. One of the best in the contest.', '2003-08-13 15:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(386909, 32357, 11135, '<td valign="top">It is hard for me to say that this is a good representation of desolation at all. It is a fine picture... it just doesn''t pull the slightest feeling of desolation from me. Perhaps some lonliness, but lakes, to me, show hope and life. It''s hard to think of desolation when the whole lake is there full of life.</td>', 'It is hard for me to say that this is a good representation of desolation at all. It is a fine picture... it just doesn''t pull the slightest feeling of desolation from me. Perhaps some lonliness, but lakes, to me, show hope and life. It''s hard to think of desolation when the whole lake is there full of life.', '2003-08-13 15:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(386910, 32802, 9147, '<td valign="top">Animo, esta muy bien sersal!!</td>', 'Animo, esta muy bien sersal!!', '2003-08-13 15:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(386912, 33166, 9976, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Well Done.</td>', 'Nice work. Well Done.', '2003-08-13 15:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(386913, 32980, 11135, '<td valign="top">The kite in the background makes it hard for me to see this as anything that has to do with desolation. I do like the picture, but because of that, it will recieve a fairly low score from me.</td>', 'The kite in the background makes it hard for me to see this as anything that has to do with desolation. I do like the picture, but because of that, it will recieve a fairly low score from me.', '2003-08-13 15:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(386916, 33055, 9462, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective here... a border would tie it all in for me :)</td>', 'I really like the perspective here... a border would tie it all in for me :)', '2003-08-13 15:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(386918, 33172, 11135, '<td valign="top">This photo almost completely displays life rather than desolation...</td>', 'This photo almost completely displays life rather than desolation...', '2003-08-13 15:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(386919, 33226, 9913, '<td valign="top">no desolation here</td>', 'no desolation here', '2003-08-13 15:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(386921, 32357, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflections.  Your main subject is a little too central though. Showing more of the lake and less of the rocks would probably have helped here.  Use of exposure lock or manual exposure and focus lock would allow you to do this. 6</td>', 'Lovely reflections.  Your main subject is a little too central though. Showing more of the lake and less of the rocks would probably have helped here.  Use of exposure lock or manual exposure and focus lock would allow you to do this. 6', '2003-08-13 16:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
