(386948, 33226, 8860, '<td valign="top">This really does look very tranquil and quite a content, passive looking scene - remote perhaps, but not at all desolate! A very nice shot and a good capture with excellent focus on the gull - aside from the challenge.</td>', 'This really does look very tranquil and quite a content, passive looking scene - remote perhaps, but not at all desolate! A very nice shot and a good capture with excellent focus on the gull - aside from the challenge.', '2003-08-13 16:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
