(386952, 32944, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, particularly the blue of the sky. I like how the tree "climbs" up the frame bowing just a  touch into the picture.  Beaufiully cropped. Maybe just a little too soft in teh focus though?</td>', 'I like the colors, particularly the blue of the sky. I like how the tree "climbs" up the frame bowing just a  touch into the picture.  Beaufiully cropped. Maybe just a little too soft in teh focus though?', '2003-08-13 16:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(386953, 32321, 10047, '<td valign="top">I would have tried to reduce the redness in the editing program.</td>', 'I would have tried to reduce the redness in the editing program.', '2003-08-13 16:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(386954, 33136, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like the photo very much.  I think a different title would add to the mood more.  The one you chose is a tad too jovial for the emotional impact the shot could otherwise have.  I won''t mark down for that, of course. Just an observation.</td>', 'I like the photo very much.  I think a different title would add to the mood more.  The one you chose is a tad too jovial for the emotional impact the shot could otherwise have.  I won''t mark down for that, of course. Just an observation.', '2003-08-13 16:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(386955, 32601, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yes - this is empty - it''s also tranquil, beautiful and remote looking, but not desolate. The landscape has not been ravaged or made barren, neither does anything look forlorn. A great shot regardless of the challenge.</td>', 'Yes - this is empty - it''s also tranquil, beautiful and remote looking, but not desolate. The landscape has not been ravaged or made barren, neither does anything look forlorn. A great shot regardless of the challenge.', '2003-08-13 16:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(386957, 33140, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is damage, not desolation. Good composition and focus though.</td>', 'This is damage, not desolation. Good composition and focus though.', '2003-08-13 16:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(386958, 33230, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice lonely rugged landscape. I''m not sure how it wold have turn out, but I would have tried changing it to sepia or mono to see if it had more visual impact.</td>', 'Nice lonely rugged landscape. I''m not sure how it wold have turn out, but I would have tried changing it to sepia or mono to see if it had more visual impact.', '2003-08-13 16:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(386959, 33194, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like how the triangle formed by the peak of the roof being almost identical in shape to the mountain on the right side of the shot  gives the illusion of the house blending right into the surrounding  landscape.</td>', 'I like how the triangle formed by the peak of the roof being almost identical in shape to the mountain on the right side of the shot  gives the illusion of the house blending right into the surrounding  landscape.', '2003-08-13 16:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(386960, 32782, 8860, '<td valign="top">Funny title. Not so funny result! Nice shot with good contrast and composition. Are they pines though?</td>', 'Funny title. Not so funny result! Nice shot with good contrast and composition. Are they pines though?', '2003-08-13 16:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(386962, 32861, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I would have tried applying sepia or mono to it to see if it made it look more lonely.</td>', 'Nice photo. I would have tried applying sepia or mono to it to see if it made it look more lonely.', '2003-08-13 16:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(386963, 33217, 9295, '<td valign="top">Good theme but the execution of the shot could be a little better.  It took me a little while before I recognized the shot for what it was, let alone your lone patron sitting at the edge of the bar.  It''s a good thing he was wearing a white shirt or he would have been completely lost.  I wonder if there was a way you could have found to light him better, keeping the shot dark and moody but making your subject stand out a bit more.</td>', 'Good theme but the execution of the shot could be a little better.  It took me a little while before I recognized the shot for what it was, let alone your lone patron sitting at the edge of the bar.  It''s a good thing he was wearing a white shirt or he would have been completely lost.  I wonder if there was a way you could have found to light him better, keeping the shot dark and moody but making your subject stand out a bit more.', '2003-08-13 16:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(386964, 33106, 9462, '<td valign="top">I''m sure alot of people won''t inderstand this one... I do. <br/>So young... such a tragedy.</td>', 'I''m sure alot of people won''t inderstand this one... I do. So young... such a tragedy.', '2003-08-13 16:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(386965, 33220, 8860, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this guy looks quite cool really though a bit sad. It really needs some context to show why he may be desolate. A very good study with good lighting and tones. Focus could have been a touch sharper.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this guy looks quite cool really though a bit sad. It really needs some context to show why he may be desolate. A very good study with good lighting and tones. Focus could have been a touch sharper.', '2003-08-13 16:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(386966, 33051, 10047, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little more focus and contrast. I can feel the melancholy.</td>', 'Maybe a little more focus and contrast. I can feel the melancholy.', '2003-08-13 16:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(386967, 32621, 8860, '<td valign="top">Stylish contrast maybe, but not desolate. Nice abstract though.</td>', 'Stylish contrast maybe, but not desolate. Nice abstract though.', '2003-08-13 16:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(386968, 32817, 9295, '<td valign="top">The building itself is a bit dark.  Bringing out the details of the warped and rotting timber would help enhance your theme.</td>', 'The building itself is a bit dark.  Bringing out the details of the warped and rotting timber would help enhance your theme.', '2003-08-13 16:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(386969, 32682, 10047, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what the lighting conditons were, but I would have tried without flash to see if the photo had more impact.</td>', 'Don''t know what the lighting conditons were, but I would have tried without flash to see if the photo had more impact.', '2003-08-13 16:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(386970, 33137, 10047, '<td valign="top">Good impact. Good angle. Lonely feel.  A little grainy, but that might add to the impact and not detract.</td>', 'Good impact. Good angle. Lonely feel.  A little grainy, but that might add to the impact and not detract.', '2003-08-13 16:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(386973, 32752, 9295, '<td valign="top">Touching theme and wonderful title.  The shot might be a bit more effective though had you  managed to light it a little differently to soften that large shadow behind the machine.  Also, the resolution does not seem very crisp on my PC. It''s not that it''s out of focus, it looks to be more of a digital problem.</td>', 'Touching theme and wonderful title.  The shot might be a bit more effective though had you  managed to light it a little differently to soften that large shadow behind the machine.  Also, the resolution does not seem very crisp on my PC. It''s not that it''s out of focus, it looks to be more of a digital problem.', '2003-08-13 16:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(386975, 32980, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice effect on the hair. I would have tried for a little more contrast.</td>', 'Nice effect on the hair. I would have tried for a little more contrast.', '2003-08-13 16:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(386976, 33139, 8860, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge and very thought-evoking. Not typical of desolation perception - but instead I think of the desolation that led to this monument''s existence. I''d rather have seen more of the name list which would have given more impact as to the scale of the cause - filling the frame would have been good. [7]</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge and very thought-evoking. Not typical of desolation perception - but instead I think of the desolation that led to this monument''s existence. I''d rather have seen more of the name list which would have given more impact as to the scale of the cause - filling the frame would have been good. [7]', '2003-08-13 16:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(386981, 32990, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo, but rather than evoking a feeling of desolation, the rays of light shooting out from behind the clouds give me more a sense of hope and peace.  The title alone doesn''t alter this perception.  Wonderful shot though.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo, but rather than evoking a feeling of desolation, the rays of light shooting out from behind the clouds give me more a sense of hope and peace.  The title alone doesn''t alter this perception.  Wonderful shot though.', '2003-08-13 16:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(386982, 32427, 8860, '<td valign="top">Destruction maybe but not desolation for me. Shot is a bit gloomy and could have been better lit with a little fill-flash, or adjusting the exposure settings.</td>', 'Destruction maybe but not desolation for me. Shot is a bit gloomy and could have been better lit with a little fill-flash, or adjusting the exposure settings.', '2003-08-13 16:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(386983, 32990, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Very inspiring. Not sure about "desolate", but I like it. Maybe in sepia or mono it would look lonelier.</td>', 'Nice photo. Very inspiring. Not sure about "desolate", but I like it. Maybe in sepia or mono it would look lonelier.', '2003-08-13 16:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(386984, 32660, 8860, '<td valign="top">Focus should be on the moon. I see what you''re getting at but the impact is lost.</td>', 'Focus should be on the moon. I see what you''re getting at but the impact is lost.', '2003-08-13 16:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(386986, 33048, 10047, '<td valign="top">I figured it out the 2nd time I looked. I would have tried a little different angle with the same focus, so the child wasn''t obscured as much.</td>', 'I figured it out the 2nd time I looked. I would have tried a little different angle with the same focus, so the child wasn''t obscured as much.', '2003-08-13 16:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(386990, 33199, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast on the tree. I would have moved right a little more to see if I could pick up the relief on the brick work as well.</td>', 'Nice contrast on the tree. I would have moved right a little more to see if I could pick up the relief on the brick work as well.', '2003-08-13 16:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(386991, 32357, 9643, '<td valign="top">Too much beauty here to be desolate but I will go with posture of your subject and  score high because this is a great picture.  I aspire to the challenge that this kind of photo offers to me.</td>', 'Too much beauty here to be desolate but I will go with posture of your subject and  score high because this is a great picture.  I aspire to the challenge that this kind of photo offers to me.', '2003-08-13 16:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
