(387261, 32529, 11127, '<td valign="top">A little too dark and I can get the sense of what''s going on here from the shot.</td>', 'A little too dark and I can get the sense of what''s going on here from the shot.', '2003-08-13 19:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
