(387356, 33053, 5112, '<td valign="top">I must say, this is one of the nicest looking prisons I''ve ever seen!  Most I''ve seen have heavy clanking doors, no windows or arches.  This is actually a very nice picture.  I''m having trouble with it and "desolation", but it''s a nice picture.  ~9</td>', 'I must say, this is one of the nicest looking prisons I''ve ever seen!  Most I''ve seen have heavy clanking doors, no windows or arches.  This is actually a very nice picture.  I''m having trouble with it and "desolation", but it''s a nice picture.  ~9', '2003-08-13 21:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(387357, 33182, 3294, '<td valign="top">What''s she holding?  A cigarette or crack pipe?  Not sure I like it there.  This shot may have more impact with the photos in focus with a real shallow depth of field and the chick out of focus.... drives attention on the memories and not the chick.  Just a thought... (7)</td>', 'What''s she holding?  A cigarette or crack pipe?  Not sure I like it there.  This shot may have more impact with the photos in focus with a real shallow depth of field and the chick out of focus.... drives attention on the memories and not the chick.  Just a thought... (7)', '2003-08-13 21:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
