(388092, 33048, 10888, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this photo the more really like it. It takes a bit to get passed the chain. Great composition and really good emotion! This is one of the better shots that I have judged! Good job!</td>', 'The more I look at this photo the more really like it. It takes a bit to get passed the chain. Great composition and really good emotion! This is one of the better shots that I have judged! Good job!', '2003-08-14 11:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
