(388142, 33121, 10414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!  I want to be right there with those clouds...it''s been too hot in my neck of the woods!  The darkness of the picture compliments the desolation! :)</td>', 'Beautiful picture!  I want to be right there with those clouds...it''s been too hot in my neck of the woods!  The darkness of the picture compliments the desolation! :)', '2003-08-14 12:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(388145, 33099, 10414, '<td valign="top">Hmm...I''m not crazy about this shot....just because I like to see more of what was in the picture. Where were you at? It reminded me of those old prison cells where the only light coming in was from a small cut in the wall.</td>', 'Hmm...I''m not crazy about this shot....just because I like to see more of what was in the picture. Where were you at? It reminded me of those old prison cells where the only light coming in was from a small cut in the wall.', '2003-08-14 12:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
