(388363, 33184, 8377, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  I love the tones you used in this photograph, and although I usually dont like straight-on shots, I think it really works for this photograph.  This photograph has a real character.  And I think it is just the perfect amount of clarity.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  I love the tones you used in this photograph, and although I usually dont like straight-on shots, I think it really works for this photograph.  This photograph has a real character.  And I think it is just the perfect amount of clarity.', '2003-08-14 15:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(388364, 33055, 2792, '<td valign="top">Not the most original idea, but you did fairly well.  Love how the tracks lead out of the picture.  Would have looked good in sepia as well.  =-)  Also would have liked the foreground more focused and then fade out.</td>', 'Not the most original idea, but you did fairly well.  Love how the tracks lead out of the picture.  Would have looked good in sepia as well.  =-)  Also would have liked the foreground more focused and then fade out.', '2003-08-14 15:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(388365, 32496, 10611, '<td valign="top">Wow. I like to know how this was composed. nice work!</td>', 'Wow. I like to know how this was composed. nice work!', '2003-08-14 15:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(388366, 33213, 8377, '<td valign="top">This image sets a great mood.  I would have preferred a bit more contrast, but the way it is does make it seem really gloomy.  And this is probably a weird thing to comment on, but I really like the contrasts in the colors of the trees in the background.</td>', 'This image sets a great mood.  I would have preferred a bit more contrast, but the way it is does make it seem really gloomy.  And this is probably a weird thing to comment on, but I really like the contrasts in the colors of the trees in the background.', '2003-08-14 15:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(388367, 33176, 10611, '<td valign="top">I love the colors.</td>', 'I love the colors.', '2003-08-14 15:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(388368, 33190, 2792, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed.  Neat colors, looks kinda like a painting.</td>', 'Very nicely composed.  Neat colors, looks kinda like a painting.', '2003-08-14 15:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(388369, 32683, 8377, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  I love ocean shots, and way to convey desolation!  The clounds in the background are wonderful, and I love the angle you shot this at.  Great job.</td>', 'This is nice.  I love ocean shots, and way to convey desolation!  The clounds in the background are wonderful, and I love the angle you shot this at.  Great job.', '2003-08-14 15:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
