(388374, 32989, 8377, '<td valign="top">Wow, you did a great job with this photo.  I looks like you took it at just the right time of day.  I love the sky, and the glow on the house.</td>', 'Wow, you did a great job with this photo.  I looks like you took it at just the right time of day.  I love the sky, and the glow on the house.', '2003-08-14 15:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
