(388411, 33026, 3087, '<td valign="top">Striking. The picture tells the story as many entries really don''t. Beautifully crisp contrast and great leading lines. <br/>9</td>', 'Striking. The picture tells the story as many entries really don''t. Beautifully crisp contrast and great leading lines. 9', '2003-08-14 16:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(388412, 32718, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the part of the image to the right of the wooden pole most, and would prefer it cropped to exclude the area to the far left. I love the tatty windows and hanging wiring and the texture of the bricks. Good choice on B/W too.<br/>9</td>', 'I love the part of the image to the right of the wooden pole most, and would prefer it cropped to exclude the area to the far left. I love the tatty windows and hanging wiring and the texture of the bricks. Good choice on B/W too.9', '2003-08-14 16:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(388413, 32949, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. Nice leading lines and curves, strong composition and I like the posterized feel of it - the high contrast and starkness. <br/>9</td>', 'I like this very much. Nice leading lines and curves, strong composition and I like the posterized feel of it - the high contrast and starkness. 9', '2003-08-14 16:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(388414, 32895, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a lovely portrait. In terms of composition I''d crop just a touch more at the left so he''s sweeping into the frame. I like the black and white and his pose too as well as the textures of the wall.<br/>9</td>', 'What a lovely portrait. In terms of composition I''d crop just a touch more at the left so he''s sweeping into the frame. I like the black and white and his pose too as well as the textures of the wall.9', '2003-08-14 16:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(388415, 32800, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent and nice angle. Good composition.<br/>Nice textures and great decision to go black and white.<br/>Would remove that stick towards top/ back.<br/>Like the inclusion of that ant investigator.<br/>9<br/></td>', 'Excellent and nice angle. Good composition.Nice textures and great decision to go black and white.Would remove that stick towards top/ back.Like the inclusion of that ant investigator.9', '2003-08-14 16:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(388418, 32699, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh - this is good. Strong composition, excellent focal points, both a primary one and a second one, and great diagonal. Nice choice of sepia tone too.<br/>9</td>', 'Oooh - this is good. Strong composition, excellent focal points, both a primary one and a second one, and great diagonal. Nice choice of sepia tone too.9', '2003-08-14 16:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(388421, 33076, 10799, '<td valign="top">It looks hazy and unclear in the middle left.  Perhaps a loser shot on a vehicle would have worked better</td>', 'It looks hazy and unclear in the middle left.  Perhaps a loser shot on a vehicle would have worked better', '2003-08-14 16:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(388422, 33216, 9411, '<td valign="top">I really wanted to rate this one higher. It just screams desolation, but the scale is just too "off". I''m sorry only a 6......</td>', 'I really wanted to rate this one higher. It just screams desolation, but the scale is just too "off". I''m sorry only a 6......', '2003-08-14 16:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(388423, 32947, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too harsh for me but I love the content and composition/ close range is absolutely superb. <br/>8</td>', 'Lighting is too harsh for me but I love the content and composition/ close range is absolutely superb. 8', '2003-08-14 16:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(388424, 32825, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this idea very much. My first comment would be that, because the model''s hair is black, the choice of black clothes makes it hard for me to make out his bowed head - and I think it would be stronger if I could make it out. Nice choice for environment and clever use of the rusted colours as well as the strong lines and angles.<br/>8</td>', 'I like this idea very much. My first comment would be that, because the model''s hair is black, the choice of black clothes makes it hard for me to make out his bowed head - and I think it would be stronger if I could make it out. Nice choice for environment and clever use of the rusted colours as well as the strong lines and angles.8', '2003-08-14 16:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(388425, 32516, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice focal point and certainly gives a feeling of a long lonely time passing. Low viewpoint is interesting. Black and white/ colourised treatment is also, though a touch pink for me.<br/>8</td>', 'Nice focal point and certainly gives a feeling of a long lonely time passing. Low viewpoint is interesting. Black and white/ colourised treatment is also, though a touch pink for me.8', '2003-08-14 16:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(388426, 33072, 3087, '<td valign="top">Quirky and stylised, certainly compelling - I like the expression and the way the make up pulls me towards her eyes. The high contrast works well for this.<br/>8</td>', 'Quirky and stylised, certainly compelling - I like the expression and the way the make up pulls me towards her eyes. The high contrast works well for this.8', '2003-08-14 16:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(388427, 33166, 3087, '<td valign="top">A stunning image but one I find depicts (for me) joy and beauty rather than desolation. I love it though! In this challenge, I''ll give it an 8, in another it might have been higher.<br/>8</td>', 'A stunning image but one I find depicts (for me) joy and beauty rather than desolation. I love it though! In this challenge, I''ll give it an 8, in another it might have been higher.8', '2003-08-14 16:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
