(388429, 33220, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an expressive face... that forehead is just great for shape and shadow. Like the way the ciggie gives a diagonal and counter point to the eyes. Lighting isn''t superb but doesn''t spoil it too much. Excellent portrait. Is it someone you know or a stranger?<br/>8</td>', 'What an expressive face... that forehead is just great for shape and shadow. Like the way the ciggie gives a diagonal and counter point to the eyes. Lighting isn''t superb but doesn''t spoil it too much. Excellent portrait. Is it someone you know or a stranger?8', '2003-08-14 16:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
