(388465, 32855, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a perfect subject for this challenge and I like your choice of black and white. I am not sure the straight on viewpoint and centred composition are the strongest choices and it might be nice to have some cloud detail to the sky but those are minor suggestions. A really strong fit to challenge theme.<br/>7</td>', 'What a perfect subject for this challenge and I like your choice of black and white. I am not sure the straight on viewpoint and centred composition are the strongest choices and it might be nice to have some cloud detail to the sky but those are minor suggestions. A really strong fit to challenge theme.7', '2003-08-14 16:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(388466, 33182, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nice composition with the heaviness of the images below and the clean wall above. Overall somewhat dark for my preferences.<br/>7</td>', 'Great idea and nice composition with the heaviness of the images below and the clean wall above. Overall somewhat dark for my preferences.7', '2003-08-14 16:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(388467, 33245, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the portrait but lighting doesn''t work for me. On one level one could say that having him in the shadow and not in the light is part of the sadness but to me it just seems that it''s lacking in fill-in light. What wonderful expressive features though - you''ve captured that superbly.<br/>7</td>', 'Love the portrait but lighting doesn''t work for me. On one level one could say that having him in the shadow and not in the light is part of the sadness but to me it just seems that it''s lacking in fill-in light. What wonderful expressive features though - you''ve captured that superbly.7', '2003-08-14 16:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(388468, 33211, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and colours and the contrast between earth and metal is good. Composition is interesting but just doesn''t feel quite balanced to me - I think it would be worthwhile playing around with the position of the three balls. <br/>7</td>', 'Nice textures and colours and the contrast between earth and metal is good. Composition is interesting but just doesn''t feel quite balanced to me - I think it would be worthwhile playing around with the position of the three balls. 7', '2003-08-14 16:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(388469, 32773, 10799, '<td valign="top">The lines across the sky are distracting to me.  Good composition.</td>', 'The lines across the sky are distracting to me.  Good composition.', '2003-08-14 16:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(388470, 33045, 9411, '<td valign="top">The colours are just fantastic. Unfortunately I don''t see it fitting the challenge. The richness of the sky draws me away from the tree and deadwood. A 6 for it being such a good shot.</td>', 'The colours are just fantastic. Unfortunately I don''t see it fitting the challenge. The richness of the sky draws me away from the tree and deadwood. A 6 for it being such a good shot.', '2003-08-14 16:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(388471, 32671, 3087, '<td valign="top">Good composition and nice content, good focal point, nice toning.<br/>7</td>', 'Good composition and nice content, good focal point, nice toning.7', '2003-08-14 16:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(388472, 33226, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oh but this is too beautiful - it makes me dream of holidays and summer nights and romantic walks and all things wonderful. Ignoring that, since others might see loneliness here, depending on their viewpoints, it''s a lovely image, nice focal point in the bird nad nice reflections of light and colour in the water. I like the wavy line of coloured water.<br/>7</td>', 'Oh but this is too beautiful - it makes me dream of holidays and summer nights and romantic walks and all things wonderful. Ignoring that, since others might see loneliness here, depending on their viewpoints, it''s a lovely image, nice focal point in the bird nad nice reflections of light and colour in the water. I like the wavy line of coloured water.7', '2003-08-14 16:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(388473, 33134, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures and makes me wonder about how the grave came to be abandoned to the extent that the tree grew up through it. <br/>7</td>', 'Wonderful textures and makes me wonder about how the grave came to be abandoned to the extent that the tree grew up through it. 7', '2003-08-14 16:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(388474, 32987, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and interesting graduation from white to dark across the diagonal. Position of bird within frame feels a little unbalanced - this is one that I think would benefit from a rule of thirds cross-section position.<br/>7</td>', 'Nice idea and interesting graduation from white to dark across the diagonal. Position of bird within frame feels a little unbalanced - this is one that I think would benefit from a rule of thirds cross-section position.7', '2003-08-14 16:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(388475, 33073, 3087, '<td valign="top">This one has grown on me after multiple viewings. I feel I''d like to see more of the road, just for it to be further in to the frame, but of course, I don''t know what lies to it''s right. If it''s more of the same I think it would work. I love the shapes of the steam or smoke emissions and the darkened sky.<br/>7</td>', 'This one has grown on me after multiple viewings. I feel I''d like to see more of the road, just for it to be further in to the frame, but of course, I don''t know what lies to it''s right. If it''s more of the same I think it would work. I love the shapes of the steam or smoke emissions and the darkened sky.7', '2003-08-14 16:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(388479, 32660, 10516, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I did not see how this met the challenge and yes, I would agree that the moon is desolate unto itself, however, with the green palm in the forground, all I see is hope. Nice picture by the way; I would have like to have seen alittle bit more depth of field (the moon in focus a little more)</td>', 'Sorry, I did not see how this met the challenge and yes, I would agree that the moon is desolate unto itself, however, with the green palm in the forground, all I see is hope. Nice picture by the way; I would have like to have seen alittle bit more depth of field (the moon in focus a little more)', '2003-08-14 16:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(388482, 33226, 10516, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this photo is inspiring; not desolate.</td>', 'Sorry, this photo is inspiring; not desolate.', '2003-08-14 16:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(388484, 33164, 3087, '<td valign="top">Certainly desolate but at the same time not a truly compelling image. But I think it can be very hard to show desolation and at the same time keep the image really interesting. I do like the diagonal at the bottom of the sea shore and would like to see it a little higher in the frame.<br/>I think I''d also prefer the position of the horizon to be a touch higher or lower - it''s a little close to middle for my tastes in this shot.<br/>Still a nice image though.<br/>6</td>', 'Certainly desolate but at the same time not a truly compelling image. But I think it can be very hard to show desolation and at the same time keep the image really interesting. I do like the diagonal at the bottom of the sea shore and would like to see it a little higher in the frame.I think I''d also prefer the position of the horizon to be a touch higher or lower - it''s a little close to middle for my tastes in this shot.Still a nice image though.6', '2003-08-14 16:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(388486, 32854, 10516, '<td valign="top">Absolutely a great shot. Now for the bad news, it is anything but desolate to me. Sorry, but I gave you a 1 and I think it would have been a 10 in another category. The lighting is very nice and I really like your use of the depth of field. The rope being in focus in the forground adds a lot to the composition.</td>', 'Absolutely a great shot. Now for the bad news, it is anything but desolate to me. Sorry, but I gave you a 1 and I think it would have been a 10 in another category. The lighting is very nice and I really like your use of the depth of field. The rope being in focus in the forground adds a lot to the composition.', '2003-08-14 16:34:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(388488, 32752, 10516, '<td valign="top">The image is badly pixelated and it does not appear that anything is in focus. Also the lighting is very harsh on the front of the sewing machine.</td>', 'The image is badly pixelated and it does not appear that anything is in focus. Also the lighting is very harsh on the front of the sewing machine.', '2003-08-14 16:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(388489, 33065, 3087, '<td valign="top">A well selected close up study. So much time is conveyed by their neglected condition. <br/>7</td>', 'A well selected close up study. So much time is conveyed by their neglected condition. 7', '2003-08-14 16:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(388495, 33221, 10516, '<td valign="top">Sorry, didn''t see how this met the challenge</td>', 'Sorry, didn''t see how this met the challenge', '2003-08-14 16:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(388496, 33186, 3087, '<td valign="top">The clouds are very menacing and this makes me think of the future as depicted in the Terminator films. <br/>6</td>', 'The clouds are very menacing and this makes me think of the future as depicted in the Terminator films. 6', '2003-08-14 16:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(388497, 32818, 3087, '<td valign="top">A great photo opportunity! One wonders how the poor car ended up in such dire straits? The image seems very top heavy to me because of the overhanging branches at the top but lack of much at all in the foreground.<br/>6</td>', 'A great photo opportunity! One wonders how the poor car ended up in such dire straits? The image seems very top heavy to me because of the overhanging branches at the top but lack of much at all in the foreground.6', '2003-08-14 16:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(388500, 32768, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m sure he''s feeling poorly but the image just looks like a dog lazing about as dogs do and just doesn''t say challenge topic at all to me.<br/>2</td>', 'I''m sure he''s feeling poorly but the image just looks like a dog lazing about as dogs do and just doesn''t say challenge topic at all to me.2', '2003-08-14 16:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(388503, 32760, 3087, '<td valign="top">I can see the idea behind this but I personally don''t think it''s been pulled off as well as it could have been.<br/>I find the background very distracting.<br/>I don''t like the strong orange tone.<br/>The decision on which parts of her arms/ legs/ hands are included and which aren''t seems a little abitrary.<br/>The image seems unsharp.<br/>That said the idea itself is a nice one.<br/>3</td>', 'I can see the idea behind this but I personally don''t think it''s been pulled off as well as it could have been.I find the background very distracting.I don''t like the strong orange tone.The decision on which parts of her arms/ legs/ hands are included and which aren''t seems a little abitrary.The image seems unsharp.That said the idea itself is a nice one.3', '2003-08-14 16:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(388507, 32944, 9906, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a good Negative Space picture too!</td>', 'I think this would have been a good Negative Space picture too!', '2003-08-14 17:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(388510, 33162, 3087, '<td valign="top">I thought a lot about what this might mean. I thought maybe the idea was a lone spaceman floating in space, either dead or alive. So I figured it probably fit the challenge OK. I just don''t like this posterized treatment at all. It''s not badly done but it''s just not my taste at all.<br/>3</td>', 'I thought a lot about what this might mean. I thought maybe the idea was a lone spaceman floating in space, either dead or alive. So I figured it probably fit the challenge OK. I just don''t like this posterized treatment at all. It''s not badly done but it''s just not my taste at all.3', '2003-08-14 17:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(388512, 32518, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and focusing in this one!</td>', 'I like the lighting and focusing in this one!', '2003-08-14 17:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(388513, 32876, 2223, '<td valign="top">Challenge met..i think you could have framed it differently, maybe more center, closer. It''s a little bright on the gravestones.</td>', 'Challenge met..i think you could have framed it differently, maybe more center, closer. It''s a little bright on the gravestones.', '2003-08-14 17:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(388516, 32817, 2223, '<td valign="top">challenge met. I think this might be better in color, to bring out the tree and the  wood, maybe try a different angle. Contrast is uneven, too light at the top.</td>', 'challenge met. I think this might be better in color, to bring out the tree and the  wood, maybe try a different angle. Contrast is uneven, too light at the top.', '2003-08-14 17:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(388518, 33232, 9906, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see where the location for this one is.  My favorite so far!!!!!  Kudo''s</td>', 'I can''t wait to see where the location for this one is.  My favorite so far!!!!!  Kudo''s', '2003-08-14 17:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(388519, 32621, 2223, '<td valign="top">Interesting pic, i don''t know how it refers to desolation, even tho i feel like im in a jail cell.</td>', 'Interesting pic, i don''t know how it refers to desolation, even tho i feel like im in a jail cell.', '2003-08-14 17:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(388521, 32407, 3087, '<td valign="top">I can see that this seems to be an abandoned house but am not sure about why this particular scene has been selected other than that sweet kid''s paining left behind.<br/>I think a different viewpoint may have resulted in an image which was stronger overall.<br/>4</td>', 'I can see that this seems to be an abandoned house but am not sure about why this particular scene has been selected other than that sweet kid''s paining left behind.I think a different viewpoint may have resulted in an image which was stronger overall.4', '2003-08-14 17:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(388523, 32671, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... Very good interpretation.</td>', 'Nice shot... Very good interpretation.', '2003-08-14 17:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(388526, 33099, 3087, '<td valign="top">Witty idea but visually not gripping.<br/>3</td>', 'Witty idea but visually not gripping.3', '2003-08-14 17:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(388529, 32815, 3087, '<td valign="top">This says \"seedy\" to me, not desolate though I can follow the thought process that arrives at this as an image of loneliness.<br/>Is the blue colour cast meant to reflect the blue (X rated) nature?<br/>Regardless of content the image just doesn''t work for me.<br/>4</td>', 'This says \"seedy\" to me, not desolate though I can follow the thought process that arrives at this as an image of loneliness.Is the blue colour cast meant to reflect the blue (X rated) nature?Regardless of content the image just doesn''t work for me.4', '2003-08-14 17:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(388530, 33174, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice sun...</td>', 'Nice sun...', '2003-08-14 17:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(388532, 32699, 8377, '<td valign="top">I like your use of tones here and the angle you took this at.  This is definitely one of my favorites.</td>', 'I like your use of tones here and the angle you took this at.  This is definitely one of my favorites.', '2003-08-14 17:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(388533, 32699, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of the head; it fits the snarley tree well.  Great shot.</td>', 'Nice placement of the head; it fits the snarley tree well.  Great shot.', '2003-08-14 17:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(388534, 32935, 8377, '<td valign="top">This one definitely evokes the feeling of desolation.  Its dark, and gloomy and abandoned.  I actually really like the darkness in this picture.  It is such a contrast to the sun coming in the window.  Great shot.</td>', 'This one definitely evokes the feeling of desolation.  Its dark, and gloomy and abandoned.  I actually really like the darkness in this picture.  It is such a contrast to the sun coming in the window.  Great shot.', '2003-08-14 17:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(388536, 32496, 3569, '<td valign="top">Beeophobia...?  She has more nerve than me..  Nice shor.</td>', 'Beeophobia...?  She has more nerve than me..  Nice shor.', '2003-08-14 17:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(388537, 32658, 8377, '<td valign="top">This one looks too digital art for my tastes.  I would prefer it to be a little clearer.</td>', 'This one looks too digital art for my tastes.  I would prefer it to be a little clearer.', '2003-08-14 17:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(388538, 32588, 3569, '<td valign="top">She love''s me....Not!  Focus appears a bit off.  Nice idea though.</td>', 'She love''s me....Not!  Focus appears a bit off.  Nice idea though.', '2003-08-14 17:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(388539, 32427, 8377, '<td valign="top">I really like the darkness in the bottom half of the picture.  I kept thinking everyone would take grayscale pics, but yours and many others I have come across have shown me how great desolation can be portrayed in color.</td>', 'I really like the darkness in the bottom half of the picture.  I kept thinking everyone would take grayscale pics, but yours and many others I have come across have shown me how great desolation can be portrayed in color.', '2003-08-14 17:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(388542, 32926, 3569, '<td valign="top">A little more contrast would have help show the desolation a fire can bring.  Great idea...</td>', 'A little more contrast would have help show the desolation a fire can bring.  Great idea...', '2003-08-14 17:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(388544, 33044, 8377, '<td valign="top">This is great.  It makes it appear that she is caged, and being kept from having fun out there.  I like that her head is down, and she is grasping the fence.  Nice photo.</td>', 'This is great.  It makes it appear that she is caged, and being kept from having fun out there.  I like that her head is down, and she is grasping the fence.  Nice photo.', '2003-08-14 17:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(388545, 32408, 3569, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge well, but focus appears to be off a bit.</td>', 'Meets challenge well, but focus appears to be off a bit.', '2003-08-14 17:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(388546, 33166, 2792, '<td valign="top">Fun title.  Very nice sillouhette (sp?)!</td>', 'Fun title.  Very nice sillouhette (sp?)!', '2003-08-14 17:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(388548, 32947, 3569, '<td valign="top">Tough shot..  I would have cropped this shot just above the eyebrows to avoid the overexposed forehead, but that''s me.</td>', 'Tough shot..  I would have cropped this shot just above the eyebrows to avoid the overexposed forehead, but that''s me.', '2003-08-14 17:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(388549, 33230, 8377, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Definitely shows the desolate, barren feeling.  The photo looks a little grainy, but that could possibly just be my computer.  Overall, I love the photo and it fits the challenge beautifully.</td>', 'I like this.  Definitely shows the desolate, barren feeling.  The photo looks a little grainy, but that could possibly just be my computer.  Overall, I love the photo and it fits the challenge beautifully.', '2003-08-14 17:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(388551, 32819, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...  It fit the challenge quite well in all aspects..</td>', 'Nice shot...  It fit the challenge quite well in all aspects..', '2003-08-14 17:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(388552, 33073, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit more dof would have helped.</td>', 'A bit more dof would have helped.', '2003-08-14 17:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(388553, 33046, 8377, '<td valign="top">Wow, how did you get the sky so black?  The ink-black sky just makes the ground "pop."  I really like this photo.</td>', 'Wow, how did you get the sky so black?  The ink-black sky just makes the ground "pop."  I really like this photo.', '2003-08-14 17:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(388554, 32607, 3569, '<td valign="top">To me this didn''t work in B&amp;W.  But that''s me..</td>', 'To me this didn''t work in B&W.  But that''s me..', '2003-08-14 17:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(388556, 32562, 8377, '<td valign="top">I love how you can see the silohuettes (sp?)  of everything around.  And the sun, it looks so hazy.  This is a wonderful shot and I love the dark black of the ground contrasted with the grey of the sky and lightness of the sun.</td>', 'I love how you can see the silohuettes (sp?)  of everything around.  And the sun, it looks so hazy.  This is a wonderful shot and I love the dark black of the ground contrasted with the grey of the sky and lightness of the sun.', '2003-08-14 17:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(388562, 33198, 9411, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid the beautiful sunset/rise gives this shot too much "hope" to be truly desolate. It more says isolated.</td>', 'I''m afraid the beautiful sunset/rise gives this shot too much "hope" to be truly desolate. It more says isolated.', '2003-08-14 17:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(388563, 33045, 4517, '<td valign="top">Colours look great.. 9</td>', 'Colours look great.. 9', '2003-08-14 17:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(388564, 33079, 8377, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  Love the sky and the darkness of the tree?  Branch?  Either way, its great.</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  Love the sky and the darkness of the tree?  Branch?  Either way, its great.', '2003-08-14 17:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(388565, 33101, 3569, '<td valign="top">More contrast would of help increase my vote.</td>', 'More contrast would of help increase my vote.', '2003-08-14 17:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(388566, 32897, 3569, '<td valign="top">But he still has chips!</td>', 'But he still has chips!', '2003-08-14 17:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(388568, 33109, 3569, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation,  This is what I was thinking of desolution.  SW desert...  Great job.</td>', 'Excellent interpretation,  This is what I was thinking of desolution.  SW desert...  Great job.', '2003-08-14 17:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(388570, 33081, 3569, '<td valign="top">This one I''d like to see also in color.  Nice shot.</td>', 'This one I''d like to see also in color.  Nice shot.', '2003-08-14 17:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
