(388923, 33219, 9885, '<td valign="top">good idea. The two black areas should meet at a sharp point. Also, the bowl of marbles appears to be slightly out of focus</td>', 'good idea. The two black areas should meet at a sharp point. Also, the bowl of marbles appears to be slightly out of focus', '2003-08-15 01:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(388926, 32407, 9582, '<td valign="top">Very effective photo. All elements of the photo work well.</td>', 'Very effective photo. All elements of the photo work well.', '2003-08-15 01:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(388928, 33109, 9582, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition.', '2003-08-15 01:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(388931, 33210, 9582, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. The composition is nice and it is a very interesting photo. It''s a 10 in my eyes.</td>', 'I love this photo. The composition is nice and it is a very interesting photo. It''s a 10 in my eyes.', '2003-08-15 01:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(388951, 32496, 9809, '<td valign="top">I take it SOMEONE around there is a bee keeper. You wouldn''t catch ME as your model in this one YIKES! Nicely done.</td>', 'I take it SOMEONE around there is a bee keeper. You wouldn''t catch ME as your model in this one YIKES! Nicely done.', '2003-08-15 02:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(388954, 32762, 9809, '<td valign="top">Sometimes the focus on the foreground object, the fence in this case, is effective. In this case though, I''d wished you focused on the towers in the background.</td>', 'Sometimes the focus on the foreground object, the fence in this case, is effective. In this case though, I''d wished you focused on the towers in the background.', '2003-08-15 02:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(388956, 33045, 9809, '<td valign="top">Excellent. The colors are wonderful. It appears as if you pushed the saturation to the max, but it certainly works here. Nice job. As soon as I can, I''m adding this shot to my favorites -- this will be only the second picture to make that list. Congratuations. If you don''t ribbon, I''ll be surprised.</td>', 'Excellent. The colors are wonderful. It appears as if you pushed the saturation to the max, but it certainly works here. Nice job. As soon as I can, I''m adding this shot to my favorites -- this will be only the second picture to make that list. Congratuations. If you don''t ribbon, I''ll be surprised.', '2003-08-15 02:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(388963, 33045, 9885, '<td valign="top">incredible colours</td>', 'incredible colours', '2003-08-15 03:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(388977, 33204, 10739, '<td valign="top">I think you are trusting too much on a phrase showed in the picture. May be this may evoke desolation to somebody involved in some tragic event, but you should look that the picture as a whole transmit that feeling. The composition is nice anyway.</td>', 'I think you are trusting too much on a phrase showed in the picture. May be this may evoke desolation to somebody involved in some tragic event, but you should look that the picture as a whole transmit that feeling. The composition is nice anyway.', '2003-08-15 05:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(388979, 32960, 10739, '<td valign="top">It''s just a building. You have to carefully look to the broken windows to actually evoke destruction. May be a closer look could have produced better pictures</td>', 'It''s just a building. You have to carefully look to the broken windows to actually evoke destruction. May be a closer look could have produced better pictures', '2003-08-15 05:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(388980, 33018, 10739, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, but I would like to see more empty spaces together with the main subject</td>', 'I like the colors, but I would like to see more empty spaces together with the main subject', '2003-08-15 05:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(388981, 33086, 9982, '<td valign="top">Could have lost the first half of the title. Great shot though. So evocative. [10]</td>', 'Could have lost the first half of the title. Great shot though. So evocative. [10]', '2003-08-15 05:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(388982, 32718, 10739, '<td valign="top">Actually is a nice picture, but it evokes (for me) more a feeling of "past" than "desolation"</td>', 'Actually is a nice picture, but it evokes (for me) more a feeling of "past" than "desolation"', '2003-08-15 05:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
