(389165, 32658, 1202, '<td valign="top">You are a little lacking in detail for me to relate this to desolation.  I can''t simply look at this and get the feeling of desolation, can you?  3</td>', 'You are a little lacking in detail for me to relate this to desolation.  I can''t simply look at this and get the feeling of desolation, can you?  3', '2003-08-15 12:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(389167, 33202, 1202, '<td valign="top">Your picture definately show abandonment but the graffiti tells me it is visited frequently.   This in it''self removes it from the desolation scene for me.  4</td>', 'Your picture definately show abandonment but the graffiti tells me it is visited frequently.   This in it''self removes it from the desolation scene for me.  4', '2003-08-15 12:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(389168, 33156, 1202, '<td valign="top">If the array of skeletal remains were in the natural form of something dying and not disturbed, this would be a powerful shot.  As it is little real story of desolation is there, at least for me.  5</td>', 'If the array of skeletal remains were in the natural form of something dying and not disturbed, this would be a powerful shot.  As it is little real story of desolation is there, at least for me.  5', '2003-08-15 12:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(389171, 32718, 8268, '<td valign="top">nice.. =)</td>', 'nice.. =)', '2003-08-15 12:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(389172, 32960, 1202, '<td valign="top">I get a feeling of abandonment but not a strong sense of desolation.  5</td>', 'I get a feeling of abandonment but not a strong sense of desolation.  5', '2003-08-15 12:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(389173, 33048, 1202, '<td valign="top">The chain is left alone, right.  I feel the boy should be in focus.  I am trying to get inside this shot, but I can''t see your point of view.   Sorry, that I am unable to connect.  4</td>', 'The chain is left alone, right.  I feel the boy should be in focus.  I am trying to get inside this shot, but I can''t see your point of view.   Sorry, that I am unable to connect.  4', '2003-08-15 12:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(389175, 32357, 1202, '<td valign="top">Your subject is in such a beautiful place I think more of meditation than desolution.  Good compostion.  6</td>', 'Your subject is in such a beautiful place I think more of meditation than desolution.  Good compostion.  6', '2003-08-15 12:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(389177, 32814, 1202, '<td valign="top">I think this guy has enough "plastic" to keep from being very desolate.  Nice idea, too nice a subject.  5</td>', 'I think this guy has enough "plastic" to keep from being very desolate.  Nice idea, too nice a subject.  5', '2003-08-15 12:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(389186, 32357, 10402, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image and technically well done. I like the composition and the symmetry. It doesn''t seem very desolate to me, probably because I enjoy being alone and would love to be in this setting for my pondering and prayer time. But that''s just me; the difference between loneliness and aloneness is internal and difficult to express visually.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image and technically well done. I like the composition and the symmetry. It doesn''t seem very desolate to me, probably because I enjoy being alone and would love to be in this setting for my pondering and prayer time. But that''s just me; the difference between loneliness and aloneness is internal and difficult to express visually.', '2003-08-15 13:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(389190, 33045, 10402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and well focused. Seems a bit over-sharpened, but that may be the monitor I''m using (not my calibrated one at home). Conveys desolation well. I wish there was a bit of space to the left of the tree like there is to the right.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and well focused. Seems a bit over-sharpened, but that may be the monitor I''m using (not my calibrated one at home). Conveys desolation well. I wish there was a bit of space to the left of the tree like there is to the right.', '2003-08-15 13:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(389191, 32407, 10763, '<td valign="top">whoa where did u take this?</td>', 'whoa where did u take this?', '2003-08-15 13:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(389194, 32477, 10763, '<td valign="top">nice view</td>', 'nice view', '2003-08-15 13:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(389199, 33182, 10402, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent and emotional portrayal of desolation. Nice contrast between the bare walls in the top half and the busy photos in the bottom half. The lines in the floor, baseboards, and corner lead the eye to the subject, whose posture is great for this image. You''ve controlled the depth of field perfectly; the person is in focus and the photos are blurred just enough to be recognizable without them being too distracting.</td>', 'This is an excellent and emotional portrayal of desolation. Nice contrast between the bare walls in the top half and the busy photos in the bottom half. The lines in the floor, baseboards, and corner lead the eye to the subject, whose posture is great for this image. You''ve controlled the depth of field perfectly; the person is in focus and the photos are blurred just enough to be recognizable without them being too distracting.', '2003-08-15 13:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(389202, 32993, 10402, '<td valign="top">The vertical lines in the rotting wood contrast nicely with the horizontal lines in the water. The use of the raven as a symbol of desolation is a nice touch, and the title nicely ties the photo to Poe''s literary masterpiece on the subject.</td>', 'The vertical lines in the rotting wood contrast nicely with the horizontal lines in the water. The use of the raven as a symbol of desolation is a nice touch, and the title nicely ties the photo to Poe''s literary masterpiece on the subject.', '2003-08-15 13:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(389203, 33119, 5044, '<td valign="top">This shot both disgusts me and amazes me. I can only begin to imagine what happened to these poor animals. Well composed and great detail. Only thing I would have changed, is to try to get more depth into the horizon, which would have added a sense of great vastness and loneliness. Great capture!</td>', 'This shot both disgusts me and amazes me. I can only begin to imagine what happened to these poor animals. Well composed and great detail. Only thing I would have changed, is to try to get more depth into the horizon, which would have added a sense of great vastness and loneliness. Great capture!', '2003-08-15 13:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(389207, 32783, 10402, '<td valign="top">The subject''s expression, the way she is lit, and the decrepit surroundings combine to make an emotional portrayal of desolation here. The title adds further emphasis.</td>', 'The subject''s expression, the way she is lit, and the decrepit surroundings combine to make an emotional portrayal of desolation here. The title adds further emphasis.', '2003-08-15 14:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(389209, 33239, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the smoke. This is certainly a desolate place. Seems a bit pixelated.</td>', 'I like the colors and the smoke. This is certainly a desolate place. Seems a bit pixelated.', '2003-08-15 14:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(389211, 32562, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette. The moon is in just the right place, framed by the trees (although a bit low for "midnight"). There is perhaps a bit too much black at the bottom; this image would probably work well cropped as a panorama.</td>', 'Nice silhouette. The moon is in just the right place, framed by the trees (although a bit low for "midnight"). There is perhaps a bit too much black at the bottom; this image would probably work well cropped as a panorama.', '2003-08-15 14:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(389212, 33182, 9679, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The exposure is a little too dark for my preferences and that shadow on the lefthand side distracts from the main subject.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The exposure is a little too dark for my preferences and that shadow on the lefthand side distracts from the main subject.', '2003-08-15 14:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(389216, 33219, 9679, '<td valign="top">There are some beautiful colors in the glass balls, but I find my focus being diverted to the black squares. Interesting concept, but it doesn''t evoke a lot of emotional response for me.</td>', 'There are some beautiful colors in the glass balls, but I find my focus being diverted to the black squares. Interesting concept, but it doesn''t evoke a lot of emotional response for me.', '2003-08-15 14:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(389219, 32899, 9679, '<td valign="top">Definitely conveys a sense of abandonment. IMO it would have been more effective on a cloudy or rainy day, but of course you can''t control the weather, can you? :)</td>', 'Definitely conveys a sense of abandonment. IMO it would have been more effective on a cloudy or rainy day, but of course you can''t control the weather, can you? :)', '2003-08-15 14:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(389226, 33063, 9679, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and the light and shadows on the floor add to the visual interest without detracting from the sense of abandonment and decline.</td>', 'Good exposure and the light and shadows on the floor add to the visual interest without detracting from the sense of abandonment and decline.', '2003-08-15 14:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(389231, 32464, 4517, '<td valign="top">ok pic but could be sharper.5</td>', 'ok pic but could be sharper.5', '2003-08-15 14:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(389233, 33105, 1570, '<td valign="top">very powerful, but much too small, i wish it could be larger sized... still, 7.</td>', 'very powerful, but much too small, i wish it could be larger sized... still, 7.', '2003-08-15 14:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(389239, 32680, 11127, '<td valign="top">Good shot.</td>', 'Good shot.', '2003-08-15 14:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(389240, 33035, 9679, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and good detail. It looks to be sharpened just a fraction too much. This certainly fits the challenge and has a gloomy look. BTW, nice title.</td>', 'Nice exposure and good detail. It looks to be sharpened just a fraction too much. This certainly fits the challenge and has a gloomy look. BTW, nice title.', '2003-08-15 14:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(389244, 33073, 9679, '<td valign="top">I like the hint of an S-curve and the smoke plumes certainly add interest. I wonder if it might have been even more dynamic if you''d placed the horizon line higher or lower so that the image isn''t divided in half.</td>', 'I like the hint of an S-curve and the smoke plumes certainly add interest. I wonder if it might have been even more dynamic if you''d placed the horizon line higher or lower so that the image isn''t divided in half.', '2003-08-15 14:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(389248, 32814, 9679, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed image. Good contrast and positioning of all the elements in this photo. My only quibble with it is that this person looks too well dressed and well groomed to evoke much sympathy for his lack of pocket change.  8</td>', 'Very nicely composed image. Good contrast and positioning of all the elements in this photo. My only quibble with it is that this person looks too well dressed and well groomed to evoke much sympathy for his lack of pocket change.  8', '2003-08-15 14:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(389249, 33206, 9679, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I only see one face. Nice texture in the water and rock. I don''t quite get a sense of desolation though.</td>', 'Hmmm... I only see one face. Nice texture in the water and rock. I don''t quite get a sense of desolation though.', '2003-08-15 14:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(389250, 32771, 9679, '<td valign="top">This is certainly a visually interesting image. Makes me want to know the story behind it. Unfortunately, I can''t really connect it with a sense of desolation.</td>', 'This is certainly a visually interesting image. Makes me want to know the story behind it. Unfortunately, I can''t really connect it with a sense of desolation.', '2003-08-15 14:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(389251, 32768, 1570, '<td valign="top">i do hope that he(or she) feels better by now... the background is a little busy... 6.</td>', 'i do hope that he(or she) feels better by now... the background is a little busy... 6.', '2003-08-15 15:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(389252, 33228, 1570, '<td valign="top">how sad... it really is! the sky also works very well here... 8.</td>', 'how sad... it really is! the sky also works very well here... 8.', '2003-08-15 15:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(389253, 33233, 9679, '<td valign="top">Unusual point of view really works for me. I like the texture and lines too.</td>', 'Unusual point of view really works for me. I like the texture and lines too.', '2003-08-15 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(389255, 32936, 9679, '<td valign="top">Well composed photo with a subtle diagonal leading me from the walkway to the clouds. The landscape is certainly stark, but the bright blue sky and picnic table and grill tend to work against the topic for me.</td>', 'Well composed photo with a subtle diagonal leading me from the walkway to the clouds. The landscape is certainly stark, but the bright blue sky and picnic table and grill tend to work against the topic for me.', '2003-08-15 15:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(389271, 33205, 4517, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot but pushing your luck to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting shot but pushing your luck to meet the challenge.', '2003-08-15 15:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(389284, 32621, 3087, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your PM response to my questions about your thoughts behind this. It''s always interesting to me to hear the thought processes behind people''s images. I think if this were being presented solely as a peice of art in a modern art gallery that it would be well received. In those situations the theme or thought process is often seen merely as a starting point for inspiring the artist''s creativity. My feeling is that this particular environment is a little different because it involves creating an image based on a theme where that theme can be discerned by the viewers in the final image. On that level I just don''t feel, personally, that this image succeeds. I do think it succeeds on other levels - I like the design itself, the light and shadow and geometric style. I look forward to seeing more work from you in the future.</td>', 'Thank you for your PM response to my questions about your thoughts behind this. It''s always interesting to me to hear the thought processes behind people''s images. I think if this were being presented solely as a peice of art in a modern art gallery that it would be well received. In those situations the theme or thought process is often seen merely as a starting point for inspiring the artist''s creativity. My feeling is that this particular environment is a little different because it involves creating an image based on a theme where that theme can be discerned by the viewers in the final image. On that level I just don''t feel, personally, that this image succeeds. I do think it succeeds on other levels - I like the design itself, the light and shadow and geometric style. I look forward to seeing more work from you in the future.', '2003-08-15 16:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(389288, 33196, 3087, '<td valign="top">My feeling about this image is that you may have concentrated so hard on showing a desolate scene that you have overlooked the importance of presenting an image that works in it''s own right. Although the abandoned bus ticket is the focal point and presumably the subject the thing that stands out most to me is the unattractive metal gate/ shelter/ signpost at the left of the frame. I feel it makes the composition weak. I wonder if it might be stronger if the image contains the same bus ticket (or other litter) on it''s own on the paving? The texture, dirt and strong lines of the paving have some interest and might give more focus to the ticket?<br/>4</td>', 'My feeling about this image is that you may have concentrated so hard on showing a desolate scene that you have overlooked the importance of presenting an image that works in it''s own right. Although the abandoned bus ticket is the focal point and presumably the subject the thing that stands out most to me is the unattractive metal gate/ shelter/ signpost at the left of the frame. I feel it makes the composition weak. I wonder if it might be stronger if the image contains the same bus ticket (or other litter) on it''s own on the paving? The texture, dirt and strong lines of the paving have some interest and might give more focus to the ticket?4', '2003-08-15 16:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(389290, 32582, 3087, '<td valign="top">Too much light reflection and not visually appealing to look at.<br/>I can see that this was an attempt at a humourous entry but it just doesn''t work on any level for me.<br/>4</td>', 'Too much light reflection and not visually appealing to look at.I can see that this was an attempt at a humourous entry but it just doesn''t work on any level for me.4', '2003-08-15 16:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(389291, 32801, 3087, '<td valign="top">Minimalist certainly though it doesn''t say desolate to me. I just think "nice plastering job!". There just isn''t anything in this image to grab my interest at all.<br/>4</td>', 'Minimalist certainly though it doesn''t say desolate to me. I just think "nice plastering job!". There just isn''t anything in this image to grab my interest at all.4', '2003-08-15 16:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(389295, 33134, 8860, '<td valign="top">I love the shot, but I just can''t describe it as desolation. It''s fascinating as a scene, crisp and contrasty but it''s just too off the challenge.</td>', 'I love the shot, but I just can''t describe it as desolation. It''s fascinating as a scene, crisp and contrasty but it''s just too off the challenge.', '2003-08-15 16:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(389297, 32682, 8860, '<td valign="top">The flash makes the viewer too aware of a presence which quells the essence of desolation. If this were less brightly lit, off centre and perhaps taken from further back the effect would have been increased.</td>', 'The flash makes the viewer too aware of a presence which quells the essence of desolation. If this were less brightly lit, off centre and perhaps taken from further back the effect would have been increased.', '2003-08-15 16:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(389298, 32814, 8860, '<td valign="top">This person does not look particularly bereft of cash to me! He could at least sell his decent clothes before being ''desolate''. Image is too soft focus with too slow a shutter speed. Good composition.</td>', 'This person does not look particularly bereft of cash to me! He could at least sell his decent clothes before being ''desolate''. Image is too soft focus with too slow a shutter speed. Good composition.', '2003-08-15 16:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(389299, 33186, 3575, '<td valign="top">I''m ignorant about what I''m looking at -- don''t know what the structures are -- but I will take your word that they something of a desolate nature :). Amazing clouds. I love the high contrast between the light and dark portions. I think you chose to compose this shot perfectly making the clouds predominant. Very, very nice.</td>', 'I''m ignorant about what I''m looking at -- don''t know what the structures are -- but I will take your word that they something of a desolate nature :). Amazing clouds. I love the high contrast between the light and dark portions. I think you chose to compose this shot perfectly making the clouds predominant. Very, very nice.', '2003-08-15 16:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(389300, 32797, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a great sculpture - not at all desolate though. Good composition and tones.</td>', 'What a great sculpture - not at all desolate though. Good composition and tones.', '2003-08-15 16:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(389301, 32518, 3575, '<td valign="top">Interesting point of view, right down on the ground. I do think it would be better though with a crop done just before the blurred focus area. It is difficult to tell but it looks like you had a few clouds on blue sky to work with. If that was the case, a polarizing filter would have helped deepen the color of the sky.</td>', 'Interesting point of view, right down on the ground. I do think it would be better though with a crop done just before the blurred focus area. It is difficult to tell but it looks like you had a few clouds on blue sky to work with. If that was the case, a polarizing filter would have helped deepen the color of the sky.', '2003-08-15 16:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(389303, 33017, 3575, '<td valign="top">incredible colors! I have never seen the sky that pink! I will be interested to find out if that was some PS adjust or natural.</td>', 'incredible colors! I have never seen the sky that pink! I will be interested to find out if that was some PS adjust or natural.', '2003-08-15 16:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(389304, 33027, 3575, '<td valign="top">Your composition is beautifully done! I also like the choice of sepia. Nice job.</td>', 'Your composition is beautifully done! I also like the choice of sepia. Nice job.', '2003-08-15 16:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(389305, 33106, 8860, '<td valign="top">This looks like a potentially tragic scene. I hope all is/was well. I can imagine that, if this is someone''s daughter, a mother would certainly feel desolate. Lack of context makes ''unravelling'' the image quite difficult though and it suffers a fair bit of noise. [8]</td>', 'This looks like a potentially tragic scene. I hope all is/was well. I can imagine that, if this is someone''s daughter, a mother would certainly feel desolate. Lack of context makes ''unravelling'' the image quite difficult though and it suffers a fair bit of noise. [8]', '2003-08-15 16:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(389306, 33223, 3575, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot and definately meets the challenge. I would like to see more contrast in the shot so that the details show up better. Also, IMO, when taking a photo like this, I want to have the entire tree in the shot with some breathing room. I imaging that the close crop was due to other items intruding on the scene and you take what you can get, right?</td>', 'This is a nice shot and definately meets the challenge. I would like to see more contrast in the shot so that the details show up better. Also, IMO, when taking a photo like this, I want to have the entire tree in the shot with some breathing room. I imaging that the close crop was due to other items intruding on the scene and you take what you can get, right?', '2003-08-15 16:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(389308, 33086, 3575, '<td valign="top">Very upsetting photo. These people once had a hopeful future and now, devoid of any it certainly meets the challenge. Nice, brave work.</td>', 'Very upsetting photo. These people once had a hopeful future and now, devoid of any it certainly meets the challenge. Nice, brave work.', '2003-08-15 17:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(389311, 33220, 3575, '<td valign="top">What an incredible face! Well done!</td>', 'What an incredible face! Well done!', '2003-08-15 17:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(389312, 33005, 8860, '<td valign="top">Despite this man''s obvious plight, he actually looks quite content with his situation in life (at least in this picture). I wouldn''t describe this as desolation just because he seems worse off for his disability compared to an able-bodied person. His canine companion probably delivers much happiness, which seems evident. A great shot and an excellent study and capture, but slightly off-brief.</td>', 'Despite this man''s obvious plight, he actually looks quite content with his situation in life (at least in this picture). I wouldn''t describe this as desolation just because he seems worse off for his disability compared to an able-bodied person. His canine companion probably delivers much happiness, which seems evident. A great shot and an excellent study and capture, but slightly off-brief.', '2003-08-15 17:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(389313, 33130, 3575, '<td valign="top">The opposite of desolate :)  Great find.</td>', 'The opposite of desolate :)  Great find.', '2003-08-15 17:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(389314, 32407, 3575, '<td valign="top">OMG, that child''s painting is very haunting in this setting. Wow, I got chills. Really nice work. 10 because I really felt this.</td>', 'OMG, that child''s painting is very haunting in this setting. Wow, I got chills. Really nice work. 10 because I really felt this.', '2003-08-15 17:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(389317, 32671, 3575, '<td valign="top">Hooray! A desolate place! Normally I would like a desert photographed with some dawn or dusk light to give it some life but the flat light you found just added to the feelilng of desolation. Excellent composition - putting the driftwood in the forefront like you did really works. I expect to see a scorpien crawel out from the crack in the log. Interesting choice of tone with the sepia.</td>', 'Hooray! A desolate place! Normally I would like a desert photographed with some dawn or dusk light to give it some life but the flat light you found just added to the feelilng of desolation. Excellent composition - putting the driftwood in the forefront like you did really works. I expect to see a scorpien crawel out from the crack in the log. Interesting choice of tone with the sepia.', '2003-08-15 17:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(389319, 33225, 3575, '<td valign="top">I think it would be more desolate looking without the bikes and person. Although it appears to be quite a lilfeless place, otherwise.</td>', 'I think it would be more desolate looking without the bikes and person. Although it appears to be quite a lilfeless place, otherwise.', '2003-08-15 17:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(389321, 32658, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid it''s waaaay too dark to be able to tell what''s happening here.  Sorry...</td>', 'I''m afraid it''s waaaay too dark to be able to tell what''s happening here.  Sorry...', '2003-08-15 17:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(389322, 32895, 3575, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Wonderful clarity. I love that little toy in his back pocket. I wonder about the story behind that. The way the man is leaning his head on the broom, really shows emotion - sadness, hopelessness, desolation.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Wonderful clarity. I love that little toy in his back pocket. I wonder about the story behind that. The way the man is leaning his head on the broom, really shows emotion - sadness, hopelessness, desolation.', '2003-08-15 17:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(389323, 33164, 3575, '<td valign="top">You could have cropped out the beach and surf in the foreground but you didn''t and I think that was a great decision. It adds something to the shot, so thanks for leaving it in. The photo could be a little bit clearer with slightly more contrast. Nice job.</td>', 'You could have cropped out the beach and surf in the foreground but you didn''t and I think that was a great decision. It adds something to the shot, so thanks for leaving it in. The photo could be a little bit clearer with slightly more contrast. Nice job.', '2003-08-15 17:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(389324, 32693, 3102, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks!  Quite a beautiful scene.  Seems like there''s a teensy bit too much sky -- that''s the only thing keeping this at a 9 instead of 10 for me.</td>', 'One of my top picks!  Quite a beautiful scene.  Seems like there''s a teensy bit too much sky -- that''s the only thing keeping this at a 9 instead of 10 for me.', '2003-08-15 17:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(389325, 32947, 3102, '<td valign="top">This one is definitely teetering on a 10!  The lighting seems just a bit harsh on the forehead -- otherwise, it''s awesome.</td>', 'This one is definitely teetering on a 10!  The lighting seems just a bit harsh on the forehead -- otherwise, it''s awesome.', '2003-08-15 17:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(389326, 32357, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! "cry me a river". Beautiful calm water.  I think the sky is just a little too light for the rest of the photo but you can''t do anything about it for the contest. My favorite thing to do in cases like this, if my polarizer filter doesn''t help with the exposure is to use my graduated gray filter. It would have worked well here. I can''t wait to find out where this was taken, it''s such a beautiful, calm water.</td>', 'Wonderful! "cry me a river". Beautiful calm water.  I think the sky is just a little too light for the rest of the photo but you can''t do anything about it for the contest. My favorite thing to do in cases like this, if my polarizer filter doesn''t help with the exposure is to use my graduated gray filter. It would have worked well here. I can''t wait to find out where this was taken, it''s such a beautiful, calm water.', '2003-08-15 17:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(389328, 33141, 3575, '<td valign="top">It has a very strange look. The green on the water looks as though it is glowing, giving the appearance of toxic waste and a very desolate place.  It is a little dark for me, I would like to be able to make out the structures a little better.</td>', 'It has a very strange look. The green on the water looks as though it is glowing, giving the appearance of toxic waste and a very desolate place.  It is a little dark for me, I would like to be able to make out the structures a little better.', '2003-08-15 17:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(389331, 33199, 3575, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. I like the tree in the scene, it adds age and interest. Well done.</td>', 'Very, very nice. I like the tree in the scene, it adds age and interest. Well done.', '2003-08-15 17:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(389332, 32861, 3575, '<td valign="top">You colorized this somehow because I see a lot of unnatural pink/red but I like it.</td>', 'You colorized this somehow because I see a lot of unnatural pink/red but I like it.', '2003-08-15 17:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(389344, 33199, 11111, '<td valign="top">The tree and house loom over the entrance to create a feeling of foreboding in addition to a sense of abandonment. The sliver of light to the left is a little distracting, but I like this a lot. 9</td>', 'The tree and house loom over the entrance to create a feeling of foreboding in addition to a sense of abandonment. The sliver of light to the left is a little distracting, but I like this a lot. 9', '2003-08-15 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(389348, 33202, 11111, '<td valign="top">Nice balance! I think the sepia works well and I like the way you''ve framed this, too. You''ve managed to organize the mess before you. 9</td>', 'Nice balance! I think the sepia works well and I like the way you''ve framed this, too. You''ve managed to organize the mess before you. 9', '2003-08-15 18:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(389351, 33233, 11111, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. It seems like everyone''s gone but you! Nice depth. Good sense of movement with the circular rails.</td>', 'This is wonderful. It seems like everyone''s gone but you! Nice depth. Good sense of movement with the circular rails.', '2003-08-15 18:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(389352, 33204, 11111, '<td valign="top">Very moving. Nicely framed - tells the story without whopping you over the head with a tearful child''s face.  Perfect subject for the theme.</td>', 'Very moving. Nicely framed - tells the story without whopping you over the head with a tearful child''s face.  Perfect subject for the theme.', '2003-08-15 18:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(389355, 32774, 11111, '<td valign="top">Like the color scheme a whole lot! Looks like a watercolor.</td>', 'Like the color scheme a whole lot! Looks like a watercolor.', '2003-08-15 18:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(389356, 33133, 9679, '<td valign="top">I''m not at all sure insects experience emotions, but I really like this shot. Nice macro. I would have cropped a little bit more off the left and bottom, but it''s still got interesting lines.</td>', 'I''m not at all sure insects experience emotions, but I really like this shot. Nice macro. I would have cropped a little bit more off the left and bottom, but it''s still got interesting lines.', '2003-08-15 18:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(389357, 32656, 9679, '<td valign="top">I like this composition a lot. I''m surprised that so much can be conveyed in what amounts to a small proportion of the image through the use of lighting. Really nice!</td>', 'I like this composition a lot. I''m surprised that so much can be conveyed in what amounts to a small proportion of the image through the use of lighting. Really nice!', '2003-08-15 18:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(389366, 33118, 3102, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  The fog is a great touch.</td>', 'Excellent!  The fog is a great touch.', '2003-08-15 18:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(389367, 33166, 3102, '<td valign="top">My only 10 of the challenge.  Very nicely done!  The exposure is great!</td>', 'My only 10 of the challenge.  Very nicely done!  The exposure is great!', '2003-08-15 18:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(389368, 32496, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you guys are beekeepers or something?  I think if this was anyone other than someone who regularly deals with bees, the only picture would be as the result of the shutter being bumped as the camera fell to the ground while the photographer scrambled to get the hell outta there!</td>', 'I''m guessing you guys are beekeepers or something?  I think if this was anyone other than someone who regularly deals with bees, the only picture would be as the result of the shutter being bumped as the camera fell to the ground while the photographer scrambled to get the hell outta there!', '2003-08-15 18:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(389369, 33078, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looks a little Blair Witchy to me... I''m honestly not fond of the effect as I can barely tell what''s going on.</td>', 'Looks a little Blair Witchy to me... I''m honestly not fond of the effect as I can barely tell what''s going on.', '2003-08-15 18:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(389370, 32477, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid it is a bit grainy and tilted, and lacks a real focal point.</td>', 'I''m afraid it is a bit grainy and tilted, and lacks a real focal point.', '2003-08-15 18:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(389376, 32671, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful desert shot ,sepia works well here,10!</td>', 'Beautiful desert shot ,sepia works well here,10!', '2003-08-15 19:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(389377, 33045, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful poster 10 from me!</td>', 'Beautiful poster 10 from me!', '2003-08-15 19:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(389378, 32344, 6405, '<td valign="top">Cute Russian grandma,10 from me!</td>', 'Cute Russian grandma,10 from me!', '2003-08-15 19:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(389379, 32668, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice composition Meets the challenge 10 from me!</td>', 'Nice composition Meets the challenge 10 from me!', '2003-08-15 19:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(389380, 33133, 6405, '<td valign="top">He is really calling up! 10 from me!</td>', 'He is really calling up! 10 from me!', '2003-08-15 19:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(389396, 32752, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like your approach to the challenge. I like the choice of subject and the arrangement of the objects. The title is essential to properly interpret the photo which will bother some people, but I like it. The obvious pixelation adds a fuzziness to the image that adds to its character and enhances its message; this is a uniquely digital technique that I think should be used more often. But you need to watch for diagonal lines like the shadow on the left that gives a stair effect with large pixels. This photo would be a lot more effective if the overall tone was darker and the lighting was softer (the glare across the sewing machine, which should be dark, is especially distracting). A more interesting background would be helpful as well.</td>', 'I like your approach to the challenge. I like the choice of subject and the arrangement of the objects. The title is essential to properly interpret the photo which will bother some people, but I like it. The obvious pixelation adds a fuzziness to the image that adds to its character and enhances its message; this is a uniquely digital technique that I think should be used more often. But you need to watch for diagonal lines like the shadow on the left that gives a stair effect with large pixels. This photo would be a lot more effective if the overall tone was darker and the lighting was softer (the glare across the sewing machine, which should be dark, is especially distracting). A more interesting background would be helpful as well.', '2003-08-15 20:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(389403, 33164, 10263, '<td valign="top">It looks very desolate. There is too much negative space for my taste</td>', 'It looks very desolate. There is too much negative space for my taste', '2003-08-15 20:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(389404, 33197, 10263, '<td valign="top">Fits the subject well. The white frame distracts from the photo to me though</td>', 'Fits the subject well. The white frame distracts from the photo to me though', '2003-08-15 20:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(389405, 32397, 10263, '<td valign="top">I don''t see it fitting the subject and the photo is too cluttered.</td>', 'I don''t see it fitting the subject and the photo is too cluttered.', '2003-08-15 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(389406, 32656, 10263, '<td valign="top">Way to dark for me to see it. On my computer everything is black except the upper left corner.</td>', 'Way to dark for me to see it. On my computer everything is black except the upper left corner.', '2003-08-15 20:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(389408, 32621, 10263, '<td valign="top">I''m missing the desolate part totally. The lines aren''t interesting enough to make me want to look at the photo more than once.</td>', 'I''m missing the desolate part totally. The lines aren''t interesting enough to make me want to look at the photo more than once.', '2003-08-15 20:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(389410, 32562, 2158, '<td valign="top">Personally I''d prefer this with some of the black cropped away so that the division isn''t so close to the centre.</td>', 'Personally I''d prefer this with some of the black cropped away so that the division isn''t so close to the centre.', '2003-08-15 20:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(389411, 33109, 10263, '<td valign="top">Now this is desolate. I love it. I have a weakness for old dead trees and this is a good one. The shadow adds the perfect touch.</td>', 'Now this is desolate. I love it. I have a weakness for old dead trees and this is a good one. The shadow adds the perfect touch.', '2003-08-15 20:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(389412, 33130, 10263, '<td valign="top">This should be your negative space submission :) interesting interpretation. There isn''t enough there to hold my interest though.</td>', 'This should be your negative space submission :) interesting interpretation. There isn''t enough there to hold my interest though.', '2003-08-15 20:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(389413, 32599, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is great lol. Nice interpretation of the subject. Colors are good, DoF is good</td>', 'This is great lol. Nice interpretation of the subject. Colors are good, DoF is good', '2003-08-15 20:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(389415, 33072, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is disturbing so I guess you did good :) I keep staring at it wondering what she''s thinking. The human services worker in me makes me want to do something for her but she would probably SAY she could handle it herself. GOOD JOB 10</td>', 'This is disturbing so I guess you did good :) I keep staring at it wondering what she''s thinking. The human services worker in me makes me want to do something for her but she would probably SAY she could handle it herself. GOOD JOB 10', '2003-08-15 20:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(389417, 32818, 10263, '<td valign="top">lol.. most definately so :) I love this 8</td>', 'lol.. most definately so :) I love this 8', '2003-08-15 20:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(389419, 32854, 10263, '<td valign="top">excellent photo but doesn''t fit the subject for me</td>', 'excellent photo but doesn''t fit the subject for me', '2003-08-15 20:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(389420, 32989, 10263, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. With that white frame it reminds me of a polariod</td>', 'Beautiful colors. With that white frame it reminds me of a polariod', '2003-08-15 20:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(389422, 33101, 10263, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful tree. If the photo was a little more focused and the subject wasn''t as centered I would like this better.</td>', 'What a wonderful tree. If the photo was a little more focused and the subject wasn''t as centered I would like this better.', '2003-08-15 21:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(389431, 33147, 10799, '<td valign="top">The very bright red in the background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'The very bright red in the background is a bit distracting.', '2003-08-15 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(389432, 32825, 10799, '<td valign="top">I like the emotion of this.  The barefeet and black clothes add to the desolate feeling.</td>', 'I like the emotion of this.  The barefeet and black clothes add to the desolate feeling.', '2003-08-15 21:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(389433, 33176, 10799, '<td valign="top">whatever it was... it sure is desolate!  I love the color of the background.  The rock in front add to the total composition.</td>', 'whatever it was... it sure is desolate!  I love the color of the background.  The rock in front add to the total composition.', '2003-08-15 21:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(389434, 33124, 10799, '<td valign="top">This says desolate many times over......... I like the way the rust shows up</td>', 'This says desolate many times over......... I like the way the rust shows up', '2003-08-15 21:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(389438, 33165, 7810, '<td valign="top">like the colours ...cool shot</td>', 'like the colours ...cool shot', '2003-08-15 21:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(389440, 33237, 7810, '<td valign="top">nice lighting...love this shot... very cool shot</td>', 'nice lighting...love this shot... very cool shot', '2003-08-15 21:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(389442, 33086, 5786, '<td valign="top">This is sad!</td>', 'This is sad!', '2003-08-15 21:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(389446, 32832, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  One suggestion would be to straighten the horizon line, it might improve the picture some :) I love the textures/colours of the wood and the old house (barn?), and the clouds.  ~8</td>', 'Very nice!  One suggestion would be to straighten the horizon line, it might improve the picture some :) I love the textures/colours of the wood and the old house (barn?), and the clouds.  ~8', '2003-08-15 22:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(389447, 32899, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice find!  Fits the challenge topic well, even though the vines growing up the old chimney bring a smile to my face.  ~8</td>', 'Nice find!  Fits the challenge topic well, even though the vines growing up the old chimney bring a smile to my face.  ~8', '2003-08-15 22:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(389448, 32854, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice colours.</td>', 'Good composition, nice colours.', '2003-08-15 22:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(389449, 33233, 5112, '<td valign="top">The blue/purple tone fits the picture well.  I love the bright window in the back, IMO it adds to the sense of desolation.  ~8</td>', 'The blue/purple tone fits the picture well.  I love the bright window in the back, IMO it adds to the sense of desolation.  ~8', '2003-08-15 22:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(389451, 33046, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Where is this?  And, how did you get the sky so black?  Nice picture.  I does look desolate, even though I feel like I could love a place like this.  ~8</td>', 'Wow!  Where is this?  And, how did you get the sky so black?  Nice picture.  I does look desolate, even though I feel like I could love a place like this.  ~8', '2003-08-15 22:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(389452, 33130, 11096, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the flower and the rest of the photo really catches your eye and makes you take a longer look at the picture.</td>', 'The contrast between the flower and the rest of the photo really catches your eye and makes you take a longer look at the picture.', '2003-08-15 22:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(389453, 33045, 11096, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the lighting.</td>', 'I love the colors and the lighting.', '2003-08-15 22:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(389454, 32451, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, even though it looks like you resized it to a larger size or maybe it wasn''t quite in focus?  The concept is good though.  ~5</td>', 'Very nice picture, even though it looks like you resized it to a larger size or maybe it wasn''t quite in focus?  The concept is good though.  ~5', '2003-08-15 22:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(389455, 33118, 11096, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photo and I love the way the boat is so white.  It catches your eye and makes you look at the rest of the detail.  And the detail is so crisp.</td>', 'This is a very interesting photo and I love the way the boat is so white.  It catches your eye and makes you look at the rest of the detail.  And the detail is so crisp.', '2003-08-15 22:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(389457, 33052, 9582, '<td valign="top">Nice, interesting shot. I like the way that the paint is peeling...it gives a nice effect.</td>', 'Nice, interesting shot. I like the way that the paint is peeling...it gives a nice effect.', '2003-08-15 22:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(389458, 32779, 11096, '<td valign="top">This seems to meet the criteria of showing "desolation" very well to me.  And I love the colors.</td>', 'This seems to meet the criteria of showing "desolation" very well to me.  And I love the colors.', '2003-08-15 22:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(389459, 33134, 5112, '<td valign="top">That looks like a tombstone eaten by the tree!  Where did you find this?  And the tree looks covered in mud.  The brownish tones suit the picture very well.  ~7</td>', 'That looks like a tombstone eaten by the tree!  Where did you find this?  And the tree looks covered in mud.  The brownish tones suit the picture very well.  ~7', '2003-08-15 22:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(389460, 32427, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  What happened?</td>', 'Ouch!  What happened?', '2003-08-15 22:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(389464, 33139, 5112, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge perfectly.  Are the people whose names you show known to you?  These monuments always bring tears to my eyes, so much devastation, so much hurt.</td>', 'Fits the challenge perfectly.  Are the people whose names you show known to you?  These monuments always bring tears to my eyes, so much devastation, so much hurt.', '2003-08-15 22:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(389465, 32824, 9582, '<td valign="top">This definitely conveys desolation. Your composition is nice. Good job.</td>', 'This definitely conveys desolation. Your composition is nice. Good job.', '2003-08-15 22:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(389466, 33169, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea!  Somehow I hadn''t thought of humour and desolation, but it works!  You backup to diskettes?  ~8</td>', 'Good idea!  Somehow I hadn''t thought of humour and desolation, but it works!  You backup to diskettes?  ~8', '2003-08-15 22:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(389467, 33005, 9582, '<td valign="top">This is a very touching shot.</td>', 'This is a very touching shot.', '2003-08-15 22:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(389468, 33121, 10402, '<td valign="top">That sky certainly is dismal. But it is also interesting, and you''ve managed to capture a lot of detail in the clouds. The land and water are blurry, but that''s acceptable since your subject is the sky. I personally don''t see this as a portrayal of desolation; indeed the rain in those clouds will help the forest grow.</td>', 'That sky certainly is dismal. But it is also interesting, and you''ve managed to capture a lot of detail in the clouds. The land and water are blurry, but that''s acceptable since your subject is the sky. I personally don''t see this as a portrayal of desolation; indeed the rain in those clouds will help the forest grow.', '2003-08-15 22:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(389469, 33222, 5112, '<td valign="top">Square format is good here.  Fits the challenge well.  My one itsy bitsy nitpick, the 2 blue flowers in the front make it look a bit less desolate :)</td>', 'Square format is good here.  Fits the challenge well.  My one itsy bitsy nitpick, the 2 blue flowers in the front make it look a bit less desolate :)', '2003-08-15 22:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(389471, 32752, 5112, '<td valign="top">My mum had a sewing machine like this one, you had to pedal to sew.  I worked great!  It''s interesting how this picture looks "old".  I like the tone and the composition.  It seems to me though that you might have resized from a smaller picture to a larger one?  To my eyes it looks pixelated.  But I like it.  ~7</td>', 'My mum had a sewing machine like this one, you had to pedal to sew.  I worked great!  It''s interesting how this picture looks "old".  I like the tone and the composition.  It seems to me though that you might have resized from a smaller picture to a larger one?  To my eyes it looks pixelated.  But I like it.  ~7', '2003-08-15 22:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(389472, 33106, 5112, '<td valign="top">I can hardly bring myself to look at this picture!  The feelings it brings up, of children dying and mothers crying is just almost too much.  It''s a great idea, but it''s almost too powerful.  ~10</td>', 'I can hardly bring myself to look at this picture!  The feelings it brings up, of children dying and mothers crying is just almost too much.  It''s a great idea, but it''s almost too powerful.  ~10', '2003-08-15 22:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(389474, 33186, 9582, '<td valign="top">You did a great job. The clouds are stunning and the silhouettes are striking.</td>', 'You did a great job. The clouds are stunning and the silhouettes are striking.', '2003-08-15 22:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(389475, 33245, 5112, '<td valign="top">Your tio Miguel is a good looking guy!  I like the neat way he''s combed his hair.  The picture does fit the idea of the challenge, even though I have a hard time thinking of your uncle as fitting "desolation".  ~8</td>', 'Your tio Miguel is a good looking guy!  I like the neat way he''s combed his hair.  The picture does fit the idea of the challenge, even though I have a hard time thinking of your uncle as fitting "desolation".  ~8', '2003-08-15 22:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(389476, 32928, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Neat, what a roof!  Good entry.  Love the colours of the "chapa" (can''t think of the English word for the stuff that the roof is made of).  ~7</td>', 'Wow!  Neat, what a roof!  Good entry.  Love the colours of the "chapa" (can''t think of the English word for the stuff that the roof is made of).  ~7', '2003-08-15 22:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(389477, 32464, 5112, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge so well!  An old abandoned church, talk about desolation.  The picture looks a bit soft to my eyes, is that on purpose?  I like the crop.  ~7</td>', 'This fits the challenge so well!  An old abandoned church, talk about desolation.  The picture looks a bit soft to my eyes, is that on purpose?  I like the crop.  ~7', '2003-08-15 22:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(389479, 32656, 10402, '<td valign="top">The dark tones and dramatic lighting work with the subject of a lone chess king on its side to form a vivid image of defeat. Not quite desolation, which to my mind is more permanent than a lost game, but I guess it works in a symbolic way. Great use of negative space.</td>', 'The dark tones and dramatic lighting work with the subject of a lone chess king on its side to form a vivid image of defeat. Not quite desolation, which to my mind is more permanent than a lost game, but I guess it works in a symbolic way. Great use of negative space.', '2003-08-15 22:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(389480, 32671, 5112, '<td valign="top">I hope not.  Good colours, good composition, fits the challenge.</td>', 'I hope not.  Good colours, good composition, fits the challenge.', '2003-08-15 22:43:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(389482, 32683, 9027, '<td valign="top">beautiful b/w image. love the clouds!</td>', 'beautiful b/w image. love the clouds!', '2003-08-15 22:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(389483, 33137, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful picture, well done in b/w.  Fits the idea of the challenge very well.  My one nitpick is the plant at the bottom right, it''s too "juicy" to fit the idea of desolation.  The vines on the old stone and brick are just beatiful, as is the tile roof.  ~9</td>', 'Very beautiful picture, well done in b/w.  Fits the idea of the challenge very well.  My one nitpick is the plant at the bottom right, it''s too "juicy" to fit the idea of desolation.  The vines on the old stone and brick are just beatiful, as is the tile roof.  ~9', '2003-08-15 22:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(389484, 33205, 9027, '<td valign="top">your shadow has no legs!! very funny shot. :o)</td>', 'your shadow has no legs!! very funny shot. :o)', '2003-08-15 22:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(389485, 32947, 5112, '<td valign="top">Powerful picture, well done!  Fits the challenge perfectly.  ~10</td>', 'Powerful picture, well done!  Fits the challenge perfectly.  ~10', '2003-08-15 22:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(389486, 32814, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I know the feeling :)  Good entry!</td>', 'Hmmm, I know the feeling :)  Good entry!', '2003-08-15 22:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(389487, 33182, 9027, '<td valign="top">great tones in this image. looks like a whole lot of photos, fun clean up. hehe.</td>', 'great tones in this image. looks like a whole lot of photos, fun clean up. hehe.', '2003-08-15 22:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(389490, 33239, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!  The frame really adds to it.  ~9</td>', 'Beautiful picture!  The frame really adds to it.  ~9', '2003-08-15 22:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(389491, 32680, 9027, '<td valign="top">very cool image/cropping. i''m wondering what that stuff is. harness of some sort?</td>', 'very cool image/cropping. i''m wondering what that stuff is. harness of some sort?', '2003-08-15 22:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(389493, 33078, 5112, '<td valign="top">This is a gutsy entry!  Not everyone dares to enter a "blurry" picture, even when the blur is intentional.  It fits the challenge very well.  Am I wrong at guessing that the idea of the picture is that the walker is either crying or tipsy, maybe both?  ~10</td>', 'This is a gutsy entry!  Not everyone dares to enter a "blurry" picture, even when the blur is intentional.  It fits the challenge very well.  Am I wrong at guessing that the idea of the picture is that the walker is either crying or tipsy, maybe both?  ~10', '2003-08-15 22:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(389496, 33198, 5112, '<td valign="top">So, where is the end of the world?</td>', 'So, where is the end of the world?', '2003-08-15 22:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(389497, 33141, 9027, '<td valign="top">good contrast. adds to the feeling of desolation.</td>', 'good contrast. adds to the feeling of desolation.', '2003-08-15 22:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(389498, 32783, 9582, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. The concept and the location are both excellent. There is only one thing about it that bothers me a little. The model looks exactly like a model...she just doesn\''t seem to belong in that setting. She looks too well groomed. All of the homeless people that I\''ve encountered look very rough...mussed and dirty hair, ragged and dirty clothing, etc.  Your composition is teriffic and you deserve high marks on this one.</td>', 'I really like this photo. The concept and the location are both excellent. There is only one thing about it that bothers me a little. The model looks exactly like a model...she just doesn\''t seem to belong in that setting. She looks too well groomed. All of the homeless people that I\''ve encountered look very rough...mussed and dirty hair, ragged and dirty clothing, etc.  Your composition is teriffic and you deserve high marks on this one.', '2003-08-15 22:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(389499, 33163, 5112, '<td valign="top">What strange gravestones!  Are they gravestones?  Good entry for the challenge, b/w is very appropiate and well done.</td>', 'What strange gravestones!  Are they gravestones?  Good entry for the challenge, b/w is very appropiate and well done.', '2003-08-15 22:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
