(389524, 32967, 3554, '<td valign="top">The fly and sand add a lot to this shot. I like the DOF and the border sets it off well. I know there\''s been a lot of flak about this shot but I think it was tastefully done. The sand and coloring helped with that.</td>', 'The fly and sand add a lot to this shot. I like the DOF and the border sets it off well. I know there\''s been a lot of flak about this shot but I think it was tastefully done. The sand and coloring helped with that.', '2003-08-15 23:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(389525, 33198, 3554, '<td valign="top">I would prefer a shorter title. Perhaps just "Haunted House."  The primary emotion I feel when looking at this shot is lonliness. How did a house in such a prime location go to waste? What was it like before? This photo makes me ask a few questions and feel a peaceful meloncholy all at once. I think it fit the challenge well.</td>', 'I would prefer a shorter title. Perhaps just "Haunted House."  The primary emotion I feel when looking at this shot is lonliness. How did a house in such a prime location go to waste? What was it like before? This photo makes me ask a few questions and feel a peaceful meloncholy all at once. I think it fit the challenge well.', '2003-08-15 23:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
