(389532, 33245, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think a better title might have been simply "Miguel."  You captured the emotion well. He looks as though he''s just lost his wife or someone else who was very important to him. The left part of the photo is overexposed.</td>', 'I think a better title might have been simply "Miguel."  You captured the emotion well. He looks as though he''s just lost his wife or someone else who was very important to him. The left part of the photo is overexposed.', '2003-08-15 23:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
