(389534, 32939, 3554, '<td valign="top">I see quite  a few jaggies, especially along his shoulders adn the rail above. Seems like the picture might have been fuzzy and then was oversharpened to compensate. His hat and shirt both seem overexposed to me.</td>', 'I see quite  a few jaggies, especially along his shoulders adn the rail above. Seems like the picture might have been fuzzy and then was oversharpened to compensate. His hat and shirt both seem overexposed to me.', '2003-08-15 23:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
