(389622, 32656, 5767, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but maybe too dark.  There is way too much of the image that has nothing to look at.  Maybe that was a choice, but as a viewer it, IMO, would have been more interesting to see a faint amount of texture or shape in the shadows.  <br/> <br/>Great concept and composition.</td>', 'Nice lighting, but maybe too dark.  There is way too much of the image that has nothing to look at.  Maybe that was a choice, but as a viewer it, IMO, would have been more interesting to see a faint amount of texture or shape in the shadows.   Great concept and composition.', '2003-08-16 04:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(389623, 32621, 5767, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract image with some nice lighting, but I do not think "desolation" when I look at this.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract image with some nice lighting, but I do not think "desolation" when I look at this.', '2003-08-16 04:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
