(389626, 33221, 5767, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and exposure.  Composition is nicely done, too.  My only comment is that my eye is really drawn to the texture of the rust, but it is out of focus.  As a viewer I wouldn''t mind having less detail in lines than in letters/numbers or fine detail.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and exposure.  Composition is nicely done, too.  My only comment is that my eye is really drawn to the texture of the rust, but it is out of focus.  As a viewer I wouldn''t mind having less detail in lines than in letters/numbers or fine detail.', '2003-08-16 05:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(389627, 33109, 5767, '<td valign="top">Excellent image.  Great detail in the wood grains; the form of the shadow is composed so that it is a strong element and leads my eye to the mountains.  It all just works very well for me.  Nice job.</td>', 'Excellent image.  Great detail in the wood grains; the form of the shadow is composed so that it is a strong element and leads my eye to the mountains.  It all just works very well for me.  Nice job.', '2003-08-16 05:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
