(389794, 33220, 10628, '<td valign="top">Looking at your model, I can''t repress the feeling of wanting to tell the guy "do you need any help?", it is so strong the desolation in his eyes look and the visual support for that emotion from his forehead and the balance of the composition with the cigarrette, that I immediately go to vote 10 for the very first time, despite the fact that I appreciate color very much and normally B&amp;W pictures get a -1 vote from me, but this time I am not sure that color would add something.  Congrats, I am sure this is an award.</td>', 'Looking at your model, I can''t repress the feeling of wanting to tell the guy "do you need any help?", it is so strong the desolation in his eyes look and the visual support for that emotion from his forehead and the balance of the composition with the cigarrette, that I immediately go to vote 10 for the very first time, despite the fact that I appreciate color very much and normally B&W pictures get a -1 vote from me, but this time I am not sure that color would add something.  Congrats, I am sure this is an award.', '2003-08-16 15:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
