(389818, 32832, 8779, '<td valign="top">Firstly, I would have liked to see a straighter image. Secondly, more of the house in shambles! And maybe in black and white. I do not feel the backdrop of the sea and wonky horizon to be interesting enough [compared to house] to include in the image. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Firstly, I would have liked to see a straighter image. Secondly, more of the house in shambles! And maybe in black and white. I do not feel the backdrop of the sea and wonky horizon to be interesting enough [compared to house] to include in the image. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 15:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(389819, 33102, 10628, '<td valign="top">With that building I can''t stop thinking that a much better picture could come out of it</td>', 'With that building I can''t stop thinking that a much better picture could come out of it', '2003-08-16 15:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(389820, 33231, 8779, '<td valign="top">I dont feel the subject reflects Desolation. However, the same idea may have worked in a different situation. Perhaps on the side of a road empty of cars or people? Well done, Good try =) A 2 only because it is not related to topic. Very good picture otherwise.</td>', 'I dont feel the subject reflects Desolation. However, the same idea may have worked in a different situation. Perhaps on the side of a road empty of cars or people? Well done, Good try =) A 2 only because it is not related to topic. Very good picture otherwise.', '2003-08-16 15:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(389821, 32944, 8779, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. However, I think that black and white with high contrast to show detail in the grss could have given this pic a more barron feel and more deserted than it already is. Also, try not to chop so much of the main subject off. I''m forever looking for the rest of the branches! Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Very interesting. However, I think that black and white with high contrast to show detail in the grss could have given this pic a more barron feel and more deserted than it already is. Also, try not to chop so much of the main subject off. I''m forever looking for the rest of the branches! Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 15:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(389822, 32496, 10628, '<td valign="top">Fright is not desolation</td>', 'Fright is not desolation', '2003-08-16 15:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(389823, 33137, 10628, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen this in color</td>', 'I would like to have seen this in color', '2003-08-16 15:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(389824, 32496, 8779, '<td valign="top">Attack of the bees lol. Hopeless, perhaps, but desolated, No.<br/> <br/>However, the image could do with a few improvements. The pastel colors are a little dull for my taste. Perhaps the subject could have put on a different top. A tighter crop on the face would have been nice to emphasize the hopelessness with her brilliant expression! However, I get the feeling that this was a snap from long ago that you just really wanted to share with us!</td>', 'Attack of the bees lol. Hopeless, perhaps, but desolated, No. However, the image could do with a few improvements. The pastel colors are a little dull for my taste. Perhaps the subject could have put on a different top. A tighter crop on the face would have been nice to emphasize the hopelessness with her brilliant expression! However, I get the feeling that this was a snap from long ago that you just really wanted to share with us!', '2003-08-16 15:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
