(389876, 32496, 9679, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. Despite appearances, I hope the subject wasn''t actually surrounded by bees. It might have seemed a trifle less staged if she weren''t looking directly at the camera. Although I like this shot generally, my initial reaction would be one of desperation or panic, and not desolation, but maybe that''s just me.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. Despite appearances, I hope the subject wasn''t actually surrounded by bees. It might have seemed a trifle less staged if she weren''t looking directly at the camera. Although I like this shot generally, my initial reaction would be one of desperation or panic, and not desolation, but maybe that''s just me.', '2003-08-16 19:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(389884, 33223, 11155, '<td valign="top">I like this - I think it captures ''desolation'' better than most images here.  I think some people mistakenly thought desolation=isolation or dessimation.  I would have liked to see more details in the image, perhaps this was a little under exposed, I''m not sure, but the ground seems a little too light.  Overall, I like this quite a bit - good luck in the contest.</td>', 'I like this - I think it captures ''desolation'' better than most images here.  I think some people mistakenly thought desolation=isolation or dessimation.  I would have liked to see more details in the image, perhaps this was a little under exposed, I''m not sure, but the ground seems a little too light.  Overall, I like this quite a bit - good luck in the contest.', '2003-08-16 19:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(389887, 33109, 11155, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is desolate.  Not many people understood the meaning of the word, I guess.  Nice detail in the trunk and I like the shadow.  Nice work, good luck.</td>', 'Yes, this is desolate.  Not many people understood the meaning of the word, I guess.  Nice detail in the trunk and I like the shadow.  Nice work, good luck.', '2003-08-16 19:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(389912, 33190, 6597, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture but Desolation?</td>', 'This is a good picture but Desolation?', '2003-08-16 20:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(389915, 32815, 10529, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2003-08-16 20:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
