(390072, 32980, 8377, '<td valign="top">I love the sepia tones on this.  And the clarity is awesome.  Poor Lillian though.  I hate going to the beach on cloudy days.</td>', 'I love the sepia tones on this.  And the clarity is awesome.  Poor Lillian though.  I hate going to the beach on cloudy days.', '2003-08-17 01:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
