(390074, 33062, 8377, '<td valign="top">Thats a neat shot.  It always amazes me how people do that translucent people thing.</td>', 'Thats a neat shot.  It always amazes me how people do that translucent people thing.', '2003-08-17 01:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
