(390081, 32779, 10414, '<td valign="top">Oh...how sad!  :(   I love all the different colors, and the reflection in the tube is a great addition! Was he really sad??  Poor little guy!</td>', 'Oh...how sad!  :(   I love all the different colors, and the reflection in the tube is a great addition! Was he really sad??  Poor little guy!', '2003-08-17 01:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
