(390090, 32390, 10414, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, clear picture!  I would like to have seen this in color...to show all the colors used in this "artwork!"  Still, a wonderful picture!</td>', 'Wonderful, clear picture!  I would like to have seen this in color...to show all the colors used in this "artwork!"  Still, a wonderful picture!', '2003-08-17 01:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
