(390178, 32819, 2978, '<td valign="top">The castle which is the subject of the photo is bleached out, comparing to the rocks in the forground. I would move the camera up to cut it out. And maybe try to craete foggy effect from it. That''s my suggestion.</td>', 'The castle which is the subject of the photo is bleached out, comparing to the rocks in the forground. I would move the camera up to cut it out. And maybe try to craete foggy effect from it. That''s my suggestion.', '2003-08-17 03:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(390181, 33062, 2978, '<td valign="top">Ghost effect works for this challenge. I''m quite surprised that you are the only one who used it so far. By the way, I thing the model should not look straight at the camera. IMO it makes the effect less powerful</td>', 'Ghost effect works for this challenge. I''m quite surprised that you are the only one who used it so far. By the way, I thing the model should not look straight at the camera. IMO it makes the effect less powerful', '2003-08-17 03:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(390183, 33108, 2978, '<td valign="top">Great landscape and good quality image. The rock put too much weight to the photo though. I wonder what woud it be like if you cut the rock out, make it more landscape and show more of blue sky.</td>', 'Great landscape and good quality image. The rock put too much weight to the photo though. I wonder what woud it be like if you cut the rock out, make it more landscape and show more of blue sky.', '2003-08-17 03:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
