(390188, 33026, 2978, '<td valign="top">Well composed I like it. I''m not sure that the theme is carried out. If you create a train suicide, as my understanding, there should be more indication in the photo, not just by the title. Because by the photo itself it looks more like he is just sitting there.</td>', 'Well composed I like it. I''m not sure that the theme is carried out. If you create a train suicide, as my understanding, there should be more indication in the photo, not just by the title. Because by the photo itself it looks more like he is just sitting there.', '2003-08-17 03:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(390191, 33198, 2978, '<td valign="top">Great location you''ve found there. And sunset is an excellent choice time you shot it too.</td>', 'Great location you''ve found there. And sunset is an excellent choice time you shot it too.', '2003-08-17 04:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(390193, 32699, 2978, '<td valign="top">I really like the tone here. This angle makes this photo stands out from other ''Skull &amp; Desert'' images. Creative.</td>', 'I really like the tone here. This angle makes this photo stands out from other ''Skull & Desert'' images. Creative.', '2003-08-17 04:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(390194, 33244, 8779, '<td valign="top">To be honest, if the logs were not there, I would have found this image to be much more attractive and interesting. Also, it would have been nice to have more of the bright lights over the railings and more of that green and blueness I see at the top right hand corner. However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'To be honest, if the logs were not there, I would have found this image to be much more attractive and interesting. Also, it would have been nice to have more of the bright lights over the railings and more of that green and blueness I see at the top right hand corner. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 04:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(390196, 32949, 8779, '<td valign="top">Great angle and interesting idea. However, I find the florecent tubes to be very tacky. However, I can also see that the brightness works, but it''s the light... Perhaps a little further into the tunnel also to cut out the overhead light and going for the "darkness".</td>', 'Great angle and interesting idea. However, I find the florecent tubes to be very tacky. However, I can also see that the brightness works, but it''s the light... Perhaps a little further into the tunnel also to cut out the overhead light and going for the "darkness".', '2003-08-17 04:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(390197, 33004, 8779, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. I love this child''s expression. After all, a picture is more than a thousand words. However, Personally, I think the image is too pixelated [if that''s a word] and the crop is too tight around the face; too close to the eye. I see that brilliant glow around the right side of the child''s face, but the left? Perhaps zoom out a little to get in the whole face and lots of that glow. However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'Brilliant. I love this child''s expression. After all, a picture is more than a thousand words. However, Personally, I think the image is too pixelated [if that''s a word] and the crop is too tight around the face; too close to the eye. I see that brilliant glow around the right side of the child''s face, but the left? Perhaps zoom out a little to get in the whole face and lots of that glow. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 04:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(390198, 33219, 8779, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. and I light the shadow of the singled out marble. However, the images are not sharp enough for my liking. Also, I would have liked to see the corners of the black squares to meet in the perfect "check-board" fashion, as at the moment, the boxes are too uniform horizontally to make the "floating boxes" effective. However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'Cute idea. and I light the shadow of the singled out marble. However, the images are not sharp enough for my liking. Also, I would have liked to see the corners of the black squares to meet in the perfect "check-board" fashion, as at the moment, the boxes are too uniform horizontally to make the "floating boxes" effective. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 04:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(390199, 32876, 8779, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the graveyard. Graveyards in black and white can often show signs of timelessness but is ruined by that rotting modern looking wooden box. You could have perhaps stepped right up into the graveyard and concentrated more on the stones. The subject should be the stones, but at the moment, ti is the tacky road and side wall and the messy road. However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'I like the idea of the graveyard. Graveyards in black and white can often show signs of timelessness but is ruined by that rotting modern looking wooden box. You could have perhaps stepped right up into the graveyard and concentrated more on the stones. The subject should be the stones, but at the moment, ti is the tacky road and side wall and the messy road. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 04:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(390200, 33184, 8779, '<td valign="top">Brilliant subject! Perhaps a side shot to show more of this wonderful car''s body with the background full of that nasty old building I see on the top left corner? At the moment, the background is split in two bits and very distracting. But with the great lines and uniformity of the far building may have been less distracting. However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'Brilliant subject! Perhaps a side shot to show more of this wonderful car''s body with the background full of that nasty old building I see on the top left corner? At the moment, the background is split in two bits and very distracting. But with the great lines and uniformity of the far building may have been less distracting. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 04:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(390202, 32718, 10196, '<td valign="top">One on my faves this week. Nice work!</td>', 'One on my faves this week. Nice work!', '2003-08-17 04:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(390203, 33072, 10196, '<td valign="top">Great capture</td>', 'Great capture', '2003-08-17 04:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(390204, 33151, 8779, '<td valign="top">Personally, this does not display desolation for me. What I do see is a wonky horizon and some dark silhoettes of trees that are too close. Also, the main subject of this pic is the branch, you have to admit it isnt very interesting... This would have been a better pic in general if you took it during sunset or rise? However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'Personally, this does not display desolation for me. What I do see is a wonky horizon and some dark silhoettes of trees that are too close. Also, the main subject of this pic is the branch, you have to admit it isnt very interesting... This would have been a better pic in general if you took it during sunset or rise? However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 04:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(390205, 33193, 8779, '<td valign="top">That is a brilliant car and I think the car alone could have create the sense of desolation. The image is not sharp and the plants are ugly and distracting. perhaps an angle view of the car bonnet and side and broken windows could do the trick. Also a it would have been nice in sepia.</td>', 'That is a brilliant car and I think the car alone could have create the sense of desolation. The image is not sharp and the plants are ugly and distracting. perhaps an angle view of the car bonnet and side and broken windows could do the trick. Also a it would have been nice in sepia.', '2003-08-17 04:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(390208, 32780, 8779, '<td valign="top">lol, those are just signs telling you not to walk here and there, but doesnt display desolation as you have a girl standing there and in the back of my mind I know that her mum and dad are prolly there too! Perhaps just a close up of the faded yellow sign? However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'lol, those are just signs telling you not to walk here and there, but doesnt display desolation as you have a girl standing there and in the back of my mind I know that her mum and dad are prolly there too! Perhaps just a close up of the faded yellow sign? However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 04:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(390209, 33118, 8779, '<td valign="top">Briliant mist over the sea, however the shot is ruined by the boulders and the beach. From a careful angle, i''m sure I could have been conned into thinking that that was a ghost ship sailing inthe ocean. Also, perhaps if the image was in sepia, it would have portrayed a sense timelessness?</td>', 'Briliant mist over the sea, however the shot is ruined by the boulders and the beach. From a careful angle, i''m sure I could have been conned into thinking that that was a ghost ship sailing inthe ocean. Also, perhaps if the image was in sepia, it would have portrayed a sense timelessness?', '2003-08-17 04:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(390214, 33141, 8779, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but desolation? No... It looks nice and peaceful. Also the modern pylons and skyscrapers just ruin the feel of this great place.<br/> <br/>Perhaps the contrast is also too high and I would have loved to see more detail on the hut on the right.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'Interesting, but desolation? No... It looks nice and peaceful. Also the modern pylons and skyscrapers just ruin the feel of this great place. Perhaps the contrast is also too high and I would have loved to see more detail on the hut on the right. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 04:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(390215, 33101, 8779, '<td valign="top">A great tree. However, I would have liked to see a straight horizon and closer version the tree placed on the left hand side of the image with the background to be long open spaces. It could also do with a higher contrast =)<br/>However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'A great tree. However, I would have liked to see a straight horizon and closer version the tree placed on the left hand side of the image with the background to be long open spaces. It could also do with a higher contrast =)However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 04:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(390216, 32855, 8779, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but perhaps a much tighter crop on the subject to get rid of the messy and distracting greenery on the left, bottom and right sides.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'Interesting subject, but perhaps a much tighter crop on the subject to get rid of the messy and distracting greenery on the left, bottom and right sides. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 05:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(390219, 33027, 8779, '<td valign="top">A nice picture in general, but not interesting enough. One suggestion is perhaps a closer zoom on the house and increase the angle on the house even further to show more of the darken side on the right?<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'A nice picture in general, but not interesting enough. One suggestion is perhaps a closer zoom on the house and increase the angle on the house even further to show more of the darken side on the right? However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 05:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(390220, 33163, 8779, '<td valign="top">Really interesting subjects you have here. However, I would personally have cropped the image at the top, cutting off the tops of the background grave stones. I feel that that would make the two stones ith skulls on more of the subject and also the stones in the background look too uniform, like someone was stocking them up to be used later.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'Really interesting subjects you have here. However, I would personally have cropped the image at the top, cutting off the tops of the background grave stones. I feel that that would make the two stones ith skulls on more of the subject and also the stones in the background look too uniform, like someone was stocking them up to be used later. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 05:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(390221, 32836, 8779, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subjects but I feel that the subjects and and the background is too much alike and the background is extremely distracting. Perhaps some black coal/charcoal instead? Also, I do not like that pipe that is bloking alot of the ''bucket'', which seems to be the main subject...<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'Very interesting subjects but I feel that the subjects and and the background is too much alike and the background is extremely distracting. Perhaps some black coal/charcoal instead? Also, I do not like that pipe that is bloking alot of the ''bucket'', which seems to be the main subject... However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 05:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(390222, 32854, 8779, '<td valign="top">lol. A brilliant sharp shot of this monkey! Persoanlly, I would have cropped the image close to his/her face as firstly, I dont think that is a very attractive pose even for a monkey and secondly, I love the expression on the face which is really the thing which portays desolation.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'lol. A brilliant sharp shot of this monkey! Persoanlly, I would have cropped the image close to his/her face as firstly, I dont think that is a very attractive pose even for a monkey and secondly, I love the expression on the face which is really the thing which portays desolation. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 05:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(390223, 32516, 8779, '<td valign="top">When you look at a skull, what is the most prominant feature? I think it is the eye sockets. It would have been nice to have angled the head in a way to blacken the socketsas at the moment, my eyes are drawn to the teeth which are not really interesting.<br/> <br/>By using a shallow aperture, both the foreground and background could have been sharp, which I think would improve the image dramatically.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'When you look at a skull, what is the most prominant feature? I think it is the eye sockets. It would have been nice to have angled the head in a way to blacken the socketsas at the moment, my eyes are drawn to the teeth which are not really interesting. By using a shallow aperture, both the foreground and background could have been sharp, which I think would improve the image dramatically. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 05:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(390225, 32861, 8779, '<td valign="top">Personally, I do not feel that this house is in too much of a shambles. From the look of it, it looks like it could stand for another 60 years; I would live in it if I was stuck for money. Perhaps a different shot to show an older more dishevealed area of the house?<br/> <br/>At the moment, the subject is the tree, but it should be the house as the tree looks pretty healthy and living which is the opposite of desired desolated-feel. Perhaps walking closer to the house could have elimiated this tree.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'Personally, I do not feel that this house is in too much of a shambles. From the look of it, it looks like it could stand for another 60 years; I would live in it if I was stuck for money. Perhaps a different shot to show an older more dishevealed area of the house? At the moment, the subject is the tree, but it should be the house as the tree looks pretty healthy and living which is the opposite of desired desolated-feel. Perhaps walking closer to the house could have elimiated this tree. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 05:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(390226, 32800, 8779, '<td valign="top">Oh dear, I have already voted on a dead fish and another dead rat...<br/> <br/>However, I feel that your picture has a little, not a lot, more taste. But I would persoanlly have shooted the ant away as this cheapens and adds to the disgusting-ness of the image''s content.<br/> <br/>Also, perhaps it would have put the mouse into a more peaceful position by prodding down it''s legs which are waving in the air?<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try.</td>', 'Oh dear, I have already voted on a dead fish and another dead rat... However, I feel that your picture has a little, not a lot, more taste. But I would persoanlly have shooted the ant away as this cheapens and adds to the disgusting-ness of the image''s content. Also, perhaps it would have put the mouse into a more peaceful position by prodding down it''s legs which are waving in the air? However, well done. Good try.', '2003-08-17 05:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(390227, 33183, 8779, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice looking cottage and unfortunately doesnt protray desolation. Also, the trees overhanging the roof on either side is distracting.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'It''s a nice looking cottage and unfortunately doesnt protray desolation. Also, the trees overhanging the roof on either side is distracting. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 05:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(390228, 33155, 8779, '<td valign="top">Firstly, desolation? No. I do not feel it here.<br/> <br/>If the insect was not in the center of the page I would have missed it completely! When taking pictures of animals and insects, I always prefer to get upclose and personal with my super macro. Perhaps you could have waiting for the insect to move onto a different background also?<br/> <br/>From what you have here, I would have cropped the distracting blrry bits both above and below.</td>', 'Firstly, desolation? No. I do not feel it here. If the insect was not in the center of the page I would have missed it completely! When taking pictures of animals and insects, I always prefer to get upclose and personal with my super macro. Perhaps you could have waiting for the insect to move onto a different background also? From what you have here, I would have cropped the distracting blrry bits both above and below.', '2003-08-17 05:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(390229, 32397, 8779, '<td valign="top">*laughs. Great idea. But here are a few tips that could perhaps help the quality of this image. <br/> <br/>Firstly, If possible. I would have put the TVs on static and chosen a particular area of this ''office'' to concentrate on. At the moment, it is just so full of stuff it''s very distracting. Also, there is nothing the eye can rest on, i.e. a main subject.<br/> <br/>Personally, I would have gotten rid of the chairs closest to you, stepped closer to the chair at the back, holding the camera for a portait shot; include the rubbed away area under the chair, whilst keeping the tv''s [which are on the static snowy channel] at the top!<br/> <br/>On top of that, the image quality is poor. Play around with contrast and saturation if possible =)<br/> <br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try =)</td>', '*laughs. Great idea. But here are a few tips that could perhaps help the quality of this image.  Firstly, If possible. I would have put the TVs on static and chosen a particular area of this ''office'' to concentrate on. At the moment, it is just so full of stuff it''s very distracting. Also, there is nothing the eye can rest on, i.e. a main subject. Personally, I would have gotten rid of the chairs closest to you, stepped closer to the chair at the back, holding the camera for a portait shot; include the rubbed away area under the chair, whilst keeping the tv''s [which are on the static snowy channel] at the top! On top of that, the image quality is poor. Play around with contrast and saturation if possible =)  However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 05:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(390230, 33041, 8779, '<td valign="top">Firstly, why untitled? Secondly, desolation? How? Perhaps with a title, you could have briefly explained what you were thinking.<br/> <br/>Interesting idea with the game pad and screen, but the white paper. It looks like you have just been to the stationary store and bought lots of A3 paper. Try going for the smooth look by perhaps glueing the papers together carefully.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'Firstly, why untitled? Secondly, desolation? How? Perhaps with a title, you could have briefly explained what you were thinking. Interesting idea with the game pad and screen, but the white paper. It looks like you have just been to the stationary store and bought lots of A3 paper. Try going for the smooth look by perhaps glueing the papers together carefully. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 05:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(390232, 33202, 8779, '<td valign="top">One of the best pics so far and I love the graffiti [dunno how it''s spelt lol]. However, I would have liked to see you consentrate a one area of this scene at a time as it is too distracting at the mo. Looking now, I can see that ''tunnel''. I would have personally got a snap at  the edge of that tunnel with all those brilliant shadows and graffiti within.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try =)</td>', 'One of the best pics so far and I love the graffiti [dunno how it''s spelt lol]. However, I would have liked to see you consentrate a one area of this scene at a time as it is too distracting at the mo. Looking now, I can see that ''tunnel''. I would have personally got a snap at  the edge of that tunnel with all those brilliant shadows and graffiti within. However, well done. Good try =)', '2003-08-17 05:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(390233, 33048, 8779, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but it has not been carried out very well. It would have been nice to have included the boys head, and not neck, in the gap by perhaps a shot from a different angle. The problem with playgrounds is all the distracting things around so perhaps if there was nothing behind you, it would have been better to swap places with the subject.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try. =)</td>', 'I like the idea, but it has not been carried out very well. It would have been nice to have included the boys head, and not neck, in the gap by perhaps a shot from a different angle. The problem with playgrounds is all the distracting things around so perhaps if there was nothing behind you, it would have been better to swap places with the subject. However, well done. Good try. =)', '2003-08-17 05:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(390234, 32987, 8779, '<td valign="top">I see what you have done here, but it''s not my cup of tea. With such a bland 8/8 cloud covered sky, it is of little to no interest. However, with the bird slap bang in the middle makes the bird the center of interest. I would have like to share the center of interest between both the bird and the skyand done so by cropping the image to place the bird on one side.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try. =)</td>', 'I see what you have done here, but it''s not my cup of tea. With such a bland 8/8 cloud covered sky, it is of little to no interest. However, with the bird slap bang in the middle makes the bird the center of interest. I would have like to share the center of interest between both the bird and the skyand done so by cropping the image to place the bird on one side. However, well done. Good try. =)', '2003-08-17 05:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(390235, 32960, 8779, '<td valign="top">A great building there! However, I would have liked to see a closer ''full-the-frame'' version of the main building with it''s fabulous smashed windows and lines and cut out the distracting subelements.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try. =)</td>', 'A great building there! However, I would have liked to see a closer ''full-the-frame'' version of the main building with it''s fabulous smashed windows and lines and cut out the distracting subelements. However, well done. Good try. =)', '2003-08-17 05:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
