(390237, 32644, 8779, '<td valign="top">The overall image has a nasty blue tinge to it which could be fixed with software and I would have liked to see the colours of the ashes and such. There is this really distracting stump right in the middle at the bottom of the image which should be cropped off as it''s firstly distracing and secondly doesnt look burnt enough. It has been cut at the top to show fresh looking bark.<br/> <br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try. =)</td>', 'The overall image has a nasty blue tinge to it which could be fixed with software and I would have liked to see the colours of the ashes and such. There is this really distracting stump right in the middle at the bottom of the image which should be cropped off as it''s firstly distracing and secondly doesnt look burnt enough. It has been cut at the top to show fresh looking bark.  However, well done. Good try. =)', '2003-08-17 05:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(390238, 32427, 4258, '<td valign="top">Wonder many on this would understand this? Don''t waste... ...</td>', 'Wonder many on this would understand this? Don''t waste... ...', '2003-08-17 05:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(390239, 33172, 8779, '<td valign="top">Yes, interesting idea, but does it portray desolation? Just because after a storm, doesnt mean everyone''s left the country.<br/> <br/>Also, I see the fallen trees, but the numerous living ones still erect totally contradicts and ruins the effect. The bright green leaves also give the picture a ''Alive and well'' feeling.<br/> <br/>Perhaps a different angle or area of the forrest? <br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try. =)</td>', 'Yes, interesting idea, but does it portray desolation? Just because after a storm, doesnt mean everyone''s left the country. Also, I see the fallen trees, but the numerous living ones still erect totally contradicts and ruins the effect. The bright green leaves also give the picture a ''Alive and well'' feeling. Perhaps a different angle or area of the forrest?  However, well done. Good try. =)', '2003-08-17 06:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(390240, 33225, 8779, '<td valign="top">I love the colour and texture of the sand and the road and a great idea. However, you see at the top left hand corner where the road bends off? I would have like to see more on the left side of it as disappearing roads are always great in an image. At the same time, it would mean less of the shadowy and distracting area on the right which came help move the concentration more to the rider and bike.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try. =)</td>', 'I love the colour and texture of the sand and the road and a great idea. However, you see at the top left hand corner where the road bends off? I would have like to see more on the left side of it as disappearing roads are always great in an image. At the same time, it would mean less of the shadowy and distracting area on the right which came help move the concentration more to the rider and bike. However, well done. Good try. =)', '2003-08-17 06:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(390243, 32900, 8779, '<td valign="top">Just a nagging thought. If someone was retired, wouldnt the tractor be kept in a garage or something? That though is just nagging at me. <br/> <br/>However, Interesting subject but I would have liked to see less of the vehicle and more of the wonderful surroundings as I dont feel that the truck deserves so attention.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try. =)</td>', 'Just a nagging thought. If someone was retired, wouldnt the tractor be kept in a garage or something? That though is just nagging at me.  However, Interesting subject but I would have liked to see less of the vehicle and more of the wonderful surroundings as I dont feel that the truck deserves so attention. However, well done. Good try. =)', '2003-08-17 06:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(390245, 33228, 8779, '<td valign="top">I feel that it is underexposed and the subject is not interesting enough. It may have been a great building if it was not for the nasty tacky looking white coverings...<br/> <br/>Also, it would have improved the image is there was less of the greenery and more of the house to fill the frame. It would have been nice if you waited for another time with less cloud cover and a sunset to shine vibrant colours on the wite coverings and create dramatic shadows.<br/> <br/>However, well done. Good try. =)</td>', 'I feel that it is underexposed and the subject is not interesting enough. It may have been a great building if it was not for the nasty tacky looking white coverings... Also, it would have improved the image is there was less of the greenery and more of the house to fill the frame. It would have been nice if you waited for another time with less cloud cover and a sunset to shine vibrant colours on the wite coverings and create dramatic shadows. However, well done. Good try. =)', '2003-08-17 06:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(390262, 33119, 8779, '<td valign="top">"Perhaps it could have been a little better if the animal was in a peaceful position without it''s mouth gaping open and w/o the dying babies at its side it may have been an interesting shot. I am sorry, but at the moment it is too tasteless for my liking.<br/> <br/>However, if we forget the content, the picture could have done with a tighter crop on the subjects and a wider aperture to blur the background further."<br/> <br/>I apologies if I have been a little sarcastic with the previous msg. I was in a bit of a mood I guess, no excuse however.</td>', '"Perhaps it could have been a little better if the animal was in a peaceful position without it''s mouth gaping open and w/o the dying babies at its side it may have been an interesting shot. I am sorry, but at the moment it is too tasteless for my liking. However, if we forget the content, the picture could have done with a tighter crop on the subjects and a wider aperture to blur the background further." I apologies if I have been a little sarcastic with the previous msg. I was in a bit of a mood I guess, no excuse however.', '2003-08-17 07:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
