(391968, 32814, 9986, '<td valign="top">good concept but does''nt the subject (i mean with tie and a great form dress) kinda look a bit sophisticated to be broke? also the photo looks to be a bit out of focus??? am i seeing too much here?</td>', 'good concept but does''nt the subject (i mean with tie and a great form dress) kinda look a bit sophisticated to be broke? also the photo looks to be a bit out of focus??? am i seeing too much here?', '2003-08-18 16:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
