(391971, 32900, 9986, '<td valign="top">nice usage of sepia effect...i like it</td>', 'nice usage of sepia effect...i like it', '2003-08-18 16:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(391973, 32801, 4517, '<td valign="top">Got a feeling this may not score to well but good luck.</td>', 'Got a feeling this may not score to well but good luck.', '2003-08-18 16:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(391974, 32656, 9986, '<td valign="top">awesome...this is what i mean by "a picture is worth a thousadn words" ...but am not sure how desolate the king/queen is here??</td>', 'awesome...this is what i mean by "a picture is worth a thousadn words" ...but am not sure how desolate the king/queen is here??', '2003-08-18 16:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(391976, 33113, 3087, '<td valign="top">I can see the idea here - the desolate nature of the silhouetted landscape contrasting with the colours of the sky. However the telegraph poles just don''t create a visually stimulating image for me. Aside from that, I''d also recommend looking at alternative compositions - perhaps having the poles towards the left or right rather than almost centred? Alternatively perhaps a portrait orientation that cuts out the land to the left and right of the three poles? An interesting idea but one that just didn''t come quite work for me.<br/>4</td>', 'I can see the idea here - the desolate nature of the silhouetted landscape contrasting with the colours of the sky. However the telegraph poles just don''t create a visually stimulating image for me. Aside from that, I''d also recommend looking at alternative compositions - perhaps having the poles towards the left or right rather than almost centred? Alternatively perhaps a portrait orientation that cuts out the land to the left and right of the three poles? An interesting idea but one that just didn''t come quite work for me.4', '2003-08-18 16:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(391977, 32671, 9986, '<td valign="top">is that a riverbed? i have a feeling that some part of the subject is damp...had it been a prched field, the effect would have been better....</td>', 'is that a riverbed? i have a feeling that some part of the subject is damp...had it been a prched field, the effect would have been better....', '2003-08-18 16:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(391980, 33043, 9986, '<td valign="top">would have been a much better photo if not for a focus mismatch somewhere...</td>', 'would have been a much better photo if not for a focus mismatch somewhere...', '2003-08-18 16:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(391982, 32451, 9986, '<td valign="top">something amiss somewhere...is this from a camcorder?</td>', 'something amiss somewhere...is this from a camcorder?', '2003-08-18 16:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(391983, 32779, 3087, '<td valign="top">It may be irrational but then again there are studies that back me up - colours really do have emotional impact and for me, these vivid colours feel very upbeat. Because they dominate the image it doesn''t convey desolation to me as much as it might be expexted to given the pose of the model. That said I do really like the unusual viewpoint, the DOF choices and the very clever use of framing.<br/>6</td>', 'It may be irrational but then again there are studies that back me up - colours really do have emotional impact and for me, these vivid colours feel very upbeat. Because they dominate the image it doesn''t convey desolation to me as much as it might be expexted to given the pose of the model. That said I do really like the unusual viewpoint, the DOF choices and the very clever use of framing.6', '2003-08-18 16:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(391984, 33216, 9986, '<td valign="top">nice...u executed the "lonely view from top" aspect quite well...</td>', 'nice...u executed the "lonely view from top" aspect quite well...', '2003-08-18 16:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(391985, 33204, 9986, '<td valign="top">am touched......</td>', 'am touched......', '2003-08-18 16:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(391986, 33048, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is one of those comments that people moan about but I really do find that the background detracts from the core idea of this image. I love the idea of the stark metal chain partially obscuring the lonely looking child on the swings. I love the way his clothes reflect the reds and greys of the swing. But I really do find that the background park area of vivid blues and yellows takes a lot of the mood away. Some may feel exactly the opposite because, on the other hand, that bright coloured area is like a separate happy world which this kid isn''t a part of. It just doesn''t work like that for me. I think DOF choice here is absolutely excellent.<br/>6</td>', 'This is one of those comments that people moan about but I really do find that the background detracts from the core idea of this image. I love the idea of the stark metal chain partially obscuring the lonely looking child on the swings. I love the way his clothes reflect the reds and greys of the swing. But I really do find that the background park area of vivid blues and yellows takes a lot of the mood away. Some may feel exactly the opposite because, on the other hand, that bright coloured area is like a separate happy world which this kid isn''t a part of. It just doesn''t work like that for me. I think DOF choice here is absolutely excellent.6', '2003-08-18 16:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(391987, 32943, 9986, '<td valign="top">i like that caption....photo would have done with a better exposure...a bit dark IMO</td>', 'i like that caption....photo would have done with a better exposure...a bit dark IMO', '2003-08-18 16:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(391989, 32465, 9986, '<td valign="top">i am guessing....this would look better in the original....can u share the (non-negativised) version (if u have?)</td>', 'i am guessing....this would look better in the original....can u share the (non-negativised) version (if u have?)', '2003-08-18 16:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(391990, 32344, 3087, '<td valign="top">An emotionally charged portrayal of desolation which, for me, is let down by lighting and poor image quality. I''d also like it without the bag at the front obscuring part of her hand and cup - of course I appreciate that this is a candid and that you probably couldn''t do anything about that - I''m talking simply about what would make the image stronger for me. <br/>7</td>', 'An emotionally charged portrayal of desolation which, for me, is let down by lighting and poor image quality. I''d also like it without the bag at the front obscuring part of her hand and cup - of course I appreciate that this is a candid and that you probably couldn''t do anything about that - I''m talking simply about what would make the image stronger for me. 7', '2003-08-18 16:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(391991, 32752, 9986, '<td valign="top">a camcorder photo?</td>', 'a camcorder photo?', '2003-08-18 16:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(391993, 33199, 9986, '<td valign="top">feel that the contrast is a bit too high....</td>', 'feel that the contrast is a bit too high....', '2003-08-18 16:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
