(392001, 32683, 9986, '<td valign="top">this is good...makes me feel like going to this place...i have a feeling that this would have been better with the addition of a person in the frame...photo looks kinda empty...but maybe thats the way u intended to show desolation....</td>', 'this is good...makes me feel like going to this place...i have a feeling that this would have been better with the addition of a person in the frame...photo looks kinda empty...but maybe thats the way u intended to show desolation....', '2003-08-18 16:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
