(392004, 33126, 9986, '<td valign="top">very very good....a winner maybe?</td>', 'very very good....a winner maybe?', '2003-08-18 16:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(392006, 32825, 9986, '<td valign="top">facial expressions would have been a much better addition....would have been a great asset to covey the emotions..</td>', 'facial expressions would have been a much better addition....would have been a great asset to covey the emotions..', '2003-08-18 16:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(392007, 32989, 9986, '<td valign="top">good one.</td>', 'good one.', '2003-08-18 16:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(392008, 33136, 3087, '<td valign="top">An image that has grown on me after some days of voting and reviewing. It conveys mood very well. Lighting and shadow are used strikingly. Composition is subtle but stronger than I first appreciated.<br/>8</td>', 'An image that has grown on me after some days of voting and reviewing. It conveys mood very well. Lighting and shadow are used strikingly. Composition is subtle but stronger than I first appreciated.8', '2003-08-18 16:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(392009, 32718, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice use of sepia tone</td>', 'Nice use of sepia tone', '2003-08-18 16:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(392010, 32477, 3575, '<td valign="top">It is a lovely shot and the open sea is desolate. I don''t know what has caused the quality problem with the noise, perhaps just converting it to jpeg? Also, it is a good idea to straighten the image horizon.</td>', 'It is a lovely shot and the open sea is desolate. I don''t know what has caused the quality problem with the noise, perhaps just converting it to jpeg? Also, it is a good idea to straighten the image horizon.', '2003-08-18 16:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(392011, 32699, 3575, '<td valign="top">Great touch with the skull, where''d you dig that up :) just kidding. Love the angle of the hill. And I like the sepia. Nice.</td>', 'Great touch with the skull, where''d you dig that up :) just kidding. Love the angle of the hill. And I like the sepia. Nice.', '2003-08-18 16:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(392012, 33111, 9986, '<td valign="top">looks a bit out of focus</td>', 'looks a bit out of focus', '2003-08-18 16:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(392014, 33136, 9986, '<td valign="top">good perspective...nice color tones too...is this BW / Sepia or natural</td>', 'good perspective...nice color tones too...is this BW / Sepia or natural', '2003-08-18 17:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(392015, 32668, 3087, '<td valign="top">Just feels too contrived, though I appreciate that this may be the intention - a studio depiction of the theme. Lacks an emotional impact for me though I do like composition, partial framing by long, bended branch and colour and position of cactus.<br/>6</td>', 'Just feels too contrived, though I appreciate that this may be the intention - a studio depiction of the theme. Lacks an emotional impact for me though I do like composition, partial framing by long, bended branch and colour and position of cactus.6', '2003-08-18 17:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(392016, 32960, 3575, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity and contrast. The sepia makes it look like everything is covered in dust. Very nice!</td>', 'I like the clarity and contrast. The sepia makes it look like everything is covered in dust. Very nice!', '2003-08-18 17:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(392017, 33101, 9986, '<td valign="top">image looks too fluffy...i love the subject though....would have deifinitely rated it higher had it not been for the extra amount of fluffiness....was it intentional?</td>', 'image looks too fluffy...i love the subject though....would have deifinitely rated it higher had it not been for the extra amount of fluffiness....was it intentional?', '2003-08-18 17:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(392018, 33214, 10084, '<td valign="top">This picture gives me the most feeling of desolation of all the photos. Little bit nicer if it was not so bright, but the composition is beautiful.</td>', 'This picture gives me the most feeling of desolation of all the photos. Little bit nicer if it was not so bright, but the composition is beautiful.', '2003-08-18 17:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(392019, 33202, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great subject and very good choice to go black and white, and to keep the tone pretty harsh rather than too soft a sepia. That said composition isn''t strong for me and I would be interested to see other images from the frame if you took any which focused in on different areas or were taken from different viewpoints.<br/>6</td>', 'Great subject and very good choice to go black and white, and to keep the tone pretty harsh rather than too soft a sepia. That said composition isn''t strong for me and I would be interested to see other images from the frame if you took any which focused in on different areas or were taken from different viewpoints.6', '2003-08-18 17:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(392021, 32516, 9986, '<td valign="top">excellent....is that a real skull or did u happen to place one :-) ? ''cos the skull looks too neat to have been there for long....:-)</td>', 'excellent....is that a real skull or did u happen to place one :-) ? ''cos the skull looks too neat to have been there for long....:-)', '2003-08-18 17:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(392022, 33006, 9986, '<td valign="top">great...</td>', 'great...', '2003-08-18 17:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(392023, 32771, 3575, '<td valign="top">If that''s a real award, I think someone should be flogged for creating it. Nothing like "devistating" the heart of a youngster. Very nice play into the topic. Pretty good photography too :)</td>', 'If that''s a real award, I think someone should be flogged for creating it. Nothing like "devistating" the heart of a youngster. Very nice play into the topic. Pretty good photography too :)', '2003-08-18 17:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(392024, 33205, 9986, '<td valign="top">don''t get the connection with desolation?</td>', 'don''t get the connection with desolation?', '2003-08-18 17:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(392025, 32656, 3575, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo.', '2003-08-18 17:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(392026, 33118, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a nice capture - you chose just the right time (or waited for it out in the cool morning) because the mist/ fog really adds hugely to the final effect. I like the foreground rocks and the off-centre composition. I''d prefer there to be no ropes holding her in place and likewise, the wooden pallette (sp?). Overall an image with a strong emotional mood conveyed.<br/>7</td>', 'This is a nice capture - you chose just the right time (or waited for it out in the cool morning) because the mist/ fog really adds hugely to the final effect. I like the foreground rocks and the off-centre composition. I''d prefer there to be no ropes holding her in place and likewise, the wooden pallette (sp?). Overall an image with a strong emotional mood conveyed.7', '2003-08-18 17:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(392027, 33147, 10686, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but the roof and other things that are not desaturated are very distracting</td>', 'Good concept, but the roof and other things that are not desaturated are very distracting', '2003-08-18 17:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(392028, 33043, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed. I would like it a little bit sharper but it''s a very nice photograph.</td>', 'Beautifully composed. I would like it a little bit sharper but it''s a very nice photograph.', '2003-08-18 17:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(392029, 33244, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like it. Great lighting and composition</td>', 'I like it. Great lighting and composition', '2003-08-18 17:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(392030, 33142, 3087, '<td valign="top">A great image which is strengthened by the inclusion of the two cows. That said, the scene seems to convey bucolic peace and rural life and doesn''t feel remotely desolate to me. However, desolate is such a wide subject and we all have such different interpretations of it so don''t take my comments as an indication that I''m lowering my vote for "challenge not met" type reasons.<br/>6</td>', 'A great image which is strengthened by the inclusion of the two cows. That said, the scene seems to convey bucolic peace and rural life and doesn''t feel remotely desolate to me. However, desolate is such a wide subject and we all have such different interpretations of it so don''t take my comments as an indication that I''m lowering my vote for "challenge not met" type reasons.6', '2003-08-18 17:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(392032, 32774, 3575, '<td valign="top">I like it. At first I was wishing for more contrast but then it wouldn''t look like a dust storm. The ground colors are very unique. I will be interested to find out where this was shot. Nice job.</td>', 'I like it. At first I was wishing for more contrast but then it wouldn''t look like a dust storm. The ground colors are very unique. I will be interested to find out where this was shot. Nice job.', '2003-08-18 17:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(392034, 32607, 3575, '<td valign="top">I love the single silouette. Composition wise, very good. I think though that perhaps so much was cropped out of the image that the quality of the final shot was comprimised. Of course, I might be completely wrong. :) well done.</td>', 'I love the single silouette. Composition wise, very good. I think though that perhaps so much was cropped out of the image that the quality of the final shot was comprimised. Of course, I might be completely wrong. :) well done.', '2003-08-18 17:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(392037, 33136, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done! Excellent exposure, nice, sharp detail and enough contrast so we can see everything. The door makes the shot for me :) Just perfect in every respect. 10!</td>', 'Beautifully done! Excellent exposure, nice, sharp detail and enough contrast so we can see everything. The door makes the shot for me :) Just perfect in every respect. 10!', '2003-08-18 17:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(392038, 32824, 3575, '<td valign="top">I love the flowers in the median. It''s such an irony, don''t you think? Great perspective. Sepia was a good choice.</td>', 'I love the flowers in the median. It''s such an irony, don''t you think? Great perspective. Sepia was a good choice.', '2003-08-18 17:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(392039, 33082, 3575, '<td valign="top">Hey, how did you get into my fridge?! I bet I''m not the first to say that, am I. But, in my case it''s almost true. Slimfast and beer and some milk. Ah, the single life :)<br/></td>', 'Hey, how did you get into my fridge?! I bet I''m not the first to say that, am I. But, in my case it''s almost true. Slimfast and beer and some milk. Ah, the single life :)', '2003-08-18 17:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(392040, 32937, 3575, '<td valign="top">That''s very bright moon, unless it''s in the land of the midnight sun? I love the way it has lit up the fog. I really like this shot but I would crop off the big tree on the left, it attracts me to the foreground but the beauty is in the farground (farground, is that a word?)</td>', 'That''s very bright moon, unless it''s in the land of the midnight sun? I love the way it has lit up the fog. I really like this shot but I would crop off the big tree on the left, it attracts me to the foreground but the beauty is in the farground (farground, is that a word?)', '2003-08-18 17:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(392042, 33108, 3575, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! Definately desolate. You gave us so much to look at in this shot that you could have chosen to leave out such as the rocks &amp; flowers and the snow and I''m so happy you included them. You have a wonderful eye for composition. You were very lucky with the sky, I think. 10</td>', 'Fabulous! Definately desolate. You gave us so much to look at in this shot that you could have chosen to leave out such as the rocks & flowers and the snow and I''m so happy you included them. You have a wonderful eye for composition. You were very lucky with the sky, I think. 10', '2003-08-18 17:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(392047, 33245, 9098, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful photo, I''m not sure he makes me feel desolation, but definitely a sadness.</td>', 'This is a very powerful photo, I''m not sure he makes me feel desolation, but definitely a sadness.', '2003-08-18 17:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(392048, 32592, 3087, '<td valign="top">What I like most are the colours and textures. It''s a very earthy and sensual image. I am not so keen on the harsh lighting on the skull - seems to be at odds with the rest.<br/>6</td>', 'What I like most are the colours and textures. It''s a very earthy and sensual image. I am not so keen on the harsh lighting on the skull - seems to be at odds with the rest.6', '2003-08-18 17:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(392050, 33045, 2130, '<td valign="top">a ribbon, the colors are amazing :)</td>', 'a ribbon, the colors are amazing :)', '2003-08-18 17:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(392058, 33042, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very serene, lovely interruption to the horizon and that gentle, subtle cloud works well for me. Good choice to go black and white, toning seems a bit purple to me.<br/>7</td>', 'Very serene, lovely interruption to the horizon and that gentle, subtle cloud works well for me. Good choice to go black and white, toning seems a bit purple to me.7', '2003-08-18 17:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(392075, 32768, 11321, '<td valign="top">Sorry about your dog :(<br/>The dog''s right ear is partly out of the picture (IMHO bad) and his leg on the right shouldn''t be on the picture I think.<br/>The dog''s eyes are good!</td>', 'Sorry about your dog :(The dog''s right ear is partly out of the picture (IMHO bad) and his leg on the right shouldn''t be on the picture I think.The dog''s eyes are good!', '2003-08-18 18:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(392077, 33134, 11321, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary!</td>', 'Extraordinary!', '2003-08-18 18:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(392078, 32990, 3575, '<td valign="top">Well, it is hard to call this desolate but I can see where you were taking the shot. I think it is absolutely gorgeous! I don''t think there is anything I like better than sunbeams and yours are so dramatic. I really like your choice of the blue duotone. It took me a look or two before I realized that it is not a color shot. The color and surface of the water is great, that is why I would like to see a little more water in the composition because it is so beautiful. That''s my only complaint, if you want to call it that.</td>', 'Well, it is hard to call this desolate but I can see where you were taking the shot. I think it is absolutely gorgeous! I don''t think there is anything I like better than sunbeams and yours are so dramatic. I really like your choice of the blue duotone. It took me a look or two before I realized that it is not a color shot. The color and surface of the water is great, that is why I would like to see a little more water in the composition because it is so beautiful. That''s my only complaint, if you want to call it that.', '2003-08-18 18:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(392080, 32562, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wow. The silouettes on the horizon are amazing! I love the glow of the moon and I believe this was just begging to be b&amp;w, at least your version makes me feel that. Wonderful.</td>', 'Wow. The silouettes on the horizon are amazing! I love the glow of the moon and I believe this was just begging to be b&w, at least your version makes me feel that. Wonderful.', '2003-08-18 18:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(392082, 32813, 11321, '<td valign="top">IMHO the compostion is good! I like this kind of pictures in black and white :)</td>', 'IMHO the compostion is good! I like this kind of pictures in black and white :)', '2003-08-18 18:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(392083, 33018, 3575, '<td valign="top">LOL,. that''s what I call recycling! Interesting shot and well composed.</td>', 'LOL,. that''s what I call recycling! Interesting shot and well composed.', '2003-08-18 18:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(392084, 33126, 3575, '<td valign="top">I just don''t know how to score this. the photography is professional and wonderfully artistic but she doesn''t really look heartbroken to me. Anyway, I''ll take your word for it and give you what I feel this work of art deserves, 10. I give a lot of credit to the model too.</td>', 'I just don''t know how to score this. the photography is professional and wonderfully artistic but she doesn''t really look heartbroken to me. Anyway, I''ll take your word for it and give you what I feel this work of art deserves, 10. I give a lot of credit to the model too.', '2003-08-18 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(392086, 33016, 11321, '<td valign="top">IMHO bad angle to shoot..<br/>The boat is too big on the picture,<br/>I would like to see more water around the boat.<br/>I like it black and white :)</td>', 'IMHO bad angle to shoot..The boat is too big on the picture,I would like to see more water around the boat.I like it black and white :)', '2003-08-18 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(392087, 33042, 3575, '<td valign="top">A work of art. Excellent use of negative space. Beautifully composed, super clarity and just very simple and clean and I think this is a 10.</td>', 'A work of art. Excellent use of negative space. Beautifully composed, super clarity and just very simple and clean and I think this is a 10.', '2003-08-18 18:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(392088, 32466, 3575, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot. The lighting is wonderful and so is the exposure and sharpness.</td>', 'Very pretty shot. The lighting is wonderful and so is the exposure and sharpness.', '2003-08-18 18:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(392090, 32994, 11321, '<td valign="top">eh :) the girl is looking away from the picture -  i want to see what is there too! :)<br/>yes, black and white picture.. i like it</td>', 'eh :) the girl is looking away from the picture -  i want to see what is there too! :)yes, black and white picture.. i like it', '2003-08-18 18:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(392092, 33238, 11321, '<td valign="top">Humor! :D<br/>It was just about time to move :)<br/>What was there? Just curious.<br/>The door on the left is attracting my attention too much.. i think it is not needed on the picture.</td>', 'Humor! :DIt was just about time to move :)What was there? Just curious.The door on the left is attracting my attention too much.. i think it is not needed on the picture.', '2003-08-18 18:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(392093, 32760, 3575, '<td valign="top">I have been staring at this photo for a few minutes just wondering about the colors. Everything in here is the same hue! Orange! Her hair, her freckles, the table, the bottles. I think that it is all the natural colors and it is very wonderful. I love the composition. Love it. :)</td>', 'I have been staring at this photo for a few minutes just wondering about the colors. Everything in here is the same hue! Orange! Her hair, her freckles, the table, the bottles. I think that it is all the natural colors and it is very wonderful. I love the composition. Love it. :)', '2003-08-18 18:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(392094, 33099, 11321, '<td valign="top">the title of the picture is not good for me..<br/>maybe something related to prison and prisoner who is alone in that closed room where is only one squre hole... that must be true loenlyness and feeling of desolation</td>', 'the title of the picture is not good for me..maybe something related to prison and prisoner who is alone in that closed room where is only one squre hole... that must be true loenlyness and feeling of desolation', '2003-08-18 18:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(392095, 32989, 11321, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2003-08-18 18:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(392096, 33045, 1005, '<td valign="top">That''s a VERY good picute!  Love the colors.  Personal taste - maybe back off just a bit (more negative space around the tree) and move to your right (if available) to catch more of the hills (and less of the town lights).  If that wasn''t possible, oh well.  This is one of the most striking pieces I''ve seen here in a while.  Hands down winner!!!  10 Rob the Swash  (I guess now I''m going to have to vote so this counts!)</td>', 'That''s a VERY good picute!  Love the colors.  Personal taste - maybe back off just a bit (more negative space around the tree) and move to your right (if available) to catch more of the hills (and less of the town lights).  If that wasn''t possible, oh well.  This is one of the most striking pieces I''ve seen here in a while.  Hands down winner!!!  10 Rob the Swash  (I guess now I''m going to have to vote so this counts!)', '2003-08-18 18:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(392098, 32496, 1005, '<td valign="top">IMO this is the wrong emotion, but love the shot!!!  Intense!  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'IMO this is the wrong emotion, but love the shot!!!  Intense!  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-08-18 18:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(392099, 32496, 3575, '<td valign="top">Yikes!! Did she get stung? I sure hope you compensated your model for hazard pay :)</td>', 'Yikes!! Did she get stung? I sure hope you compensated your model for hazard pay :)', '2003-08-18 18:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(392100, 32782, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nicely desolate shot (kinda don''t like cutesy titles matched up to sad photos, but I don''t score titles, just read them)  Interesting curves on this tree.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nicely desolate shot (kinda don''t like cutesy titles matched up to sad photos, but I don''t score titles, just read them)  Interesting curves on this tree.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-08-18 18:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(392106, 33052, 11321, '<td valign="top">IMHO the blur at the lower side of the picture is not good</td>', 'IMHO the blur at the lower side of the picture is not good', '2003-08-18 19:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(392107, 32668, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like your elements, but your set up needs finishing.  This looks newly done...to pull off the illusion, smooth the sand a bit more then rake it, then blow it.  It needs to look less disturbed (now this said, these are NIT points) Nice details on the skull, cactus and branch.8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice shot, I like your elements, but your set up needs finishing.  This looks newly done...to pull off the illusion, smooth the sand a bit more then rake it, then blow it.  It needs to look less disturbed (now this said, these are NIT points) Nice details on the skull, cactus and branch.8 Rob the Swash', '2003-08-18 19:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(392108, 32496, 11295, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, although I see more fear than desolation here.</td>', 'Nice capture, although I see more fear than desolation here.', '2003-08-18 19:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(392109, 33164, 11321, '<td valign="top">the horisont is too much in the middle.. ohtervise good!</td>', 'the horisont is too much in the middle.. ohtervise good!', '2003-08-18 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(392111, 33198, 2716, '<td valign="top">Love the fact that you can see the sky through the windows.  Great capture and colors.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Love the fact that you can see the sky through the windows.  Great capture and colors.  Jacko.  9', '2003-08-18 19:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(392118, 32854, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the monkey!  I don''t get any sense of this challenge (my bad).  A little too bright on the top of it''s head, too.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Great shot of the monkey!  I don''t get any sense of this challenge (my bad).  A little too bright on the top of it''s head, too.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-08-18 19:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(392120, 32783, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but she has the cleanest hair I''ve ever seen on a vagrant.  Good levels of contrast.  (Her gloves look brand new, too).  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice shot, but she has the cleanest hair I''ve ever seen on a vagrant.  Good levels of contrast.  (Her gloves look brand new, too).  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-08-18 19:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(392124, 33219, 11321, '<td valign="top">i like the idea!</td>', 'i like the idea!', '2003-08-18 19:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(392128, 32932, 8981, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty creative take on the challenge.  I like your idea, but I think I would have prefered the subject being somewhere closer to the middle/off center of the photo, opposed to the upper right corner.  I actually almost missed it. Nice clarity and focus.</td>', 'This is a pretty creative take on the challenge.  I like your idea, but I think I would have prefered the subject being somewhere closer to the middle/off center of the photo, opposed to the upper right corner.  I actually almost missed it. Nice clarity and focus.', '2003-08-18 19:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(392135, 32949, 8860, '<td valign="top">Bu it isn''t! There''s a man over there! Nice shot with good tones and atmosphere. Still not deserted though - I know, I know - he''s in the process of deserting.. ;)</td>', 'Bu it isn''t! There''s a man over there! Nice shot with good tones and atmosphere. Still not deserted though - I know, I know - he''s in the process of deserting.. ;)', '2003-08-18 20:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
