(392224, 33228, 2567, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Meets the challenge.  The sky really brings this shot to life.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Meets the challenge.  The sky really brings this shot to life.  Good luck.', '2003-08-18 22:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
