(392228, 33244, 2567, '<td valign="top">There''s something about an empty parking lot that makes the blood run cold.  Nice composition.  I like the way the cement forms run out into the city lights.  Good luck.</td>', 'There''s something about an empty parking lot that makes the blood run cold.  Nice composition.  I like the way the cement forms run out into the city lights.  Good luck.', '2003-08-18 22:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
