(392591, 33176, 9643, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  The pebbles in the foreground contrasted with the very still water makes this interesting to look at.  The ruins of the pier fit the challenge well.</td>', 'Nice photo.  The pebbles in the foreground contrasted with the very still water makes this interesting to look at.  The ruins of the pier fit the challenge well.', '2003-08-19 08:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
