(392618, 32980, 11314, '<td valign="top">This is a powerful image of a child''s desolation.  It would not have been as gripping in living color.</td>', 'This is a powerful image of a child''s desolation.  It would not have been as gripping in living color.', '2003-08-19 09:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
