(392629, 32496, 8891, '<td valign="top">Should have gone into the movie challenge for "The Bee" but I guess that was only movie of the week.</td>', 'Should have gone into the movie challenge for "The Bee" but I guess that was only movie of the week.', '2003-08-19 09:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(392651, 32825, 11314, '<td valign="top">It would have been more effective if he had worn or dirtier clothing on here.  I don''t think this is supposed to be a homeless man, just someone hopeless.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'It would have been more effective if he had worn or dirtier clothing on here.  I don''t think this is supposed to be a homeless man, just someone hopeless.  Very nicely done.', '2003-08-19 10:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(392683, 33186, 6008, '<td valign="top">Those clouds really adds  a very dramatic impact. I''m not sure what the structures are, they kind of remind me of the oil pumps out in the countryside here, but they do an adequate job conveying desolation.</td>', 'Those clouds really adds  a very dramatic impact. I''m not sure what the structures are, they kind of remind me of the oil pumps out in the countryside here, but they do an adequate job conveying desolation.', '2003-08-19 11:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(392685, 32989, 6008, '<td valign="top">Even those this is a desolation image and the house has seen better days, it does seem very calming. I could see this hanging on a wall somewhere. The clouds add a nice drama to it and the various colors on the walls match the sky. The only thing I would have preferred would be that the roof of the building not be so dark. There seems to be missing slates (or similar) and I think that would have helped with the overall feel. Normally I dont like ''big'' borders, but it works here.</td>', 'Even those this is a desolation image and the house has seen better days, it does seem very calming. I could see this hanging on a wall somewhere. The clouds add a nice drama to it and the various colors on the walls match the sky. The only thing I would have preferred would be that the roof of the building not be so dark. There seems to be missing slates (or similar) and I think that would have helped with the overall feel. Normally I dont like ''big'' borders, but it works here.', '2003-08-19 11:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(392687, 32718, 6008, '<td valign="top">The dark sepia really ages the image - it is almost like a step back into the depression. There are a lot of textures here, which helps lead the eye around the photograph - there seems to be something to look at in every section. The tonal range is excellent, there is nothing too dark or too bright. A wonderful capture of desolation, as oxymoronic as that sounds.</td>', 'The dark sepia really ages the image - it is almost like a step back into the depression. There are a lot of textures here, which helps lead the eye around the photograph - there seems to be something to look at in every section. The tonal range is excellent, there is nothing too dark or too bright. A wonderful capture of desolation, as oxymoronic as that sounds.', '2003-08-19 11:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(392689, 33246, 11318, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Beautiful blue sky in the background really enhances the definition of that tree.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Beautiful blue sky in the background really enhances the definition of that tree.', '2003-08-19 11:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(392691, 33233, 6008, '<td valign="top">This conveys the loneliness definition of desolation to me, which the duotone compliments. The circular armrests of the bench are appealing, almost like a portal that draws the eye through them. I''m sure this is a basketball or tennis court in a park somewhere, but with the high wall on the left it sort of reminds me of a prison yard and I think that strenthens the loneliness feel of it to me.</td>', 'This conveys the loneliness definition of desolation to me, which the duotone compliments. The circular armrests of the bench are appealing, almost like a portal that draws the eye through them. I''m sure this is a basketball or tennis court in a park somewhere, but with the high wall on the left it sort of reminds me of a prison yard and I think that strenthens the loneliness feel of it to me.', '2003-08-19 11:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(392694, 32562, 6008, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I''m becoming a sucker for silhouettes lately, plus it''s black and white so that''s even better! It reminds me of a desert oasis, which isnt really desolate but very pretty. I can see the lonliness factor here, though. The sun/moon is a little too centered, but I dont think it would have the same effect had you put it to the side, you would have had to try it I guess. Even so, a really nice image that I could see hanging on a wall!</td>', 'I really like this. I''m becoming a sucker for silhouettes lately, plus it''s black and white so that''s even better! It reminds me of a desert oasis, which isnt really desolate but very pretty. I can see the lonliness factor here, though. The sun/moon is a little too centered, but I dont think it would have the same effect had you put it to the side, you would have had to try it I guess. Even so, a really nice image that I could see hanging on a wall!', '2003-08-19 11:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(392695, 33163, 6008, '<td valign="top">I love old headstones, and what a find with the skull and crossbones! The foreground headstone, whereas it is centered, works well to enhance the background. I like how when you concentrate on one or the other that your eyes naturally create the dof and focus out the other. The use of black and white is, of course, perfect for the image. Not sure I can see much here that could be improved on.</td>', 'I love old headstones, and what a find with the skull and crossbones! The foreground headstone, whereas it is centered, works well to enhance the background. I like how when you concentrate on one or the other that your eyes naturally create the dof and focus out the other. The use of black and white is, of course, perfect for the image. Not sure I can see much here that could be improved on.', '2003-08-19 12:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(392697, 33065, 6008, '<td valign="top">I think this gets my whacky, creative vote of the challenge! It''s quite surreal, and very disturbing, but I like it. It has quite a shocking visual, the black and white compliments it well, although not a big fan of the title. This seems very fringe and it will be interesting to see where it places at the end of the challenge.</td>', 'I think this gets my whacky, creative vote of the challenge! It''s quite surreal, and very disturbing, but I like it. It has quite a shocking visual, the black and white compliments it well, although not a big fan of the title. This seems very fringe and it will be interesting to see where it places at the end of the challenge.', '2003-08-19 12:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(392698, 33166, 11318, '<td valign="top">I quite like this shot, very stunning.  The only detractor, for me at least, is the brightness of the sun, it almost hurts my eyes and competes for the focus of the photo.</td>', 'I quite like this shot, very stunning.  The only detractor, for me at least, is the brightness of the sun, it almost hurts my eyes and competes for the focus of the photo.', '2003-08-19 12:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(392700, 32980, 6008, '<td valign="top">The first thing I noticed was the crooked horizon line, but then it sort of compliments the feeling that Lillan had thrown herself on the sand in utter desolation as opposed to just napping, which the horizon could have easily suggested had it been straight. The kite in the background is a nice touch. I would have liked more contrast in the clouds, though. They sky does indeed look cloudy, but I think as they are one of the prominent features that is suppose to be supplying the drama, they should have been more dramatic. An interesting take on the challenge that is certainly a breath of fresh air from old buildings!</td>', 'The first thing I noticed was the crooked horizon line, but then it sort of compliments the feeling that Lillan had thrown herself on the sand in utter desolation as opposed to just napping, which the horizon could have easily suggested had it been straight. The kite in the background is a nice touch. I would have liked more contrast in the clouds, though. They sky does indeed look cloudy, but I think as they are one of the prominent features that is suppose to be supplying the drama, they should have been more dramatic. An interesting take on the challenge that is certainly a breath of fresh air from old buildings!', '2003-08-19 12:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(392702, 33151, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is a really vivid blue, and I really like it! It certainly gives a ''wow'' when you first look at it. The silhouettes are good, sort of framing the land off in the distance, although the horizon line looks a little crooked. Not instantly seeing desolation as it''s a very pretty image, but I suppose it does support loneliness to some degree.</td>', 'This is a really vivid blue, and I really like it! It certainly gives a ''wow'' when you first look at it. The silhouettes are good, sort of framing the land off in the distance, although the horizon line looks a little crooked. Not instantly seeing desolation as it''s a very pretty image, but I suppose it does support loneliness to some degree.', '2003-08-19 12:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(392703, 33190, 8689, '<td valign="top">doesnt look desolate to me!</td>', 'doesnt look desolate to me!', '2003-08-19 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(392708, 33232, 6008, '<td valign="top">So that''s where they go to die, in a large field! (or so it seems). This is interesting to me as I''ve never seen one of these boats other than in full working order on the river. The vegetation at the front (or is that back?) really ages it well, as do the sepia. It''s almost like a huge garden ornament, pretty amazing.</td>', 'So that''s where they go to die, in a large field! (or so it seems). This is interesting to me as I''ve never seen one of these boats other than in full working order on the river. The vegetation at the front (or is that back?) really ages it well, as do the sepia. It''s almost like a huge garden ornament, pretty amazing.', '2003-08-19 12:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(392717, 32980, 8689, '<td valign="top">gorgeous</td>', 'gorgeous', '2003-08-19 12:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(392720, 33026, 8689, '<td valign="top">a little contrived</td>', 'a little contrived', '2003-08-19 12:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(392722, 33233, 8689, '<td valign="top">nice angle</td>', 'nice angle', '2003-08-19 12:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(392740, 33045, 8689, '<td valign="top">gorgeous</td>', 'gorgeous', '2003-08-19 12:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(392748, 33216, 8689, '<td valign="top">i like the idea but the house looks too fake</td>', 'i like the idea but the house looks too fake', '2003-08-19 12:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(392755, 33217, 8689, '<td valign="top">nice idea</td>', 'nice idea', '2003-08-19 12:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(392811, 32693, 8608, '<td valign="top">too beautiful to be desolate...</td>', 'too beautiful to be desolate...', '2003-08-19 14:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(392861, 32529, 6999, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast between the refinery towers and the green-ish hillsides. There''s a creepy dis-organised composition to this which brings out the feeling of strangeness also. Something doesn''t quite put it at the top of my list this week though: I think the impression that you''ve had to hide too much of the refinery in order to get a clean composition. Excellent work though.</td>', 'Love the contrast between the refinery towers and the green-ish hillsides. There''s a creepy dis-organised composition to this which brings out the feeling of strangeness also. Something doesn''t quite put it at the top of my list this week though: I think the impression that you''ve had to hide too much of the refinery in order to get a clean composition. Excellent work though.', '2003-08-19 15:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(392863, 32800, 6597, '<td valign="top">The picture is fuzzy happens to all of us sometimes.<br/>                  Sue</td>', 'The picture is fuzzy happens to all of us sometimes.                  Sue', '2003-08-19 15:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(392864, 32989, 6597, '<td valign="top">very good title good photo too.    8</td>', 'very good title good photo too.    8', '2003-08-19 15:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(392865, 32774, 6999, '<td valign="top">Sky tones, the steam (?), the disorganisation of the wind turbines - it''s like a landscape out of Terminator, only they never had this sophisticated an imagination. All that stops you getting a ten from me (a rare thing indeed) is the feeling that it''s all a little too distant - I''d have tried less sky, perhaps losing the turbines to the left, and cropping closer to the ''islands'', just to see how that felt (of course you may have, and may have rejected it). Still the most desolate shot this week :-)</td>', 'Sky tones, the steam (?), the disorganisation of the wind turbines - it''s like a landscape out of Terminator, only they never had this sophisticated an imagination. All that stops you getting a ten from me (a rare thing indeed) is the feeling that it''s all a little too distant - I''d have tried less sky, perhaps losing the turbines to the left, and cropping closer to the ''islands'', just to see how that felt (of course you may have, and may have rejected it). Still the most desolate shot this week :-)', '2003-08-19 15:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(392866, 33147, 6597, '<td valign="top">excellent 9</td>', 'excellent 9', '2003-08-19 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(392868, 33193, 6597, '<td valign="top">what a shame   8</td>', 'what a shame   8', '2003-08-19 15:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(392869, 33108, 6999, '<td valign="top">This just has to be one of you Icelandic gang, doesn''t it? great work - especially to include that little clump of flowers to contrast the rest of it. I like alsi the fact that it''s full colour - way too easy to go black and white for this challenge it seems. Whilst the light is excellent, the bulle sky lets things down a bit - just a touch too pleasant really, and you already have the flowers to add an edge. On a grey day ...</td>', 'This just has to be one of you Icelandic gang, doesn''t it? great work - especially to include that little clump of flowers to contrast the rest of it. I like alsi the fact that it''s full colour - way too easy to go black and white for this challenge it seems. Whilst the light is excellent, the bulle sky lets things down a bit - just a touch too pleasant really, and you already have the flowers to add an edge. On a grey day ...', '2003-08-19 15:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(392873, 32769, 3087, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, overly red, certainly not visually appealing to look at.<br/>I can see that this was an attempt at a humourous entry but it just doesn''t work on any level for me.<br/>3</td>', 'Out of focus, overly red, certainly not visually appealing to look at.I can see that this was an attempt at a humourous entry but it just doesn''t work on any level for me.3', '2003-08-19 15:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(392877, 33221, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - such a vivid colour capture and the quality of light is so rich. I love the way you''ve focused in on the detail and also your diagonal composition.<br/>9</td>', 'Beautiful - such a vivid colour capture and the quality of light is so rich. I love the way you''ve focused in on the detail and also your diagonal composition.9', '2003-08-19 15:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(392880, 33045, 10643, '<td valign="top">The color in this is just beautiful. Where do they have skies like this, so that I may move there? :)</td>', 'The color in this is just beautiful. Where do they have skies like this, so that I may move there? :)', '2003-08-19 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(392943, 32797, 5705, '<td valign="top">Great shot-- super placement of the sculpture-- its too human like, I love this photo 10</td>', 'Great shot-- super placement of the sculpture-- its too human like, I love this photo 10', '2003-08-19 17:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
