(393061, 33102, 10611, '<td valign="top">How about takeing this shot straight on instead of in an angle? and focus on the bars and windows. I think that might express your title more appropriately.</td>', 'How about takeing this shot straight on instead of in an angle? and focus on the bars and windows. I think that might express your title more appropriately.', '2003-08-19 19:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
