(393069, 33139, 11073, '<td valign="top">good interpretation of category</td>', 'good interpretation of category', '2003-08-19 19:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(393070, 33219, 8860, '<td valign="top">Cute concept! Focus is a bit soft on the other balls. Shame about the slight undulation in the chequers. Great take on the challenge. [7]</td>', 'Cute concept! Focus is a bit soft on the other balls. Shame about the slight undulation in the chequers. Great take on the challenge. [7]', '2003-08-19 19:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(393073, 32529, 11073, '<td valign="top">cool pic.</td>', 'cool pic.', '2003-08-19 19:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(393075, 33101, 10611, '<td valign="top">I wish the contrast could be stronger and close in more on the wicked looking tree.</td>', 'I wish the contrast could be stronger and close in more on the wicked looking tree.', '2003-08-19 19:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(393077, 32601, 11073, '<td valign="top">cool pic.</td>', 'cool pic.', '2003-08-19 19:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(393079, 33166, 10611, '<td valign="top">Great Shot!</td>', 'Great Shot!', '2003-08-19 19:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(393080, 32783, 11073, '<td valign="top">cool pic.</td>', 'cool pic.', '2003-08-19 19:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(393081, 32980, 11073, '<td valign="top">cool pic.</td>', 'cool pic.', '2003-08-19 19:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(393082, 32451, 8860, '<td valign="top">This image looks very strangely distorted. Is this the result of a filter or external condition? It aslo suffers from some heavy compression - usually from low-quality JPEG. Other than this it is not a particularly desolate scene but it does look very picturesque.</td>', 'This image looks very strangely distorted. Is this the result of a filter or external condition? It aslo suffers from some heavy compression - usually from low-quality JPEG. Other than this it is not a particularly desolate scene but it does look very picturesque.', '2003-08-19 19:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(393084, 32606, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is more remote than desolate. Image is a bit soft, but it''s a very pleasant scene with nice cloud formation and good composition.</td>', 'This is more remote than desolate. Image is a bit soft, but it''s a very pleasant scene with nice cloud formation and good composition.', '2003-08-19 19:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(393085, 33200, 8860, '<td valign="top">Looks a little derelict to me but not desolate. Image is a bit soft or blurred, although it''s a nice composition.</td>', 'Looks a little derelict to me but not desolate. Image is a bit soft or blurred, although it''s a nice composition.', '2003-08-19 19:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(393086, 33041, 11073, '<td valign="top">cool pic.</td>', 'cool pic.', '2003-08-19 19:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(393087, 32312, 8860, '<td valign="top">Desolation is a dubious connection here, but I like the idea and execution.</td>', 'Desolation is a dubious connection here, but I like the idea and execution.', '2003-08-19 19:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(393088, 32817, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good composition of a derelict building, but I wouldn''t say desolation though. A good shot. [6]</td>', 'Good composition of a derelict building, but I wouldn''t say desolation though. A good shot. [6]', '2003-08-19 19:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(393089, 33082, 9136, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I like the duotones on the pic - it gives it a nice mood. 9.</td>', 'Great idea, I like the duotones on the pic - it gives it a nice mood. 9.', '2003-08-19 19:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(393090, 33099, 8860, '<td valign="top">I can''t connect this to desolation enough really. I can project anything I like onto the image, but it''s down to my imagination more than the image that it will mean desolation. Composition may have been improved with an off-centre alignment of the aperture - possibly higher in the frame.</td>', 'I can''t connect this to desolation enough really. I can project anything I like onto the image, but it''s down to my imagination more than the image that it will mean desolation. Composition may have been improved with an off-centre alignment of the aperture - possibly higher in the frame.', '2003-08-19 19:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(393092, 32797, 9136, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, I like the angle you shot it at. 9.</td>', 'Interesting subject, I like the angle you shot it at. 9.', '2003-08-19 19:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(393093, 32465, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good composition and interesting lighting.</td>', 'Good composition and interesting lighting.', '2003-08-19 19:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(393094, 33004, 9136, '<td valign="top">This would of been a great shot, but the quality is really bad and the lighting is harsh on the side of the childs face.</td>', 'This would of been a great shot, but the quality is really bad and the lighting is harsh on the side of the childs face.', '2003-08-19 19:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(393095, 33045, 9136, '<td valign="top">Wow! The colors in this picture are amazing! Very refreshing to see in all these greyscale and duotone pictures. Very nice... 9.</td>', 'Wow! The colors in this picture are amazing! Very refreshing to see in all these greyscale and duotone pictures. Very nice... 9.', '2003-08-19 19:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(393096, 32783, 8860, '<td valign="top">This person looks too posed and clean really. I''d go so far as to say at the height of fashion - which counters your presumed intention of showing someone down on their luck. Nicely taken, well composed shot though.</td>', 'This person looks too posed and clean really. I''d go so far as to say at the height of fashion - which counters your presumed intention of showing someone down on their luck. Nicely taken, well composed shot though.', '2003-08-19 19:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(393098, 32693, 8860, '<td valign="top">This really looks too beautiful to be desolation. A great shot though, well composed. [5]</td>', 'This really looks too beautiful to be desolation. A great shot though, well composed. [5]', '2003-08-19 19:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(393100, 32644, 8860, '<td valign="top">This actually looks like it''s recovering and with the sunlight glanced through the trees it looks too un-desolate! Image is a bit too blue-cast for me and may have been better in mono.</td>', 'This actually looks like it''s recovering and with the sunlight glanced through the trees it looks too un-desolate! Image is a bit too blue-cast for me and may have been better in mono.', '2003-08-19 19:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(393102, 32928, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great shot - perhaps not as desolate as it could be but an excellent composition and subject  nonetheless. [6]</td>', 'Great shot - perhaps not as desolate as it could be but an excellent composition and subject  nonetheless. [6]', '2003-08-19 19:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(393104, 32496, 8860, '<td valign="top">Terror is what would spring to my mind! Desolation this isn''t, but it''s an interesting shot.</td>', 'Terror is what would spring to my mind! Desolation this isn''t, but it''s an interesting shot.', '2003-08-19 19:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(393105, 32832, 8860, '<td valign="top">More dereliction or destruction than desolation, but it''s a good crisply lit shot. Image is too skewed ant-clockwise and could do with straightening (see water line). [5]</td>', 'More dereliction or destruction than desolation, but it''s a good crisply lit shot. Image is too skewed ant-clockwise and could do with straightening (see water line). [5]', '2003-08-19 19:40:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(393106, 32932, 8860, '<td valign="top">Now that''s desolation - especially if your kid''s got a new toy which requires eight batteries! I wonder if the composition would be improved if the batteries were on the next shelf down? Square-on view is confounded by the distortion on the shelves, so perhaps a 3/4 view would have been more effective showing more empty shelf space. Nice take on challenge. [6]</td>', 'Now that''s desolation - especially if your kid''s got a new toy which requires eight batteries! I wonder if the composition would be improved if the batteries were on the next shelf down? Square-on view is confounded by the distortion on the shelves, so perhaps a 3/4 view would have been more effective showing more empty shelf space. Nice take on challenge. [6]', '2003-08-19 19:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(393108, 33078, 8860, '<td valign="top">Blur is quite effective in this - it adds a daunting quality. Not particularly desolate though. Nice image.</td>', 'Blur is quite effective in this - it adds a daunting quality. Not particularly desolate though. Nice image.', '2003-08-19 19:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(393110, 33239, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lose the border! Great scene of true desolation. Some nice textures and a good composition. [7]</td>', 'Lose the border! Great scene of true desolation. Some nice textures and a good composition. [7]', '2003-08-19 19:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(393112, 33174, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very evocative shot. Makes me feel desolate, but I''m not entirely sure why because this is a tranquil scene really. I would have adjusted height of angle to avoid the clash of horizon with the outcrop from the pole. Image is a tad noisy. [7]</td>', 'Very evocative shot. Makes me feel desolate, but I''m not entirely sure why because this is a tranquil scene really. I would have adjusted height of angle to avoid the clash of horizon with the outcrop from the pole. Image is a tad noisy. [7]', '2003-08-19 19:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(393113, 32802, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is not unsettling enough! Too sunny, crisp, clean and inviting - looks lonely and isolated but not desolated. [4]</td>', 'This is not unsettling enough! Too sunny, crisp, clean and inviting - looks lonely and isolated but not desolated. [4]', '2003-08-19 19:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(393114, 33109, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the composure of this picture. Perfect focuse and great color (lol) or nice lighting I should say.</td>', 'I like the composure of this picture. Perfect focuse and great color (lol) or nice lighting I should say.', '2003-08-19 19:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(393116, 32607, 8860, '<td valign="top">Solitary, evocative and lonely -yes. Desolation - no. A well composed shot although the horizon looks skewed anticlockwise. [5]</td>', 'Solitary, evocative and lonely -yes. Desolation - no. A well composed shot although the horizon looks skewed anticlockwise. [5]', '2003-08-19 19:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(393117, 33130, 8860, '<td valign="top">To me this says ''Hope''. Well composed with nice focus and contrast. [5]</td>', 'To me this says ''Hope''. Well composed with nice focus and contrast. [5]', '2003-08-19 19:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(393118, 33240, 8860, '<td valign="top">This shot would need to look candid to communicate desolation for me. The subjects look too staged which is unfair if they are truly suffering. Composition is too central and unengaging. [3]</td>', 'This shot would need to look candid to communicate desolation for me. The subjects look too staged which is unfair if they are truly suffering. Composition is too central and unengaging. [3]', '2003-08-19 19:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(393119, 32390, 8860, '<td valign="top">Shot looks a bit skewed anti-clockwise but the image is good and well observed. Not quite desolation though. [5]</td>', 'Shot looks a bit skewed anti-clockwise but the image is good and well observed. Not quite desolation though. [5]', '2003-08-19 20:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(393121, 32943, 8860, '<td valign="top">More evocative than desolate. Beautiful sky, well composed and nicely taken. [6]</td>', 'More evocative than desolate. Beautiful sky, well composed and nicely taken. [6]', '2003-08-19 20:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(393122, 33116, 9679, '<td valign="top">Okay, this one I can relate to. I live in Arizona and my once beautiful garden now looks just like this! A sharper focus might make the leaves look even more crisp and dried out.</td>', 'Okay, this one I can relate to. I live in Arizona and my once beautiful garden now looks just like this! A sharper focus might make the leaves look even more crisp and dried out.', '2003-08-19 20:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(393123, 33216, 8860, '<td valign="top">A quite bizarre image when it first loads. Gotta be a toy house, but the title is a bit odd and it leaves me feeling that I''m missing something. [5]</td>', 'A quite bizarre image when it first loads. Gotta be a toy house, but the title is a bit odd and it leaves me feeling that I''m missing something. [5]', '2003-08-19 20:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(393125, 32937, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image - more tranquil than desolate though. Nice shot at a great time of day. [5]</td>', 'Beautiful image - more tranquil than desolate though. Nice shot at a great time of day. [5]', '2003-08-19 20:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(393130, 32939, 8860, '<td valign="top">This person is not happy. The image is a bit pixellated and jaggy, but it''s a good shot. The border does nothing for me though. [5]</td>', 'This person is not happy. The image is a bit pixellated and jaggy, but it''s a good shot. The border does nothing for me though. [5]', '2003-08-19 20:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(393131, 33168, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is too indistinct and over-effected to mean much. Yes, desolation comes through but there''s not enough to latch onto for very long. Pic looks oversharpened and the negative treatment feels a bit compensatory. Border is pointless and, if anything, should be black. [4]</td>', 'This is too indistinct and over-effected to mean much. Yes, desolation comes through but there''s not enough to latch onto for very long. Pic looks oversharpened and the negative treatment feels a bit compensatory. Border is pointless and, if anything, should be black. [4]', '2003-08-19 20:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(393133, 32994, 8860, '<td valign="top">I think we''re too close to her for desolation to come through. She looks a little thoughtful and bit sorrowful, but desolation would give way to melancholy for me. Nicely taken shot though (and a pretty subject too) but she looks a little too tightly cropped. [5]</td>', 'I think we''re too close to her for desolation to come through. She looks a little thoughtful and bit sorrowful, but desolation would give way to melancholy for me. Nicely taken shot though (and a pretty subject too) but she looks a little too tightly cropped. [5]', '2003-08-19 20:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(393134, 33051, 8860, '<td valign="top">Border overwhelms this shot, which is too soft and lacking in context or involvement with the subject to communicate desolation. [3]</td>', 'Border overwhelms this shot, which is too soft and lacking in context or involvement with the subject to communicate desolation. [3]', '2003-08-19 20:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(393135, 33111, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lose the border! Shack looks a bit derelict but this is not desolation for me. Contrast is light, focus is soft, and there is not much to hold my interest in the shot. [4]</td>', 'Lose the border! Shack looks a bit derelict but this is not desolation for me. Contrast is light, focus is soft, and there is not much to hold my interest in the shot. [4]', '2003-08-19 20:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(393138, 32718, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is derelict but not quite desolation for me. A great shot with gorgeous tones and rich textures. I would have cropped out the very top roof line - leaving the shadow of it. A reluctant [8]</td>', 'This is derelict but not quite desolation for me. A great shot with gorgeous tones and rich textures. I would have cropped out the very top roof line - leaving the shadow of it. A reluctant [8]', '2003-08-19 20:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(393140, 33109, 8860, '<td valign="top">This does capture desolation for me. Very well-taken shot - you\''ve chosen the right time of day and a great viewpoint. Good luck - should do well. [9]</td>', 'This does capture desolation for me. Very well-taken shot - you\''ve chosen the right time of day and a great viewpoint. Good luck - should do well. [9]', '2003-08-19 20:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(393142, 33217, 8860, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting and idea for this shot. A good take on challenge. Focus could have been sharper on subject or by using an item in the forground the focus could have been softer on subject making the lonely predicament even more enhanced. [5]</td>', 'Like the lighting and idea for this shot. A good take on challenge. Focus could have been sharper on subject or by using an item in the forground the focus could have been softer on subject making the lonely predicament even more enhanced. [5]', '2003-08-19 20:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(393144, 33182, 8860, '<td valign="top">Looks like she''s had a bust up with not only the boyfriend but an entire county!! Set up must have taken some collating afterwards. The shot is a bit staged and lacking in tonal range, contrast and crispness which renders the cliché a bit ineffectual. [3]</td>', 'Looks like she''s had a bust up with not only the boyfriend but an entire county!! Set up must have taken some collating afterwards. The shot is a bit staged and lacking in tonal range, contrast and crispness which renders the cliché a bit ineffectual. [3]', '2003-08-19 20:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(393145, 33043, 8860, '<td valign="top">Image too soft. Nice scene which has a degree of desolation. Good composition and cloud formation. [4]</td>', 'Image too soft. Nice scene which has a degree of desolation. Good composition and cloud formation. [4]', '2003-08-19 20:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(393146, 33027, 8860, '<td valign="top">Isolation - yes. Desolation - no. Nice shot (but border is no help) with good composition. [3]</td>', 'Isolation - yes. Desolation - no. Nice shot (but border is no help) with good composition. [3]', '2003-08-19 20:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(393147, 32825, 8860, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s just stepped out of a BMW - he''s so clean and cool! I love the textures but the set-up doesn''t wash with me. If this was a genuine candid shot then maybe an [8], but this gets a [4] from me.</td>', 'Looks like he''s just stepped out of a BMW - he''s so clean and cool! I love the textures but the set-up doesn''t wash with me. If this was a genuine candid shot then maybe an [8], but this gets a [4] from me.', '2003-08-19 20:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(393148, 32325, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and composition, but desolation isn''t it. Good tones and lighting too. A reluctant [4].</td>', 'Nice shot and composition, but desolation isn''t it. Good tones and lighting too. A reluctant [4].', '2003-08-19 20:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(393150, 32854, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely study of someone who does look wistful, if not entirely desolate. I''d like to think he just got up and swung around happily after this! Great DOF and lighting, and a nice take on the challenge. [7]</td>', 'Lovely study of someone who does look wistful, if not entirely desolate. I''d like to think he just got up and swung around happily after this! Great DOF and lighting, and a nice take on the challenge. [7]', '2003-08-19 20:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
