(393414, 33214, 11127, '<td valign="top">Thanks to those who voted and commented on the post. This was my first post here. I wish I had moved the shopping cart toward the camera a little more to expose some of the tarmac above it. I''m not from Philly, we do call them "shopping carts" in Texas. The name was a play off of "Dune Buggy". Anything with four wheels and sides is accepted as a "buggy" around here. The shot looked more dreary in B&amp;W than in color. Thanks again and I hope to learn alot from some of the obviously talented people who frequent this site.</td>', 'Thanks to those who voted and commented on the post. This was my first post here. I wish I had moved the shopping cart toward the camera a little more to expose some of the tarmac above it. I''m not from Philly, we do call them "shopping carts" in Texas. The name was a play off of "Dune Buggy". Anything with four wheels and sides is accepted as a "buggy" around here. The shot looked more dreary in B&W than in color. Thanks again and I hope to learn alot from some of the obviously talented people who frequent this site.', '2003-08-20 01:18:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(393416, 33045, 714, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning shot! The colors are magnificent! Congrats!</td>', 'This is a stunning shot! The colors are magnificent! Congrats!', '2003-08-20 01:19:05.000000', NULL, 0),
