(393484, 33186, 7339, '<td valign="top">Hello Heida,<br/> <br/>Congrats on the well deserved ribbon.<br/> <br/>i love this shot and will defiantly add it to my favorites. One thing I wanted to mention though is that it find the blue color in the top part of the highlighted clouds a bit distracting only because I noticed it and thought cool look at the blue. Otherwise I love the image and the composition and lighting.<br/> <br/>Congrats!<br/></td>', 'Hello Heida, Congrats on the well deserved ribbon. i love this shot and will defiantly add it to my favorites. One thing I wanted to mention though is that it find the blue color in the top part of the highlighted clouds a bit distracting only because I noticed it and thought cool look at the blue. Otherwise I love the image and the composition and lighting. Congrats!', '2003-08-20 01:58:28.000000', NULL, 0),
