(393527, 33182, 9711, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the honest and helpful comments. last day of the contest 3am local time here, this idea came to me, so i got off the bed, put a jean and a shirt on, and took my camera and my pockets of unorganized photos and found a corner in the living room. each time i put the camera on timer, and in a hurry i sat infront of it. my source of light was my desk lamp. and i couldn''t change the camera''s direction, the way i wanted. <br/>i''m so happy about my picture, i had something on my mind, a message and i tried to make it in frames. and your comments shows that i have. <br/></td>', 'Thanks for the honest and helpful comments. last day of the contest 3am local time here, this idea came to me, so i got off the bed, put a jean and a shirt on, and took my camera and my pockets of unorganized photos and found a corner in the living room. each time i put the camera on timer, and in a hurry i sat infront of it. my source of light was my desk lamp. and i couldn''t change the camera''s direction, the way i wanted. i''m so happy about my picture, i had something on my mind, a message and i tried to make it in frames. and your comments shows that i have. ', '2003-08-20 02:33:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(393537, 32699, 6804, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments on this. I appreciate all the opinions. I actually tried putting the scull in a more natural position and I hated it. I just couldnt get it to look right against the grass. <br/> <br/>I selected the color tones on this, from one of Sonifo''s masterpieces. So it really made my day that you liked the shot Sonja. Thanks for sharing your talent. <br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments on this. I appreciate all the opinions. I actually tried putting the scull in a more natural position and I hated it. I just couldnt get it to look right against the grass.  I selected the color tones on this, from one of Sonifo''s masterpieces. So it really made my day that you liked the shot Sonja. Thanks for sharing your talent. ', '2003-08-20 02:39:03.000000', NULL, 0),
