(393779, 32819, 7301, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by erin_m02:</b></div><hr/><i>IMHO, the rocks dominate the castle; it should be vice versa</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The rocks were placed in the foreground quite deliberately to try to show how the ruin is isolated on a rugged coatline and to give a contrast to the hazy mist that the castle lay in</td>', 'Originally posted by erin_m02:IMHO, the rocks dominate the castle; it should be vice versa  The rocks were placed in the foreground quite deliberately to try to show how the ruin is isolated on a rugged coatline and to give a contrast to the hazy mist that the castle lay in', '2003-08-20 05:28:46.000000', NULL, 0),
