(394035, 32357, 8860, '<td valign="top">Didn;t get to comment on this during the challenge. A lovely shot and quite clever. I think the subject would have been better placed turned away from the camera, although not a 180, more a 125 degree turn. Good, clean image - could have used a touch more contrast/levels.</td>', 'Didn;t get to comment on this during the challenge. A lovely shot and quite clever. I think the subject would have been better placed turned away from the camera, although not a 180, more a 125 degree turn. Good, clean image - could have used a touch more contrast/levels.', '2003-08-20 10:15:10.000000', NULL, 0),
