(394068, 33063, 11111, '<td valign="top">I actually was inspired by this setting, though perhaps my feeling isn''t clearly enough conveyed. The feeling you get at Alcatraz is definitely desolate &amp; creepy once you learn the story of what''s gone on there. It was packed with tourists though so I did what I could. Thanks for the comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-08-22 13:19:10.</i></td>', 'I actually was inspired by this setting, though perhaps my feeling isn''t clearly enough conveyed. The feeling you get at Alcatraz is definitely desolate & creepy once you learn the story of what''s gone on there. It was packed with tourists though so I did what I could. Thanks for the comments.', '2003-08-20 10:39:14.000000', '2003-08-22 14:19:10.000000', 0),
(394079, 33118, 6999, '<td valign="top">hi from the Critique Club Ursula<br/> <br/>Lucked out? Guess so. difficult to make any really useful points about this - technically its absolutely fine, and it has some outstanding points: love the composition - the three lines of distance from the rocks, the beach and the fog line, the balance of the boat and the disappearing line of the fog, all excellent. Minor point - think I''d have tried to keep the top of the aerial in shot, but that''s very minor indeed.<br/> <br/>For me it lacked a real feeling of desolation - not quite that strong an emotion I thought - though your assessment of the voters ideas is clearly more accurate than mine :-) <br/> <br/>Love the light, the contrast, the progresion of tones here too.<br/> <br/>Ed</td>', 'hi from the Critique Club Ursula Lucked out? Guess so. difficult to make any really useful points about this - technically its absolutely fine, and it has some outstanding points: love the composition - the three lines of distance from the rocks, the beach and the fog line, the balance of the boat and the disappearing line of the fog, all excellent. Minor point - think I''d have tried to keep the top of the aerial in shot, but that''s very minor indeed. For me it lacked a real feeling of desolation - not quite that strong an emotion I thought - though your assessment of the voters ideas is clearly more accurate than mine :-)  Love the light, the contrast, the progresion of tones here too. Ed', '2003-08-20 10:49:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(394102, 33045, 11181, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a well deserved ribbon! Btw, was this shot taken during sunset or sunrise? I love the colors!</td>', 'Congrats on a well deserved ribbon! Btw, was this shot taken during sunset or sunrise? I love the colors!', '2003-08-20 10:57:32.000000', NULL, 0),
