(394295, 32762, 8860, '<td valign="top">I think you got lots of 1s because this image is perceived as gimmicky through the use of negative (it''s never popular). It doesn''t mean a lot particularly and the image is almost totally reliant on the effect rather than the subject. It''s a good composition though.</td>', 'I think you got lots of 1s because this image is perceived as gimmicky through the use of negative (it''s never popular). It doesn''t mean a lot particularly and the image is almost totally reliant on the effect rather than the subject. It''s a good composition though.', '2003-08-20 12:08:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(394330, 33198, 6405, '<td valign="top">Some clouds would make big difference,pleasant sky takes away from desolation ,I give it 9 and like it very much!</td>', 'Some clouds would make big difference,pleasant sky takes away from desolation ,I give it 9 and like it very much!', '2003-08-20 12:38:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(394346, 32832, 2752, '<td valign="top">A big thankyou to all that voted and commented.  I appreciate the constructive suggestions.</td>', 'A big thankyou to all that voted and commented.  I appreciate the constructive suggestions.', '2003-08-20 12:46:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(394351, 33043, 10785, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments. This really shows the limitations of the Fuji Finepix 3800. I couldn''t get a good read to set the A/F, A/E due to the low light. It was just before 8 pm. Also I have no tripod...which is my next investment. Way to low of a shutter speed to hold by hand.</td>', 'Thanks for your comments. This really shows the limitations of the Fuji Finepix 3800. I couldn''t get a good read to set the A/F, A/E due to the low light. It was just before 8 pm. Also I have no tripod...which is my next investment. Way to low of a shutter speed to hold by hand.', '2003-08-20 12:48:42.000000', NULL, 0),
