(394378, 33086, 8860, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the comments on this. I would however like to hear from anyone who voted it 1. Was it challenge brief, image quality, composition or did you think it was staged? It would be very interesting to hear why.</td>', 'Thanks to all for the comments on this. I would however like to hear from anyone who voted it 1. Was it challenge brief, image quality, composition or did you think it was staged? It would be very interesting to hear why.', '2003-08-20 13:05:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(394474, 33119, 3540, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who commented on my photograph this week.  I''m surprised by the number of comments I''ve received on this photo.  I figured it would be a pretty evocative photo, but didn''t think I''d be getting over 20 comments.  I''m surprised I didn''t get more comments about how sick and twisted I was.  I think the haters didn''t leave comments, just bad votes.  I will not say I blame them, just disappointed that they didn''t see this image for what I think is a very real view of desolation.  Pink, hairless, blind babies crawling around their recently deceased mother... How much more desolate could this be?<br/> <br/>Thanks again for your comments. - Bob</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who commented on my photograph this week.  I''m surprised by the number of comments I''ve received on this photo.  I figured it would be a pretty evocative photo, but didn''t think I''d be getting over 20 comments.  I''m surprised I didn''t get more comments about how sick and twisted I was.  I think the haters didn''t leave comments, just bad votes.  I will not say I blame them, just disappointed that they didn''t see this image for what I think is a very real view of desolation.  Pink, hairless, blind babies crawling around their recently deceased mother... How much more desolate could this be? Thanks again for your comments. - Bob', '2003-08-20 14:00:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(394621, 33109, 1863, '<td valign="top">CONGRATS!<br/> <br/>I''m so pleased for you. It seems that AZ is such a great place to get desolation shots :) *winks*<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote, but this would have gotten a 10+ from me!<br/> <br/>well done, <br/>Annida</td>', 'CONGRATS! I''m so pleased for you. It seems that AZ is such a great place to get desolation shots :) *winks* I didn''t vote, but this would have gotten a 10+ from me! well done, Annida', '2003-08-20 15:32:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(394650, 32660, 9895, '<td valign="top">thank you very much for all your comments. this was first attempt in submitting a picture. All your comments made me more determined to take a much better shot. Once again thanks for taking time and giving all the reviews. Well for one thing i couldnt focus on the moon. it was on maximum zoom level. anyways will try ot do better next time. <br/></td>', 'thank you very much for all your comments. this was first attempt in submitting a picture. All your comments made me more determined to take a much better shot. Once again thanks for taking time and giving all the reviews. Well for one thing i couldnt focus on the moon. it was on maximum zoom level. anyways will try ot do better next time. ', '2003-08-20 15:53:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(394842, 32774, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry this didn''t rate higher as it''s my very favourite of all the entries. I guess everyone didn''t feel as strongly as I did about it. I really think it''s so evocative.</td>', 'I''m sorry this didn''t rate higher as it''s my very favourite of all the entries. I guess everyone didn''t feel as strongly as I did about it. I really think it''s so evocative.', '2003-08-20 18:16:59.000000', NULL, 0),
