(406857, 32832, 1647, '<td valign="top">I really like the colour of this shot.  The dark clouds on the left really bring attention to the building on the right.  Many people commented on the horizon - remember you can fix this in your graphics software normally if you get it wrong on location (I know because I normalluy get it wrong slightly).  Well done.</td>', 'I really like the colour of this shot.  The dark clouds on the left really bring attention to the building on the right.  Many people commented on the horizon - remember you can fix this in your graphics software normally if you get it wrong on location (I know because I normalluy get it wrong slightly).  Well done.', '2003-09-02 02:39:13.000000', NULL, 0),
